L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts anybody in your group who is missing your |cffffd100%s|r -- or who has just buffed you -- on a small prompt. Clicking the prompt casts it."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r 會把缺少你的|cffffd100%s|r、或剛為你加了增益的隊友放到一個小提示框上。點擊提示框就會施放。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts anybody in your group who is missing your |cffffd100buff|r -- or who has just buffed you -- on a small prompt. Clicking the prompt casts it."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r 會把缺少你的|cffffd100增益|r、或剛為你加了增益的隊友放到一個小提示框上。點擊提示框就會施放。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts anybody who buffs you -- and any stranger nearby who is missing one of yours -- on a small prompt. Clicking the prompt buffs them."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r 會把為你加增益的人，以及附近缺少你某個增益的路人，放到一個小提示框上。點擊提示框就會為對方加增益。"
L["The one thing that is not automatic: |cffffd100/manners macro|r or |cffffd100Make a macro|r in the options makes a macro for your bars, or bind a key under Options > Keybindings > Manners."] = "唯一需要你動手的事：輸入 |cffffd100/manners macro|r，或點擊選項中的|cffffd100建立巨集|r，就能建立放在快捷列上的巨集；也可以在「選項 > 按鍵設定 > Manners」中設定按鍵。"
L["|cffff8080It is switched off on this profile|r, so no prompt will appear -- |cffffd100/manners on|r when you want it."] = "|cffff8080此設定檔已將它關閉|r，所以不會出現提示框——需要時請輸入 |cffffd100/manners on|r。"
L["The prompt is on screen now, with somebody real on it already. |cffffd100/manners welcome|r brings this back."] = "提示框現在就在畫面上，上面已經有真實的人選。輸入 |cffffd100/manners welcome|r 可以再看一次這段說明。"
