L["copy these settings as one line of text"] = "將這些設定複製為一行文字"
L["use settings somebody exported, or undo the last import"] = "使用別人匯出的設定，或復原上次匯入"
L["what your class and this build allow"] = "你的職業和此遊戲版本支援哪些功能"
L["the last few things that broke"] = "最近發生的幾個錯誤"
L["tools for testing the addon on this client: the click log, try, look and forms"] = "在此客戶端測試插件的工具：點擊記錄、try、look 和 forms"
L["log what the button does when clicked"] = "記錄按鈕被點擊時做了什麼"
L["run any macro text from the prompt"] = "從提示框執行任意巨集文字"
L["dump every API answer for a unit"] = "列出某個單位的所有 API 回應"
L["example macros to try"] = "可以試用的巨集範例"
L["Manners commands:"] = "Manners 指令："
L["|cffffd100/mnr|r works in place of |cffffd100/manners|r in all of them."] = "以上所有指令都可以用 |cffffd100/mnr|r 代替 |cffffd100/manners|r。"
L["|cffff8080own buffs: last scan not believed (%s)|r -- %d read, baseline %d"] = "|cffff8080自身增益：上次掃描結果不可信（%s）|r——讀到%d個，基準%d個"
L["|cffffd100own buffs: baseline not settled|r -- %d read, waiting for a second scan to agree"] = "|cffffd100自身增益：基準尚未確立|r——讀到%d個，等待第二次掃描確認"
L["own buffs: %d read, baseline %d"] = "自身增益：讀到%d個，基準%d個"
L["%d changes to your auras this session, read in %d walks"] = "本次會話你的光環變化了%d次，共讀取%d輪"
L["thank with an emote: |cff00ff00on|r"] = "用表情動作道謝：|cff00ff00開啟|r"
L["thank with an emote: |cffff0000off|r"] = "用表情動作道謝：|cffff0000關閉|r"
L["last thanked: |cffffffff%s|r, %ds ago (the game answered %s)"] = "上次道謝：|cffffffff%s|r，%d秒前（遊戲回應：%s）"
L["last not thanked: |cffffffff%s|r, %ds ago (%s)"] = "上次未道謝：|cffffffff%s|r，%d秒前（%s）"
L["try cleared -- the normal cast takes effect when this fight ends; until then a press runs the macro already on the button."] = "try 巨集已清除——一般施法會在這場戰鬥結束後生效；在那之前按下按鈕，執行的仍是按鈕上現有的巨集。"
L["try cleared -- back to the normal cast."] = "try 巨集已清除——恢復一般施法。"
L["try armed: |cff80ff80%s|r"] = "try 巨集已就緒：|cff80ff80%s|r"
L["|cffff8080not armed for now:|r %s."] = "|cffff8080暫時未就緒：|r%s。"
L["expands to: |cffffffff%s|r"] = "展開為：|cffffffff%s|r"
L["%d characters -- %d over the %d a macro body holds. The client will cut it, and what runs is not what is printed above."] = "%d個字元——比巨集內容上限多出%d個（上限為%d）。客戶端會截斷它，實際執行的不會是上面顯示的內容。"
L["It takes effect when this fight ends; until then a press runs the macro already on the button. |cffffd100/manners try|r with nothing clears it."] = "它會在這場戰鬥結束後生效；在那之前按下按鈕，執行的仍是按鈕上現有的巨集。輸入不帶內容的 |cffffd100/manners try|r 可清除。"
L["The prompt arms it once they have one. |cffffd100/manners try|r with nothing clears it."] = "等對方有了單位標記，提示框就會把它設為就緒。輸入不帶內容的 |cffffd100/manners try|r 可清除。"
L["Click the prompt to run it. |cffffd100/manners try|r with nothing clears it."] = "點擊提示框即可執行。輸入不帶內容的 |cffffd100/manners try|r 可清除。"
L["Targeting forms, for /manners try:"] = "目標指定寫法，供 /manners try 使用："
L["(on yourself)"] = "（對自己）"
L["Tokens: |cffffd100{unit} {name} {aim} {first} {spell} {id}|r. {name} is what a debt is filed under, {aim} is what a targeting line wants. Use \\n for a new line."] = "變數：|cffffd100{unit} {name} {aim} {first} {spell} {id}|r。{name} 是記錄人情時用的名字，{aim} 是目標指定行要用的寫法。用 \\n 換行。"
L["the favour ledger did not load -- reinstalling Manners should bring it back."] = "人情帳本沒有載入——重新安裝 Manners 應該就能恢復。"
L["unlocked -- it can be dragged once this fight ends; until then a press still casts what the fight froze. Then |cffffd100/manners lock|r."] = "已解鎖——這場戰鬥結束後就能拖曳；在那之前按下按鈕，施放的仍是戰鬥凍結的內容。拖好後輸入 |cffffd100/manners lock|r。"
L["unlocked -- it can be dragged once this fight ends; nothing is armed meanwhile. Then |cffffd100/manners lock|r."] = "已解鎖——這場戰鬥結束後就能拖曳；在那之前沒有就緒的巨集。拖好後輸入 |cffffd100/manners lock|r。"
L["unlocked -- drag the prompt, then |cffffd100/manners lock|r."] = "已解鎖——拖曳提示框，然後輸入 |cffffd100/manners lock|r。"
L["unlocked, but the addon is |cffff8080off|r so there is no prompt to drag -- |cffffd100/manners on|r first."] = "已解鎖，但插件目前|cffff8080已關閉|r，沒有提示框可以拖曳——請先輸入 |cffffd100/manners on|r。"
L["locked."] = "已鎖定。"
L["hand your target back after buffing: |cff00ff00on|r -- takes effect when this fight ends; until then a press runs the macro already on the button."] = "施放後切回原目標：|cff00ff00開啟|r——這場戰鬥結束後生效；在那之前按下按鈕，執行的仍是按鈕上現有的巨集。"
L["hand your target back after buffing: |cffff0000off|r -- takes effect when this fight ends; until then a press runs the macro already on the button."] = "施放後切回原目標：|cffff0000關閉|r——這場戰鬥結束後生效；在那之前按下按鈕，執行的仍是按鈕上現有的巨集。"
L["hand your target back after buffing: |cff00ff00on|r"] = "施放後切回原目標：|cff00ff00開啟|r"
L["hand your target back after buffing: |cffff0000off|r"] = "施放後切回原目標：|cffff0000關閉|r"
L["click logging: |cff00ff00on|r"] = "點擊記錄：|cff00ff00開啟|r"
L["click logging: |cffff0000off|r"] = "點擊記錄：|cffff0000關閉|r"
L["verbose: |cff00ff00on|r -- a line in your own chat when somebody buffs you, when a favour is counted as repaid, and when a click fails, is skipped, or leaves somebody owed"] = "詳細訊息：|cff00ff00開啟|r——有人為你加增益、人情算作已還，以及點擊失敗、被略過或仍欠著人情時，會在你自己的聊天框顯示一行訊息"
L["verbose: |cffff0000off|r"] = "詳細訊息：|cffff0000關閉|r"
L["enabled."] = "已啟用。"
L["disabled."] = "已停用。"
L["nobody is on your never-offer list. Shift-right-click the prompt to put whoever it is showing on it."] = "你的永不提供名單上沒有人。Shift+右鍵點擊提示框，就能把目前顯示的人加入名單。"
L["never offered anything unless they buff you: %s"] = "永不提供（除非對方為你加增益）：%s"
L["say who: |cffffd100/manners allow Name|r. |cffffd100/manners never|r lists everybody on the list."] = "請指定對象：|cffffd100/manners allow Name|r。輸入 |cffffd100/manners never|r 可列出名單上的所有人。"
L["|cffffffff%s|r can be offered again."] = "又可以為|cffffffff%s|r提供增益了。"
L["nobody called %s is on your never-offer list."] = "你的永不提供名單上沒有叫%s的人。"
L["snooze takes a number of minutes from 1 to %d, or off -- for example |cffffd100/manners snooze 15|r or |cffffd100/manners snooze 1h|r."] = "snooze 需要1到%d之間的分鐘數，或 off——例如 |cffffd100/manners snooze 15|r 或 |cffffd100/manners snooze 1h|r。"
L["your settings are in the box under |cffffd100Share as text|r on the Profiles tab of the options -- click in it, select all and copy."] = "你的設定在選項「設定檔」分頁的|cffffd100以文字分享|r下方輸入框中——點進去，全選後複製。"
L["this string is too long to be imported back -- a very long phrase box under What I say is the usual cause. Shorten it if you want to share these settings."] = "這個字串太長，無法再匯入——通常是因為「我說的話」分頁中的台詞框寫得太長。如果想分享這些設定，請把台詞縮短。"
L["paste the settings string into the box under |cffffd100Share as text|r on the Profiles tab, or type |cffffd100/manners import|r followed by it."] = "把設定字串貼到「設定檔」分頁中|cffffd100以文字分享|r下方的輸入框，或輸入 |cffffd100/manners import|r 後接上字串。"
L["type |cffffd100/manners import|r followed by a settings string."] = "輸入 |cffffd100/manners import|r 後接上設定字串。"
L["Tools for testing Manners on this client:"] = "在此客戶端測試 Manners 的工具："
L["nothing has broken this session."] = "本次登入沒有發生任何錯誤。"
L["|cffffd100the last %d of %d|r |cff808080(%d kept)|r:"] = "|cffffd100最近%d筆，共%d筆|r|cff808080（保留%d筆）|r："
L["|cffffd100the last %d of %d|r:"] = "|cffffd100最近%d筆，共%d筆|r："
L["Flavour.lua did not load -- check the toc's file list"] = "Flavour.lua 沒有載入——請檢查 toc 的檔案清單"
L["your own buff: not offered -- %s is switched off."] = "自身增益：不提供——%s已關閉。"
L["switched OFF on this profile -- nothing is recorded or offered; /manners on"] = "此設定檔已關閉——不記錄也不提供任何東西；/manners on"
L["|cffff4040this client has never heard of %s|r -- Manners has the wrong spell ids for %s on %s. Please report this line."] = "|cffff4040此客戶端不認得 %s|r——Manners 為 %s 設定的法術 ID 在 %s 上有誤。請回報這一行。"
L["owes returning: |cffffffff%s|r (%ds left, buffed you %ds ago)"] = "待還：|cffffffff%s|r（剩%d秒，%d秒前為你加了增益）"
L["not watching for favours -- Manners is switched off."] = "沒有在留意人情——Manners 已關閉。"
L["Favours are not recorded while \"People who buff me\" is off, on the Who to buff tab."] = "「增益對象」分頁的「為我加增益的人」關閉時，不會記錄人情。"
L["not watching for favours -- |cffffd100People who buff me|r is switched off."] = "沒有在留意人情——|cffffd100為我加增益的人|r已關閉。"
L["nobody has buffed you recently."] = "最近沒有人為你加增益。"
L["your own buff: offered to you when you are missing it."] = "自身增益：你缺少時會提供給你。"
L["your own buff: nothing you cast goes on yourself alone."] = "自身增益：你施放的法術沒有能只加在你一人身上的。"
L["prompt is UNLOCKED -- it will not buff anyone until you /manners lock"] = "提示框已解鎖——在你輸入 /manners lock 之前，不會為任何人加增益"
L["|cffffd100snoozed until %s|r -- no prompt until then; /manners snooze off ends it"] = "|cffffd100暫停至%s|r——在那之前不會出現提示框；/manners snooze off 可結束暫停"
L["|cffffd100mounted|r -- Not while mounted keeps the prompt away until you get off"] = "|cffffd100騎乘坐騎中|r——「騎乘時不顯示」會讓提示框在你下坐騎前都不出現"
L["|cffffd100saving mana|r -- until you are back to %d%% mana, only your own buff and people who buffed you or asked are offered"] = "|cffffd100保留法力中|r——法力回到%d%%之前，只會提供你自己的增益，以及為你加過增益或向你要增益的人"
L["|cffffd100saving mana|r -- until you are back to %d%% mana, only people who buffed you or asked are offered"] = "|cffffd100保留法力中|r——法力回到%d%%之前，只會提供給為你加過增益或向你要增益的人"
L["|cffffd100ready check|r -- your party or raid comes first until the pull"] = "|cffffd100就位確認|r——開怪前，你的隊伍或團隊優先"
L["|cffffd100raid groups|r -- in a raid, only groups %s are offered unasked"] = "|cffffd100團隊小隊|r——在團隊中，只會主動提供給小隊%s"
L["|cffffd100raid groups|r -- every group is unticked, so in a raid nobody is offered unasked"] = "|cffffd100團隊小隊|r——所有小隊都未勾選，所以在團隊中不會主動為任何人提供增益"
L["|cffff8080/manners try is armed:|r %s -- clear it with a bare /manners try"] = "|cffff8080/manners try 已就緒：|r%s——輸入不帶內容的 /manners try 可清除"
L["queue now: %d"] = "目前佇列：%d"
L["queue if switched on: %d"] = "開啟後的佇列：%d"
L["there is no |cffffd100/manners %s|r -- did you mean |cffffd100/manners %s|r? |cffffd100/manners help|r lists them all."] = "沒有 |cffffd100/manners %s|r 這個指令——你是指 |cffffd100/manners %s|r 嗎？輸入 |cffffd100/manners help|r 可列出所有指令。"
L["there is no |cffffd100/manners %s|r -- did you mean |cffffd100/manners %s|r? |cffffd100/manners dev|r lists the testing tools."] = "沒有 |cffffd100/manners %s|r 這個指令——你是指 |cffffd100/manners %s|r 嗎？輸入 |cffffd100/manners dev|r 可列出測試工具。"
L["Thank ye kindly, {name}! First round's on me when we're back at the forge."] = "多謝啦，{name}！回熔爐頭一杯俺請！"
L["Much obliged, {name}. Ye've a friend in the mountain now."] = "夠意思，{name}！山裡從此有你這朋友！"
L["Thank ye, {name}! I'd have been fine without it, mind. But thank ye."] = "謝啦，{name}！沒這個俺也行，真的！但還是謝啦。"
L["Bless ye, {name}! I'd hug ye, but ye'd be needin' a healer after."] = "好人哪，{name}！想抱你一下，但抱完你得找補師。"
L["Paid back already, {name}. Quicker than I've ever settled a bar tab."] = "這就還你了，{name}。俺酒帳都沒還這麼快！"
L["I'll tell this at the Thunderbrew like ye saved me life, {name}. Thank ye!"] = "謝啦，{name}！回雷酒釀酒廠俺就說你救了俺的命！"
L["Grand, {name}! I'd carve ye a statue, but this is quicker."] = "好樣的，{name}！想給你雕像，這個比較快。"
L["The Titans made us of stone, {name}, but that still touched me. Thank ye."] = "泰坦造的鐵石心腸，{name}，也被你融了。謝啦！"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Back at ye, before me pride notices I needed it."] = "謝啦，{name}！趁俺的自尊心還沒醒，快還你。"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Muradin says a debt left unpaid rusts. Here, before it does."] = "穆拉丁說人情放著會生鏽，{name}。趁沒鏽，還你！"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Even me ram looked impressed, and he hates everybody."] = "謝啦，{name}！連俺的山羊都服了，牠可是誰都討厭。"
L["The Explorers' League'll ask where ye dug up such manners, {name}. Thanks!"] = "謝啦，{name}！出土級的禮數，探險者協會會來搶。"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Warmed me right down to me boots, that did."] = "謝啦，{name}！一路暖到俺的靴子底。"
L["Mined half o' Khaz Modan, {name}. Never struck a vein that rich. Yer cut."] = "挖遍卡茲莫丹，{name}，沒見過這麼富的礦。分你！"
L["Like a Kharanos hearth in a Dun Morogh blizzard, that, {name}. Thank ye."] = "像丹莫洛雪夜裡卡拉諾斯的爐火，{name}。謝啦！"
L["Came back to ye like a Wildhammer's stormhammer, {name}. Less painful, mind."] = "像蠻錘的風暴之錘飛回來，{name}。放心，不會暈。"
L["Come to Ironforge, {name}. Me mam'll feed ye till ye can't stand. Thank ye!"] = "謝啦！來鐵爐堡，{name}，俺娘會餵到你站不起來。"
L["Checked it fer gunpowder out o' habit, {name}. Clean as a whistle. Here's yers!"] = "職業病，先查過有沒有火藥，{name}。乾淨！還你！"
L["Aye, {name}, ye only had to ask. Hold still now, like a good anvil."] = "好咧，{name}，開口就成！站穩，像塊好鐵砧。"
L["Say no more, {name}. Stone and steel, here it comes."] = "甭多說，{name}！岩石與鋼鐵，接著！"
L["Ask a dwarf fer help, {name}, and ye'll get it. Loudly."] = "矮人有求必應，{name}。很大聲地應。"
L["Right, {name}. Brace yerself; I do everything like I'm swingin' a hammer."] = "好，{name}，站穩了！俺幹啥都像在掄大錘。"
L["Aye, {name}, and a story about it ye didn't ask fer. Where to begin..."] = "好咧，{name}，還附個你沒問的故事。話說當年……"
L["One {buff}, pulled fresh like a proper pint, {name}."] = "現打{buff}一杯，{name}，新鮮如生啤！"
L["Done, {name}. Dwarven work: over-built, under-priced and guaranteed."] = "好了，{name}！矮人出品，料多價廉還保固！"
L["Easy, {name}. Last time I helped a gnome, it cost me both eyebrows."] = "小事，{name}。上回幫地精的忙，賠上俺兩道眉毛。"
L["Aye, {name}. Mountain kings never refuse. I'm more a foothill, but same rule."] = "{name}，山丘之王從不說不。俺是小土丘，照辦！"
L["Tempered and quenched, {name}. Mind, it's still hot."] = "千錘百鍊，剛淬好，{name}。小心燙！"
L["Done afore ye finished, {name}. Dwarves hear 'please' through solid rock."] = "「請」字還沒說完就好了，{name}。矮人隔岩有耳！"
L["Aye, {name}. In Dun Morogh ye help quick, or ye both freeze standin' there."] = "好咧，{name}！丹莫洛幫人要快，不然倆都凍成冰。"
L["Aye, {name}. Ye'll feel it in yer boots first. That's how ye know it's dwarven."] = "好咧，{name}！腳底先發麻，這才是矮人出品。"
L["Aye, {name}. Say no, and ye'd ask a gnome, and then I'd feel responsible."] = "好咧，{name}！俺不幫，你就找地精了。罪過罪過。"
L["Here, {name}, a wee somethin' to keep ye on yer feet. Wee, like me."] = "來，{name}，小小心意讓你站穩腳。小，跟俺一樣！"
L["Off ye go, {name}, steady as the mountain."] = "去吧，{name}，穩如磐石！"
L["Here, {name}. Ale's for after; this is for before."] = "開打前用這個，{name}。麥酒打完再喝！"
L["Magni turned to diamond fer the cause, {name}. This is the cheaper option."] = "麥格尼為了大業變成鑽石，{name}，這是平價版。"
L["A dwarf's got yer back, {name}. Well, yer knees. Close enough."] = "有矮人給你撐腰，{name}。呃，撐膝蓋。差不多啦！"
L["If a trogg bothers ye, {name}, tell it a dwarf sent ye. Then run."] = "穴居人找碴，{name}，就報矮人的名號。然後快跑！"
L["If it wears off, {name}, give it a good thump. That's how we fix everything."] = "{name}，失效了就猛敲一下，俺們啥都這麼修！"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd give ye some stubbornness too, but I'm usin' all mine."] = "拿著，{name}。倔脾氣不分你，俺自己都不夠用！"
L["Mind the wendigos, {name}: big, hairy and grumpy. Like me, but hungrier."] = "小心雪怪，{name}：又大又毛又兇。像俺，但更餓。"
L["Take this, {name}. Me grandad fought three wars with a pickaxe and this."] = "拿著，{name}。俺爺爺憑礦鎬和這個打過三場仗。"
L["Dwarven make, {name}. Drop it off Thandol Span and it'd still work. Don't."] = "矮人出品，{name}，薩多爾大橋丟下去也行。別試。"
L["Stonewrought Dam holds back a whole loch, {name}. This'll hold ye together."] = "大壩擋得住整座湖，{name}。這個保你不散架。"
L["Won't keep yer boots dry in the Wetlands, {name}. Nothin' does. The rest, aye."] = "濕地裡靴子必濕，{name}，誰都沒轍。其他交給俺！"
L["Old miner's rule, {name}: never go down a hole without a lamp, a mate and this."] = "礦工規矩，{name}：下洞要帶燈、帶兄弟、帶這個。"
L["Brann Bronzebeard went explorin' with less, {name}, and wrote three books."] = "布萊恩·銅鬚帶得更少，{name}，照樣寫了三本書。"
L["Mountaineers swear by it, {name}. Ye'll climb no better, but land softer."] = "登山老手都掛保證，{name}。爬不更快，摔得更軟。"
L["Ironforge's gates have never fallen, {name}. Neither should ye. Take this."] = "鐵爐堡的大門從沒倒過，{name}，你也別倒。拿著！"
L["Me cousins down Blackrock way would've set it alight first, {name}. Fer luck."] = "黑石山的表親會先點把火再給，{name}。圖個吉利！"
L["Stone and hammer keep ye, cousin {name}!"] = "岩石與鐵錘保佑你，{name}兄弟！"
L["Three Hammers, one round, cousin {name}!"] = "三錘同心，俺請客，{name}兄弟！"
L["Yer cousin's cousin married mine, {name}, I'd wager. It's a small mountain."] = "{name}，俺表妹八成嫁給你表哥的表哥。山小嘛！"
L["Two dwarves together, {name}. Pity whatever's standin' in our way."] = "兩個矮人湊一塊，{name}。擋路的自求多福吧！"
L["Bronzebeard, Wildhammer, Dark Iron, Earthen, {name}: one family, nobody agrees."] = "銅鬚、蠻錘、黑鐵、土靈，{name}：一家人吵不停。"
L["Between the pair of us, {name}, we could out-stubborn a mountain."] = "咱倆的倔勁加起來，{name}，山都拗不過！"
L["Me grandmother'd climb out of her tomb if I did any less fer kin, {name}."] = "對族人小氣，{name}，俺奶奶會從墳裡爬出來！"
L["The Titans carved us both from the same rock, {name}. Explains the headaches."] = "泰坦拿同塊石頭刻咱倆，{name}，難怪都石頭腦袋！"
L["Kin's kin, {name}, far from the mountain or under it."] = "親人就是親人，{name}，離山再遠，或就住在山底下。"
L["Stand behind me, {name}. Aye, I know. Crouch a bit."] = "躲俺後面，{name}。對，俺知道。蹲低點。"
L["Right, {name}: I take the front, ye take the loot, and we argue after."] = "好，{name}：俺打頭陣，你撿寶，打完再吵！"
L["If I start singin', {name}, the fight's gone well. Or very badly."] = "俺要是開唱，{name}，不是打得很順，就是很慘。"
L["Dwarves never leave a mate behind, {name}. Nor a keg, come to that."] = "矮人不丟下兄弟，{name}。說起來，酒桶也不丟。"
L["Beards out, {name}! Them without beards, look fierce. It's nearly as good."] = "亮鬍子，{name}！沒鬍子的擺個兇臉，也差不多。"
L["Knocked on the nearest rock, {name}. Solid. No cave-ins fer us today."] = "敲過旁邊的石頭，{name}。紮實，今天不會坍方。"
L["No fires near me pack, {name}. It's mostly gunpowder. And a sandwich."] = "背包旁別生火，{name}。大半是火藥。還有三明治。"
L["Dwarves don't retreat, {name}. Our legs aren't built fer it."] = "矮人不撤退，{name}。俺們的腿天生不會往後走。"
L["Stay close, {name}. If it goes dark, follow the cursin'. That'll be me."] = "跟緊，{name}。燈滅了就跟著罵聲走，那就是俺。"
L["Dwarves always know which way is down, {name}. Up's yer problem."] = "矮人永遠知道哪邊是下，{name}。往上？你的事。"
L["Anythin' made o' stone, {name}, let me talk to it first. Might be a cousin."] = "石頭做的，{name}，讓俺先聊聊。搞不好是親戚。"
L["If the ceilin' creaks, {name}, I'll tell ye. If I go quiet, run."] = "頂上一響，{name}，俺會喊。俺要是沒聲了，快跑！"
L["Mornin', {name}! Too early for ale. Almost. Have this first."] = "早，{name}！喝麥酒還太早。大概吧。先來這個！"
L["Up with the forge fires, {name}! A dwarf's day starts with a hammer and this."] = "{name}，爐火已旺！矮人一天從掄錘和這個開始。"
L["Early, {name}? Nonsense. The mine's been open two hours. Here."] = "早？胡說，{name}，礦坑都開工兩小時了。拿去！"
L["Mornin', {name}. Me eyes are still abed. The rest o' me's ready."] = "早，{name}。俺眼睛還賴在床上，其餘全醒了！"
L["Mornin', {name}. Porridge, a pipe and this. The other two are mine."] = "早，{name}。燕麥粥、菸斗、這個。前兩樣是俺的。"
L["The rams had me up at dawn, {name}. Headbutted the door till I came out. Here."] = "山羊一早撞門，{name}，撞到俺出來為止。拿去！"
L["Mornin', {name}. Ears still ringin' from last night's singin'. Here."] = "早，{name}。昨晚唱太嗨，耳朵還在嗡嗡響。拿去！"
L["My thanks, {name}. Let me return the kindness before a bard gets it wrong."] = "多謝，{name}。趁吟遊詩人還沒唱錯，先還你人情。"
L["Kindly done, {name}. Let no one say we forget a friend."] = "有心了，{name}。我們從不忘記朋友。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd knight you, but apparently I 'need permission'."] = "謝了，{name}。想封你當騎士，據說我「沒權限」。"
L["Repaid on the spot, {name}. In Stormwind that'd take three forms and a stamp."] = "當場還你，{name}。在暴風城得填三張表再蓋章。"
L["Thanks, {name}. Prompter than Stormwind ever paid its stonemasons."] = "謝了，{name}。比暴風城付石匠工錢快多了。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. Mother said always return a kindness. And the dish."] = "感激不盡，{name}。我媽說人情要還，碗也要還。"
L["Thank you, {name}. In Elwynn, no kindness goes home unanswered."] = "謝謝，{name}。在艾爾文森林，好意從不空手而歸。"
L["You shame me, {name}; I should have thought of it first. Allow me."] = "慚愧，{name}，該我先想到的。容我回敬。"
L["Heartier than Westfall Stew, {name}, and I've wept over that stew. Thank you."] = "暖過西部荒野燉肉，{name}，那燉肉我吃到哭過。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll tell Marshal Dughan. He won't care, but I'll tell him."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會跟杜漢元帥說，他不在乎也說。"
L["Job's done, {name}! My grandad built half of Stormwind saying that. Thanks."] = "工作完成，{name}！我爺爺喊這句蓋了半座暴風城。"
L["Lakeshire will finish its bridge before I forget this, {name}. So, never."] = "湖畔鎮的橋蓋好前，{name}，我忘不了。等於永遠。"
L["Kul Tirans say a kindness goes back on the next tide, {name}. There it goes."] = "庫爾提拉斯人說人情隨潮還，{name}。潮來了！"
L["Thank you, {name}. Northshire's brothers would call that the Light at work."] = "謝謝，{name}。北郡修士會說，這是聖光的作為。"
L["Not since Mum packed my lunches, {name}, have I felt so looked after. Thanks."] = "自從媽媽幫我帶便當，{name}，就沒人這樣照顧我了。謝謝。"
L["Into my memoirs, {name}. Chapter nine: 'Everyone Was Lovely'. Thank you."] = "寫進回憶錄第九章，{name}：「大家人都很好」。"
L["I'll toast you at the Pig and Whistle, {name}. Then the pig. Then the whistle."] = "豬與哨子酒館裡敬你，{name}。然後敬豬、敬哨子。"
L["Of course, {name}. Hold still and look heroic; it helps the bards."] = "當然，{name}。擺個英雄姿勢，吟遊詩人好寫歌。"
L["Right away, {name}. Keep your shield high."] = "馬上來，{name}。盾牌舉高！"
L["More work? Gladly, {name}. It beats the lumber mill."] = "又有工作？樂意，{name}。總比伐木場強。"
L["Of course, {name}. Humans excel at helping and overpromising. This is helping."] = "當然，{name}。人類擅長幫忙和開支票，這是幫忙。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Westfall farm manners: you help first and ask why later."] = "當然，{name}。西部荒野農家規矩：先幫忙，再問為什麼。"
L["Hold still, {name}, like a statue in the Valley of Heroes. You'd fit right in."] = "別動，{name}，像英雄谷的雕像。你擺那兒剛好！"
L["Right away, {name}. The Light helps those who ask. So do I, and I'm quicker."] = "馬上，{name}。聖光有求必應，我也是，還更快。"
L["Sailors' rule, {name}: somebody calls for help, you row. Here."] = "水手守則，{name}：有人喊救命，就划過去。給你！"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand up straight; my old sergeant is watching, somewhere."] = "當然，{name}。站直！我的老士官長不知在哪盯著。"
L["Of course, {name}. A polite request is rarer than a quiet night in Duskwood."] = "當然，{name}。客氣的人比暮色森林的靜夜還稀有。"
L["Right away, {name}. I'll play the Archbishop; you pretend to be impressed."] = "馬上，{name}。我來扮大主教，你負責假裝很佩服。"
L["Step out of the shade, {name}; I like to see where I'm aiming."] = "從陰影裡出來，{name}，我想看清楚瞄哪裡。"
L["Stormwind rose from rubble, {name}. I can manage one {buff}."] = "暴風城都能從廢墟重建，{name}，區區{buff}算什麼。"
L["Of course, {name}. Last one I did was a Westfall scarecrow. Long story."] = "當然，{name}。上個是西部荒野稻草人。說來話長。"
L["Aye, {name}. Kul Tiran terms: a handshake, and I spare you the shanty."] = "行，{name}。庫爾提拉斯規矩：握個手，船歌免了。"
L["The road ahead is long, {name}. This won't shorten it, but it'll help."] = "前路漫漫，{name}。路不會變短，但會好走點。"
L["Fair winds and following seas, {name}."] = "風平浪靜，一帆風順，{name}。"
L["Take this, {name}. Elves have centuries to be generous; I've got fifty years."] = "{name}，精靈有幾百年慢慢大方，我只有五十年。"
L["A little something, {name}. Don't tell the guards; they'll all want one."] = "小意思，{name}。別跟衛兵說，他們都會想要。"
L["Here, {name}. If a kobold asks, you don't have a candle."] = "狗頭人問起，{name}，就說你沒拿蠟燭。"
L["For you, {name}. A human gift: well meant, hastily made, surprisingly sturdy."] = "給你，{name}。人類出品：好心、趕工、意外耐用。"
L["Mind the murlocs, {name}. Take this; I've seen what they do to a picnic."] = "小心魚人，{name}。拿著，我見過牠們掃蕩野餐。"
L["Every road needs a hero, {name}. Today it's me, apparently. Take this."] = "每條路都要有英雄，{name}。今天好像是我。拿著！"
L["Stay out of Duskwood after dark, {name}. It's always dark. Take this."] = "天黑別進暮色森林，{name}。那裡永遠天黑。拿著。"
L["Redridge gnolls take anything not nailed down, {name}. This is nailed down."] = "赤脊山豺狼人沒釘牢的都搶，{name}。這個釘牢了。"
L["If you meet Hogger, {name}, take this and a friend. Mostly the friend."] = "遇到霍格，{name}，帶上這個和朋友。主要是朋友。"
L["The Light and a good pair of boots, {name}. Now you've got one of them."] = "出門靠聖光和好靴子，{name}。這下你有一樣了。"
L["Every hero in Stormwind began with a kindness and a borrowed sword, {name}."] = "暴風城英雄都起於善意和借來的劍，{name}。"
L["Here, {name}. The Defias can't steal this one. They've tried everything else."] = "給你，{name}。迪菲亞偷不走這個。其他全偷過了。"
L["Uther blessed strangers on the road, {name}. I've less hammer, same idea."] = "烏瑟常為路人祝福，{name}。我錘子小，心意一樣。"
L["Take this, {name}. Goldshire custom: no traveller leaves empty-handed."] = "拿著，{name}。閃金鎮的規矩：旅人不空手離開。"
L["The wolves in Elwynn look friendly, {name}. They are not. Take this."] = "艾爾文森林的狼看著友善，{name}。才怪。拿著！"
L["Arathor's children stand together, {name}."] = "阿拉索的子孫同氣連枝，{name}。"
L["A fellow human, {name}! Quick, let's found a kingdom before lunch."] = "同是人類，{name}！快，午餐前建個王國吧！"
L["Stormwind or Boralus, {name}, we'll both complain about the weather."] = "暴風城或伯拉勒斯，{name}，我們都愛抱怨天氣。"
L["Human to human, {name}: no, I don't know why everything happens to us either."] = "{name}，別問我為啥什麼事都找上人類。我也不懂！"
L["Short lives, long to-do lists, {name}. We humans must help each other along."] = "人生苦短，待辦超長，{name}。人類得互相幫忙。"
L["Stormwind stone or Kul Tiran oak, {name}, we outlast everyone's expectations."] = "暴風城石、庫爾提拉斯木，{name}，都比預期耐用。"
L["Humans stick together, {name}. Everyone else is taller, older or furrier."] = "人類要團結，{name}。別人不是高、老，就是毛。"
L["Our lot built half the world on bread, stubbornness and bad luck, {name}."] = "人類靠麵包、死硬和衰運撐起半個世界，{name}。"
L["Don't tell the dwarves, {name}, but it was us humans who invented the tavern."] = "別跟矮人說，{name}，酒館其實是我們人類發明的。"
L["Keep close, {name}. Humans have always won by outnumbering things."] = "跟緊點，{name}。人類打贏靠的一向是人多。"
L["Stay in formation, {name}. We haven't got one, but stay in it anyway."] = "保持陣形，{name}。我們沒有陣形，但照樣要保持。"
L["I'll draw up a plan, {name}, and then we can all ignore it together."] = "我來擬個計畫，{name}，然後大家一起無視它。"
L["Every hero in the songs had friends, {name}. Nobody sings about them. I will."] = "英雄背後都有夥伴，{name}。沒人歌頌他們，我來。"
L["Shields up, {name}. Stormwind taught me to march; nobody taught me to stop."] = "舉盾，{name}。暴風城教會我行軍，沒教我停。"
L["If this goes badly, {name}, we regroup at the nearest inn. Human tactics."] = "苗頭不對，{name}，就到最近旅店集合。人類戰術。"
L["I've made us a flag, {name}. It's a handkerchief on a stick, but it's ours."] = "我們有旗了，{name}！手帕綁棍子，但是我們的！"
L["Keep a torch lit, {name}. Humans can't see in the dark, and we hate it."] = "火把別熄，{name}。人類在黑暗中看不見，超討厭。"
L["Watch my back, {name}; I'll watch yours. The Light has the rest. Better view."] = "互顧背後，{name}。其餘交給聖光，它視野比較好。"
L["Humans always rise to the occasion, {name}. Usually after tripping over it."] = "人類總能迎難而上，{name}。通常是先被它絆倒。"
L["Do this well, {name}. Some elf will be telling the story for a thousand years."] = "好好幹，{name}。會有精靈把這事講上一千年。"
L["Farmers, sailors, bakers, {name}: every army Stormwind ever raised. Onward!"] = "暴風城大軍：農夫、水手、麵包師，{name}。前進！"
L["Ishnu-alah, {name}. Returned the same day, which for a kaldorei is rushing."] = "Ishnu-alah，{name}。當天就還，對卡多雷來說已經很趕了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Elune smiles on the generous."] = "謝謝，{name}。伊露恩眷顧慷慨之人。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Even the wisps glow brighter, and they're hard to impress."] = "謝謝，{name}。連眼光很高的小精靈都亮了起來。"
L["Elune saw that, {name}. She sees everything, so I had best return it."] = "伊露恩看見了，{name}。她無所不見，我得趕快還。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Kindness planted, kindness grown. Here."] = "謝謝，{name}。種下善意，長出善意。給你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The Ancients will hear of this. They're dreadful gossips."] = "謝謝，{name}。這事古樹們都會知道，它們超八卦。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll tell the Sentinels to stop aiming at you."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會叫哨兵別再瞄準你了。"
L["My people never hurry, {name}. For you, an exception."] = "我族從不趕時間，{name}。為你破例一次。"
L["Ande'thoras-ethil, {name}. May your troubles be diminished, as mine just were."] = "Ande'thoras-ethil，{name}。願你煩惱漸消，如我剛剛。"
L["We gave up immortality at Hyjal, {name}. Kindness has been worth double since."] = "海加爾一戰捨了永生，{name}，善意從此加倍珍貴。"
L["My ears have gone a shade darker, {name}. Kaldorei blush there first."] = "我耳朵顏色深了點，{name}。卡多雷臉紅先紅耳朵。"
L["Azshara's court never gave a thing away, {name}. You've outdone a queen."] = "艾薩拉的宮廷一毛不拔，{name}。你比女王還大方。"
L["The owls turned their heads for that, {name}. All the way round. High praise."] = "貓頭鷹都轉過頭來，{name}。360度的讚賞！"
L["I outlived the Sundering, {name}. I'll not outlive a debt to you. Here."] = "熬過大分裂，{name}，卻熬不住欠你人情。還你。"
L["All those centuries of memories, {name}, and this one goes near the front."] = "這麼多世紀的回憶裡，{name}，這段排前面。"
L["I'll tell the moon about you tonight, {name}. She likes a good story."] = "今晚我會跟月亮說起你，{name}。她愛聽好故事。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Be still, and let the moonlight find you."] = "樂意之至，{name}。靜靜沐浴月光吧。"
L["Of course, {name}. Elune's blessings are meant to be shared."] = "當然，{name}。伊露恩的祝福本該分享。"
L["At last, {name}! I've waited ten thousand years for someone to ask."] = "終於，{name}！我等人開口等了一萬年。"
L["No riddle, no omen from Elune, {name}. Just a plain yes, for once."] = "不打啞謎也不問伊露恩，{name}。難得直接說好。"
L["Of course, {name}. Ask in Darnassian next time and I'll add a bow."] = "當然，{name}。下次用達納蘇斯語說，附贈鞠躬。"
L["Elune already said yes, {name}. I'm merely catching up."] = "伊露恩早就答應了，{name}。我只是跟上而已。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand still and pretend you're a tree. It helps."] = "當然，{name}。站好，假裝自己是棵樹，真的有用。"
L["Step into the light, {name}. The last kaldorei I did this for Shadowmelded."] = "站到亮處，{name}。上次那位卡多雷，直接影遁了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Ask a kaldorei anything, except how old we are."] = "當然，{name}。卡多雷什麼都能問，除了芳齡。"
L["In Darnassus, {name}, this takes a moonwell and a priestess. Out here, just me."] = "達納蘇斯要月井和女祭司，{name}。野外只有我。"
L["The last army to ask me for help was fighting demons, {name}. You're politer."] = "上個求我幫忙的是抗魔軍隊，{name}。你禮貌多了。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Consider it on loan from Elune. She's never once collected."] = "樂意，{name}。算向伊露恩借的，她從沒討過。"
L["One moment, {name}. My hair is older than most kingdoms, and it tangles."] = "稍等，{name}。我頭髮比多數王國還老，會打結。"
L["Darnassian has nine words for 'yes', {name}. I'll spare you eight of them."] = "達納蘇斯語「好」有九種，{name}。省你八種：好。"
L["Of course, {name}. The Sentinels would want a password. I'll accept 'please'."] = "當然，{name}。哨兵要口令，我只要一聲「請」。"
L["Elune-adore, {name}. Walk softly; the trees are light sleepers."] = "Elune-adore，{name}。腳步輕點，樹睡得很淺。"
L["May the forest shelter you, {name}, wherever you roam."] = "無論你去哪，願森林庇護你，{name}。"
L["A gift from the shadows, {name}. No, don't look. You won't find me."] = "來自暗影的禮物，{name}。別找了，你找不到我的。"
L["Elune lights your path, {name}. I'm merely holding the lantern."] = "伊露恩照亮你的路，{name}。我只是提燈的。"
L["The owls pointed you out, {name}. They have strong opinions. Here."] = "貓頭鷹指名要給你，{name}。牠們很有主見。拿著。"
L["Tyrande would insist, {name}, and nobody argues with Tyrande."] = "泰蘭妲會堅持的，{name}。沒人敢跟泰蘭妲吵。"
L["Take this, {name}. The last one went to a hippogryph. It was less grateful."] = "拿著，{name}。上次給角鷹獸，牠可沒這麼領情。"
L["Mind the wildlife, {name}. Half of it is a druid, and all of it is watching."] = "小心野獸，{name}。一半是德魯伊變的，全都在看。"
L["Walk with Elune, {name}. If she's busy, walk with this."] = "願伊露恩與你同行，{name}。她沒空就換這個陪你。"
L["Mind the satyrs, {name}. They were Highborne once. You can tell by the sneer."] = "小心薩特，{name}。那副嘴臉，一看就是上層精靈。"
L["The trees spoke well of you, {name}. I thought I'd add my word."] = "樹木都說你好話，{name}。我也來添一句。"
L["Most furbolgs are friendly, {name}. This is for the other ones."] = "熊怪大多很友善，{name}。這個是防另外那些的。"
L["Moonwell water would be better, {name}, but it travels badly. This doesn't."] = "月井水更好，{name}，但不好帶。這個好帶。"
L["A gift from Teldrassil, {name}. It's a long way down; I nearly dropped it."] = "泰達希爾帶下來的，{name}。好高，差點失手。"
L["I'd stay to chat, {name}, but kaldorei chats run to the next full moon. Here."] = "想多聊，{name}，但卡多雷一聊就到滿月。拿著。"
L["Bandu thoribas, {name}: prepare to fight. There. Now you're prepared."] = "Bandu thoribas，{name}：準備戰鬥。喏，準備好了。"
L["From the kaldorei, the moon and a very old tree, {name}. Mostly from me."] = "卡多雷、月亮和一棵老樹合送，{name}。主要是我。"
L["Ishnu-alah, {name}. Elune keeps her children close."] = "Ishnu-alah，{name}。伊露恩守護她的子民。"
L["Of course I saw you, {name}. It takes a kaldorei to spot a kaldorei."] = "當然看見你了，{name}。卡多雷才認得出卡多雷。"
L["Kaldorei to kaldorei, {name}: we gave up eternity, not each other."] = "同為卡多雷，{name}：我們放棄了永生，沒放棄彼此。"
L["A kaldorei never leaves kin in the dark, {name}. Unless it's for cover."] = "卡多雷不讓族人摸黑，{name}。要躲起來除外。"
L["Two kaldorei, {name}, and still no helmet made that fits either pair of ears."] = "兩個卡多雷，{name}，四隻耳朵，沒頭盔戴得下。"
L["Sentinel, druid or simply stubborn, {name}? I'm all three on a good night."] = "哨兵、德魯伊或純固執，{name}？我狀態好時全包。"
L["Between us, {name}, twenty thousand years of telling everyone 'we tried that'."] = "你我加起來兩萬年，{name}，全在說「那試過了」。"
L["Let's Shadowmeld together sometime, {name}, and see who notices."] = "哪天一起影遁吧，{name}，看誰會發現。"
L["Our shan'do sleeps in the Dream, {name}. Let's make his waking worth it."] = "導師沉睡在翡翠夢境，{name}。讓他醒來不虛此眠。"
L["Our people are thin on the ground, {name}, and very thick in the trees."] = "我族地上難得一見，{name}，樹上倒是一抓一把。"
L["Quick one, {name}? By kaldorei reckoning we'll be done before we start."] = "速戰速決？{name}，以卡多雷的時間感，眨眼就完。"
L["I'll be the one you can't see, {name}. That's not a mistake; that's the plan."] = "你看不見我的話，{name}，那不是失誤，是戰術。"
L["Elune watches the whole party, {name}. I'm just the one who waves at her."] = "伊露恩看顧著全隊，{name}。我只負責向她揮手。"
L["Ten thousand years of companions, {name}. You lot rank rather high."] = "一萬年來的旅伴裡，{name}，你們排名挺前面的。"
L["Stay close, {name}. We misplaced half a continent once. Not you, though."] = "跟緊，{name}。我們弄丟過半塊大陸，不能再丟你。"
L["If I fall, {name}, don't fret. I'll float about as a wisp, looking wise."] = "我倒下別慌，{name}。我會變小精靈，飄著裝睿智。"
L["I fought beside Neltharion once, {name}. You're already a better ally."] = "我曾與奈薩里奧並肩，{name}。你已經比他可靠。"
L["Follow me, {name}. I know these paths. They were a forest last time, mind."] = "跟我走，{name}。這路我熟，雖然上次還是森林。"
L["Should we fail, {name}, I'll remember you fondly for several thousand years."] = "要是失敗了，{name}，我會深情懷念你好幾千年。"
L["I've watched heroes charge in blind for millennia, {name}. Let's try eyes open."] = "看英雄瞎衝看了幾千年，{name}。這次睜眼衝吧。"
L["If anyone asks, {name}, we were always this good."] = "有人問，{name}，我們一向這麼強。"
L["I'll take first watch, {name}. And second. A kaldorei barely notices a night."] = "我守頭班，{name}，二班也是。卡多雷一夜像眨眼。"
L["The moon's up, {name}. For a kaldorei, this is the middle of the morning."] = "月亮出來了，{name}。對卡多雷來說，這才上午。"
L["Everyone sensible is asleep, {name}. Elune and I prefer it this way."] = "正常人都睡了，{name}。伊露恩和我就愛這樣。"
L["Elune's light is on you, {name}. Here's a second layer."] = "伊露恩的光照著你，{name}。這個再加一層。"
L["Dark at last, {name}. Now I see perfectly and everything else has to guess."] = "總算天黑，{name}。我看得一清二楚，別人只能猜。"
L["Same stars I saw ten thousand years ago, {name}. They've aged better than me."] = "一萬年前也是這片星空，{name}。它比我會保養。"
L["Moonrise, {name}. Every kaldorei just woke up a little, and got a little smug."] = "月亮升起，{name}。卡多雷都醒了點，也得意了點。"
L["Morning, {name}. My people slept through these for millennia. I'm adapting."] = "早安，{name}。我族錯過早晨幾千年了，還在適應。"
L["Dawn, {name}. Elune's gone to bed, so I'm covering for her."] = "天亮了，{name}。伊露恩去睡了，我來代班。"
L["The sun's up, {name}, and so, reluctantly, am I."] = "太陽起來了，{name}。我也是，很勉強。"
L["Too bright, {name}. I'll squint through this one; Elune forgives squinting."] = "太亮了，{name}。我瞇著眼施吧，伊露恩准許瞇眼。"
L["Daybreak, {name}: the one hour a night elf is easy to spot. Quick, take this."] = "天亮了，{name}：夜精靈就這時最好找。快拿著！"
L["Up early, {name}? I'm up late. Let's meet in the middle, with this."] = "你早起，{name}？我晚睡。各退一步，拿著這個。"
L["The shadows remember kindness, {name}. So do I."] = "暗影記得善意，{name}。我也是。"
L["My thanks, {name}. The ren'dorei do not forget a kindness."] = "感謝，{name}。虛無精靈不忘恩情。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The voices approve of you, which is frankly alarming."] = "謝謝，{name}。低語們挺喜歡你，這點有點嚇人。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Few give gifts to someone who glows this ominously."] = "謝謝，{name}。我都閃著不祥的光了，你還敢送。"
L["Kindness is rare in the Void, {name}. I'll return yours before it notices."] = "虛無裡善意很稀有，{name}。趁它沒發現，快還你。"
L["Silvermoon threw us out, {name}. People like you make it hard to mind."] = "銀月城趕走了我們，{name}。有你在，誰還在乎。"
L["Returned in full, {name}. It may be slightly purple. That's normal."] = "如數奉還，{name}。可能有點紫，這很正常。"
L["The Void only takes, {name}. I, however, give back."] = "虛無只會索取，{name}。我呢，懂得回報。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The whispers went quiet. That's how I know it was sincere."] = "謝謝，{name}。低語安靜下來了，可見你是真心的。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd smile, but people say it's unsettling. So: imagine one."] = "謝謝，{name}。聽說我笑起來嚇人，請自行想像。"
L["Returned, {name}: cold hands, warm intentions. That's us in a sentence."] = "還你，{name}：手冷心熱，虛無精靈一言以蔽之。"
L["Returned, {name}. You may hear it twice; my spells echo now."] = "還你，{name}……還你……我的法術現在有回音。"
L["The Void offered me forbidden knowledge, {name}. Yours was the nicer gift."] = "虛無給過我禁忌知識，{name}。你送的比較好。"
L["Alleria says the Void can be mastered, {name}. Kindness, I find, is easier."] = "艾蕾莉亞說虛無能駕馭，{name}。善意倒簡單多了。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. Most people give us a wide berth. You gave me this."] = "感謝，{name}。別人只給我們距離，你給了這個。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My shadow bowed as well. It never does. You've impressed it."] = "謝謝，{name}。我的影子也鞠躬了，它從不低頭。"
L["As you wish, {name}. The shadows answer kindly today."] = "如你所願，{name}。今天暗影很好說話。"
L["Consider it done, {name}. The Void obeys us, not the other way round."] = "交給我，{name}。虛無聽我們的，不是反過來。"
L["Certainly, {name}. The whispers said no, so it's an easy yes."] = "當然，{name}。低語叫我別給，那肯定要給。"
L["Of course, {name}. One {buff}, lightly seasoned with the Void."] = "當然，{name}。{buff}一份，撒了點虛無調味。"
L["Of course, {name}. Hold still; the shadows are shy with strangers."] = "當然，{name}。別動，暗影怕生。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Ren'dorei manners: the Void waits its turn."] = "樂意，{name}。虛無精靈的禮數：虛無也得排隊。"
L["Asked so nicely, {name}? Then you'll have my best."] = "這麼客氣，{name}？那就給你我最好的。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand in the light, please; the Void gets ideas in corners."] = "當然，{name}。站到亮處吧，虛無在角落會動歪念。"
L["Of course, {name}. The Void asked why. I said 'manners'. It's still puzzled."] = "虛無問為什麼，{name}，我說「禮貌」。它還在想。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Nobody asks us for anything but 'please stop whispering'."] = "樂意，{name}。別人只求我們：「拜託別再低語」。"
L["Happy to, {name}. Just let me finish arguing with myself. There. I won."] = "樂意，{name}。等我跟自己吵完。好了，我贏了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. I could rift over there first, but that feels showy."] = "當然，{name}。可以先開裂隙閃過去，但太愛現。"
L["Asking questions got us exiled, {name}. Answering one is quite safe, I'm told."] = "我們是問太多被流放的，{name}。聽說回答挺安全。"
L["Of course, {name}. A slight chill and a faint chorus are both perfectly normal."] = "當然，{name}。微微發冷、隱約有合唱，都很正常。"
L["A touch of shadow for you, {name}. Quite safe. Mostly."] = "送你一抹暗影，{name}。很安全……大概。"
L["Walk carefully in the dark places, {name}."] = "在暗處走路要小心，{name}。"
L["A little something from the Telogrus Rift, {name}. It's cleaner than it sounds."] = "來自泰洛古斯裂隙，{name}。比聽起來乾淨。"
L["Take this, {name}. Any tentacles you see are purely decorative."] = "拿著，{name}。看到觸手的話，純屬裝飾。"
L["The shadows asked after you, {name}. I told them to mind their manners."] = "暗影問起你，{name}。我叫它們注意禮貌。"
L["Here, {name}. We walked into the Void so you wouldn't have to."] = "給你，{name}。我們走進虛無，你就不必了。"
L["I checked your shadow, {name}. Nothing lurking. Take this anyway."] = "你的影子我查過了，{name}，很乾淨。還是拿著吧。"
L["Umbric sends his regards, {name}. He doesn't, but he would."] = "艾蕾莉亞向你問好，{name}。她沒說，但她會的。"
L["Take this, {name}. It may whisper a compliment. Pretend you didn't hear."] = "拿著，{name}。它可能會低聲誇你，裝沒聽到就好。"
L["Here, {name}. Looks sinister, works beautifully. Rather like me."] = "給你，{name}。看著邪門，效果一流。跟我挺像的。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Void had worse in mind for you. I intercepted."] = "拿著，{name}。虛無原本想給你更糟的，我攔截了。"
L["If the dark whispers at you today, {name}, pay it no mind. Take this."] = "今天若黑暗對你低語，{name}，別理它。拿著。"
L["Here, {name}. We ren'dorei don't often get to be the nice surprise."] = "給你，{name}。虛無精靈難得是驚喜，不是驚嚇。"
L["I left Quel'Thalas with only a knack for the dark, {name}. Here's the knack."] = "我從奎爾薩拉斯只帶出暗影手藝，{name}。獻醜了。"
L["Here, {name}. Don't thank the shadows; they'll only want something. Thank me."] = "給你，{name}。別謝暗影，它們會得寸進尺。謝我。"
L["I owe a kindness for every ominous look I've given, {name}. I'm badly behind."] = "每個陰森眼神都欠一份善意，{name}。我負債累累。"
L["We ren'dorei look after our own, {name}."] = "虛無精靈照顧自己人，{name}。"
L["Silvermoon's loss, {name}. We're doing splendidly without it."] = "銀月城的損失，{name}。我們沒它過得可好了。"
L["Your whispers and mine should really meet sometime, {name}."] = "你的低語和我的低語，{name}，真該找天見個面。"
L["Two ren'dorei in one place, {name}. Quick, look brooding. It's expected."] = "兩個虛無精靈！{name}，快擺憂鬱臉，這是慣例。"
L["Nobody else understands the hair, {name}. It was blond once. I think."] = "只有你懂這頭髮，{name}。以前是金的。應該吧。"
L["Telogrus felt like home in the end, {name}. A very draughty, very dark home."] = "泰洛古斯終究像家，{name}。很漏風、很黑的家。"
L["Ren'dorei to ren'dorei, {name}: what's yours whispering? Mine's on about soup."] = "同族一問，{name}：你的低語聊什麼？我的聊湯。"
L["Stay close, {name}. The whispers are much quieter in company."] = "跟緊，{name}。有人作伴，低語會安靜很多。"
L["If the shadows start giving orders, {name}, ignore them. I usually do."] = "暗影若開始發號施令，{name}，別理。我都不理。"
L["Keep an eye on my shadow, {name}. It wanders off when there's a fight."] = "幫我盯著我的影子，{name}。一打起來它就亂跑。"
L["If I start glowing purple, {name}, carry on. It only means I'm keen."] = "我若發紫光，{name}，別在意，那是我興奮了。"
L["We ren'dorei make fine companions, {name}. We bring our own dark to hide in."] = "虛無精靈是好旅伴，{name}。躲藏用的黑暗自備。"
L["If I seem to talk to nobody, {name}, I'm fine. If nobody talks back, worry."] = "我對空氣說話，{name}，沒事。空氣回話了再擔心。"
L["I'll open a rift if it goes wrong, {name}. Only for me, sadly. But I'll wave."] = "情況不妙就開裂隙，{name}。只限我，但我會揮手。"
L["Try to enjoy this, {name}. We ren'dorei rarely get invited anywhere twice."] = "好好享受，{name}。虛無精靈很少被邀第二次。"
L["Keep the lanterns lit, {name}. I don't need them; the shadows behave better."] = "燈籠別熄，{name}。我不需要，但有光暗影比較乖。"
L["Keep an eye on the corners, {name}. I'll keep an eye on what's in them."] = "你盯著角落，{name}。角落裡的東西我來盯。"
L["The Void promised me power, {name}. It never mentioned company this good."] = "虛無許諾我力量，{name}，沒說還附贈好夥伴。"
L["If you hear whispers mid-fight, {name}, they're cheering. For us, I think."] = "戰鬥中聽到低語，{name}？在加油。應該是替我們。"
L["Should anything eldritch turn up, {name}, let me talk to it. I speak a little."] = "冒出不可名狀之物，{name}，我來溝通。略懂略懂。"
L["Night suits the ren'dorei, {name}. We match the decor."] = "夜晚很適合虛無精靈，{name}。跟裝潢很搭。"
L["The shadows are longest now, {name}, and in a very generous mood."] = "此刻暗影最長，{name}，心情也最大方。"
L["Late, {name}? The whispers love a late hour. Lately, so do I."] = "夜深了？{name}，低語愛熬夜，我也被帶壞了。"
L["Midnight, {name}. The one hour my shadow and I agree on anything."] = "午夜了，{name}。只有這時，我跟影子意見一致。"
L["Stars out, {name}. I've seen what's between them, and I prefer the stars."] = "滿天星，{name}。星星之間我見過，還是星星好。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Kindness received, catalogued and returned!"] = "謝啦，{name}！好意已接收、歸檔並回傳！"
L["Reciprocity engaged! Much obliged, {name}."] = "互惠機制啟動！感激不盡，{name}。"
L["By my calculations, {name}, you're owed exactly one {buff}."] = "根據我的計算，{name}，你應得{buff}，恰好一份。"
L["Thanks, {name}! I'd build you a thank-you machine, but it'd explode."] = "謝啦，{name}！本想做台感謝機給你，但它會爆炸。"
L["Thank you, {name}! Gnomeregan's finest couldn't have timed that better."] = "謝謝，{name}！諾姆瑞根的頂尖專家也算不了這麼準。"
L["You're too kind, {name}! Returning the favour took only four schematics."] = "你太好了，{name}！還這份人情只用了四張設計圖。"
L["Drat, {name}! I was going to invent gratitude, but you beat me to it."] = "可惡，{name}！我正要發明「感恩」，被你搶先了。"
L["Oh, {name}, how kind! My heart's doing that whirring thing again."] = "哎呀，{name}，你真好！我的心臟齒輪又嗡嗡轉了。"
L["Noted in my lab journal, {name}, page four hundred: 'people are lovely'."] = "記進實驗日誌，{name}，第400頁：「大家人真好」。"
L["Splendid, {name}! Returning it at once, before I'm tempted to improve it."] = "太棒了，{name}！馬上還你，免得我手癢改良它。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Kindness is a reversible reaction. I checked. Here's yours."] = "謝啦，{name}！善意是可逆反應，驗證過了。還你！"
L["My mechanostrider would salute you, {name}, but it only knows falling over."] = "機械陸行鳥想向你敬禮，{name}，但它只會跌倒。"
L["My transporter would've sent this to Gadgetzan, {name}. Hand-delivered instead!"] = "我的傳送器會把它送去加基森，{name}。改親手送！"
L["Oh, thank you, {name}! I haven't felt this good since before the troggs."] = "謝謝，{name}！自從穴居人來了，就沒這麼開心過。"
L["I'll name my next invention after you, {name}! It's a very small cannon."] = "下個發明用你命名，{name}！是門很小的大砲。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Ironforge has been good to us gnomes, and so have you."] = "謝啦，{name}！鐵爐堡待我們地精不薄，你也是。"
L["You're on my list of favourite people, {name}! It's short. Mostly clockwork."] = "你上了我的最愛名單，{name}！很短，多是發條的。"
L["Request received, {name}! Processing... done!"] = "收到請求，{name}！處理中……完成！"
L["One upgrade, coming right up, {name}! Stand still for calibration."] = "升級一份馬上來，{name}！別動，校準中。"
L["Of course, {name}! I built a machine for this. It's in pieces, so: by hand."] = "當然，{name}！專用機器散架中，改手動。"
L["Certainly, {name}! Stand on the X. There's no X. Stand anywhere."] = "沒問題，{name}！站到X上。沒有X。隨便站。"
L["Right away, {name}! Goggles on. Not for you, I just like them."] = "馬上，{name}！戴上護目鏡。不是為你，我就愛戴。"
L["{buff}, {name}? Simple in theory and practice. Suspicious!"] = "{buff}？{name}，理論和實作都簡單？可疑！"
L["Happy to, {name}! Keep hands, feet and eyebrows well clear."] = "樂意，{name}！手、腳和眉毛請遠離。"
L["Right away, {name}! Stand back three paces. Four. Five. There, perfect."] = "馬上，{name}！退後三步。四步。五步。好，完美！"
L["Happy to, {name}! It beats sorting springs by size. Though that's fun too."] = "樂意，{name}！比按大小排彈簧好玩。那個也好玩啦。"
L["Excellent request, {name}! No moving parts. I'll try to add some next time."] = "絕佳的請求，{name}！零活動零件。下次盡量加幾個。"
L["Standard model or deluxe, {name}? They're the same. Deluxe sounds nicer."] = "標準版還是豪華版，{name}？都一樣，豪華版比較好聽。"
L["Coming up, {name}! Fresh off the workbench, still warm, only slightly smoking."] = "來了，{name}！剛出爐，還熱著，只冒一點點煙。"
L["Approved, {name}! Stamped, signed and filed under 'obviously'."] = "核准，{name}！已蓋章、簽名，歸檔在「那還用說」。"
L["Of course, {name}! A twist of the gyromatic micro-adjustor... there!"] = "當然，{name}！轉一下陀螺微調器……好了！"
L["Gnomes never refuse a problem, {name}. Occasionally we cause them. Here!"] = "地精從不拒絕問題，{name}，偶爾還親手製造。拿去！"
L["Hold still, {name}, this is perfectly safe. Probably!"] = "別動，{name}，這完全安全。應該吧！"
L["Science says you need this, {name}. Who am I to argue?"] = "科學說你需要這個，{name}。我哪敢反駁？"
L["A small upgrade for you, {name}. No cogs required."] = "給你個小升級，{name}。免裝齒輪！"
L["Take it, {name}, I've a spare. I've three spares of everything."] = "拿去，{name}，我有備用的，什麼都備了三份。"
L["Try this, {name}! Version one had legs. Version two is much better."] = "試試這個，{name}！第一版長了腿，第二版好多了。"
L["The High Tinker says share our genius, {name}. Here's a sample!"] = "大技師說要分享天才，{name}。來，試用品！"
L["Gnomeregan Forever, {name}! This lasts rather less, but it's free."] = "諾姆瑞根萬歲，{name}！這個不到萬歲，但免費！"
L["I'm small, {name}, but my gifts come full-sized. Here!"] = "我個子小，{name}，送的禮可是全尺寸。拿去！"
L["Don't worry, {name}! It worked on the chicken, and the chicken's thrilled."] = "別擔心，{name}！雞試過了，雞超開心的。"
L["Field notes say it works on everyone, {name}. Let's make it unanimous!"] = "田野筆記說對誰都有效，{name}。來個全票通過！"
L["One size fits all, {name}, gnome to tauren. I measured. The tauren was patient."] = "地精到牛頭人都合身，{name}。我量過，牛頭人超有耐心。"
L["Take this, {name}! Unlike my Net-o-Matic, it never lands on me."] = "拿著，{name}！不像我的撒網機，這個不會罩到我自己。"
L["The Gnomish Army Knife does twelve things badly, {name}. This does one well."] = "地精軍刀十二種功能樣樣不精，{name}。這個只精一樣。"
L["Guarantee void if exposed to troggs, dragonfire or enthusiasm, {name}. Enjoy!"] = "遇到穴居人、龍焰或熱情即不保固，{name}。使用愉快！"
L["Nothing up my sleeves, {name}! Well, a spanner and two fuses. Nothing sinister."] = "袖裡沒藏東西，{name}！只有扳手和兩條引信。不可疑。"
L["Here, {name}! It's small, but so is a keystone, and look what those hold up."] = "給你，{name}！是很小，但拱心石也小，照樣撐起整座拱門。"
L["I'd explain how it works, {name}, but that takes three days and a chalkboard."] = "原理我很想解釋，{name}，但得花三天加一塊黑板。"
L["If you hear ticking, {name}, that's my pocket watch. Almost certainly."] = "聽到滴答聲別慌，{name}，那是我的懷錶。八成是。"
L["For Gnomeregan, {name}! Always nice to talk to somebody at eye level."] = "為了諾姆瑞根，{name}！能平視說話真好。"
L["A fellow gnome, {name}! I'll hold the schematic; you hold the bucket."] = "同是地精，{name}！我拿設計圖，你拿水桶。"
L["Flesh or cogs, {name}, we're all gnomes. Some of us just need oiling."] = "肉身或齒輪，{name}，都是地精，只是有的要上油。"
L["One gnome to another, {name}: you did turn the reactor off, didn't you?"] = "地精對地精，{name}：出門前反應爐關了吧？"
L["Two gnomes, {name}! Stacked up, we're very nearly a night elf."] = "兩個地精，{name}！疊起來差不多就是一個夜精靈。"
L["You check my sums, {name}, I check yours, and we're both quietly offended."] = "你驗算我的，{name}，我驗算你的，兩個都暗自不爽。"
L["You still owe me a sprocket, {name}. Every gnome owes me a sprocket."] = "你還欠我一個齒輪，{name}。每個地精都欠我一個齒輪。"
L["One day, {name}, we'll walk back into Gnomeregan together. With the lights on."] = "總有一天，{name}，我們會一起走回諾姆瑞根。開著燈。"
L["Between gnomes, {name}: we both know it'll explode, and we both want to watch."] = "地精之間說實話，{name}：都知道會爆，也都想看。"
L["Shall we build something huge, {name}? Just to see the tall folk's faces?"] = "來造個超大的東西吧，{name}？就為了看高個子的表情。"
L["Party-wide calibration complete, {name}! Nobody touch anything shiny."] = "全隊校準完成，{name}！誰都別碰亮晶晶的東西。"
L["I've run the numbers, {name}: with you here, we win. I rounded up."] = "算過了，{name}：有你在，穩贏。四捨五入後。"
L["If I shout 'duck', {name}, don't look for a duck. That went badly last time."] = "喊「快閃」是叫你躲，{name}。上次有人跳起舞。"
L["Formation, {name}: tall folk at the front, me somewhere safe and clever."] = "隊形，{name}：高個子頂前面，我躲後面動腦。"
L["Everyone gets one, {name}! Standardised parts are the secret of a good machine."] = "人人有份，{name}！標準化零件是好機器的祕訣。"
L["My plan, {name}: step one, survive. Step two is still in development."] = "我的計畫，{name}：第一步，活下來。第二步還在開發中。"
L["Don't panic, {name}. Whatever goes wrong, I'll have a gadget for it. Next week."] = "別慌，{name}。出什麼錯我都會有裝置對付。下週到貨。"
L["If I vanish, {name}, check under the nearest boot. Politely, please."] = "我要是不見了，{name}，查查最近的靴子底下。請客氣點。"
L["When this is over, {name}, I want samples. Of everything. The big one first."] = "打完之後，{name}，我要採樣。全部都要，大隻的先。"
L["Every explosion today, {name}, is on purpose. I'll decide which ones later."] = "今天每場爆炸，{name}，都是故意的。哪幾場晚點再定。"
L["Clipboard ready, {name}! Today I'm writing down everyone's heroics."] = "記錄板準備好了，{name}！今天要記下每個人的英勇事蹟。"
L["If we get separated, {name}, follow the smoke. It'll be me."] = "走散的話，{name}，跟著煙走。那就是我。"
L["Everyone keep their fingers, {name}. I've counted. I'll count again after."] = "大家手指都顧好，{name}。我數過了，打完再數一次。"
L["Morning, {name}! Up since three. The toaster needed a new engine."] = "早，{name}！我三點就起來了，烤麵包機得換引擎。"
L["Good morning, {name}! The coffee's brewing itself. It learned how. Worrying."] = "早安，{name}！咖啡學會自己煮自己了。令人擔憂。"
L["Early start, {name}! Best ideas come before breakfast. So do the explosions."] = "早起，{name}！好點子都在早餐前，爆炸也是。"
L["Morning, {name}! Tinker Town's been clanking since dawn, and so have I. Here!"] = "早，{name}！地精區天一亮就叮噹響，我也是。給你！"
L["Up early, {name}? I dreamt of a better sprocket and couldn't wait. Here!"] = "這麼早，{name}？我夢到更好的齒輪，等不及了。給你！"
L["Morning, {name}! The sun's a bit dim today. I've been meaning to fix that."] = "早，{name}！今天太陽有點暗，我一直想修一下。"
L["The Light rewards kindness, {name}. I'm simply its fastest courier."] = "聖光會回報善意，{name}。我只是它最快的信差。"
L["Archenon poros, {name}. Your gift is returned."] = "Archenon poros，{name}。回贈你的禮物。"
L["Thanks, {name}. I'd offer a lift in the Exodar, but you've seen how it lands."] = "謝了，{name}。艾克索達不載你了，它是用摔的。"
L["A gift freely given, {name}. The naaru hum a little louder. Returned."] = "無私相贈，{name}，那魯都嗡得更響了。回贈你。"
L["Kindly done, {name}. On Argus we'd have carved that in crystal. Here."] = "好心人，{name}。在阿古斯，這得刻進水晶。給你。"
L["Across a dozen worlds, {name}, kindness is the one tongue I never had to learn."] = "走過十幾個世界，{name}，只有善意這語言不用學。"
L["What a kindness, {name}. It almost makes up for the Legion. Almost."] = "多好心，{name}。差點就抵銷燃燒軍團了。差點。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd say it in Draenei, but that takes eleven minutes."] = "謝謝，{name}。用德萊尼語說的話，要講十一分鐘。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My people call that a debt of honour. Here."] = "謝謝，{name}。我族稱之為榮譽之債。給你。"
L["Sargeras once offered my people gifts, {name}. We ran. Yours, I'll keep."] = "薩格拉斯也送過我族禮物，{name}。我們跑了。你的我收下。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I've fled demons across the stars, but never from a debt."] = "謝謝，{name}。我在星海間逃離惡魔，卻從不逃債。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll add you to my prayers. The list goes back to Argus."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會為你祈禱。這份名單從阿古斯排到現在。"
L["The Legion took a world from us, {name}. Folk like you keep giving bits back."] = "軍團奪走一個世界，{name}，好心人正一點一點還給我們。"
L["You gave first, {name}. A prophet would call it an omen. I call it manners."] = "你先給了，{name}。先知會說是預兆，我說是禮貌。"
L["With the Light's compliments, {name}. It asked me to add 'nicely done'."] = "聖光向你致意，{name}。它要我補一句「做得好」。"
L["Of course, {name}. The naaru guide your steps; this puts a spring in them."] = "當然，{name}。那魯指引腳步，這個讓你步步生風。"
L["Gladly, {name}. The Light answers those who ask."] = "很樂意，{name}。聖光必回應祈求者。"
L["Velen foresaw you asking, {name}. I foresaw saying yes."] = "維倫預見了你會問，{name}。我預見我會答應。"
L["The Light is not rationed, {name}. Take as much as you like."] = "聖光不限量供應，{name}。要多少拿多少。"
L["Of course, {name}. I've outrun the Burning Legion; I can manage this."] = "當然，{name}。燃燒軍團我都跑贏了，這算什麼。"
L["At once, {name}. Hooves planted, crystals humming, here it comes."] = "馬上，{name}。蹄子站穩，水晶嗡鳴，來了！"
L["Gladly, {name}. I followed a talking crystal across the stars. This is easy."] = "{name}，我跟過會說話的水晶橫越星海，這很簡單。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Velen taught us patience. Luckily, this takes none."] = "當然，{name}。維倫教我們耐心。幸好這個不用。"
L["Gladly, {name}. The naaru never say no. They say 'hmmm', but it means yes."] = "樂意，{name}。那魯從不說不，只會「嗡……」，那就是好。"
L["On the Exodar this took three crystals and a prayer, {name}. Here: the prayer."] = "在艾克索達，這要三顆水晶加一段禱告，{name}。這是禱告。"
L["Of course, {name}. I only refuse demons, and they so rarely say please."] = "當然，{name}。我只拒絕惡魔，而它們很少說「請」。"
L["Gladly, {name}. We were refugees long enough to know what asking costs."] = "樂意，{name}。當了太久難民，知道開口有多難。"
L["Of course, {name}. My people crossed the stars looking for friends. Found one."] = "當然，{name}。我族橫越星海來找朋友。找到一個了。"
L["Ask a draenei, {name}: one yes, one blessing, possibly a history lesson."] = "問德萊尼吧，{name}：一聲好、一份祝福，可能附贈歷史課。"
L["The Light is with you, {name}. Go in peace, or at least go prepared."] = "聖光與你同在，{name}。平安去吧，至少有備而去。"
L["Walk in the Light, {name}. May it shelter you always."] = "行於聖光中，{name}。願它時時護你。"
L["Take this, {name}. My people always travel Light."] = "{name}，我族出門向來光帶聖光。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Legion is always coming. I'd know."] = "拿著，{name}。燃燒軍團總會來的，我最清楚。"
L["I'm out of miracles today, {name}. Will {buff} do?"] = "今天奇蹟用完了，{name}。{buff}將就一下？"
L["For the road, {name}. Mine has been twenty-five thousand years long."] = "路上用，{name}。我這條路走了兩萬五千年。"
L["Blessed by a naaru, {name}. Well, I stood near one. It still counts."] = "那魯開過光的，{name}。其實只是站它旁邊。也算！"
L["Take this, {name}. It glows a bit. Everything we own does."] = "拿著，{name}。它會發點光，我們的東西都會。"
L["Here, {name}. We draenei pack for the end of the world. We've had the practice."] = "給你，{name}。德萊尼行李都照末日標準打包，練過了。"
L["Take this, {name}. The crystals only hum like that for friends."] = "拿著，{name}。水晶只為朋友這樣嗡鳴。"
L["The naaru shine on all, {name}. Here is your share."] = "那魯普照眾生，{name}。這是你的那份。"
L["A stranger shared bread with me on Azuremyst, {name}. I'm still paying it back."] = "在藍謎島受過一飯之恩，{name}，我到今天還在報。"
L["Velen sees a thousand futures, {name}. I see one: you, better prepared. Here."] = "維倫預見千種未來，{name}。我只見一種：萬全準備的你。"
L["Don't drink from the streams on Bloodmyst, {name}. Do take this."] = "別喝血謎島的溪水，{name}。這個倒是可以拿。"
L["Eredar magic from before the fall, {name}. We only kept the good kind. Here."] = "阿古斯墮落前的魔法，{name}。我們只帶走好的那種。給你。"
L["Archenon poros, {name}! The children of Argus look after one another."] = "Archenon poros，{name}！阿古斯的子民彼此照應。"
L["Home is wherever two draenei meet, {name}. Today, it's here."] = "兩個德萊尼相遇處就是家，{name}。今天在這。"
L["We crossed the stars on the same ship, {name}. That still means something."] = "我們搭同一艘船橫越星海，{name}。這份情誼還在。"
L["Tails up, {name}. Argus would be proud of what we've made of exile."] = "尾巴翹高，{name}。流亡成這樣，阿古斯會驕傲的。"
L["Two draenei, {name}, and between us nearly fifty thousand years of worrying."] = "兩個德萊尼，{name}，加起來快五萬年的操心。"
L["Horns, hooves and hope, {name}. The Legion never found a cure for any of them."] = "角、蹄和希望，{name}。燃燒軍團一樣都治不好。"
L["Children of Velen, {name}: exiled, hopeful and dreadfully polite."] = "維倫的子民，{name}：流亡、懷抱希望，還客氣得要命。"
L["Third world's the charm, {name}. We draenei are owed one that stays put."] = "事不過三，{name}。德萊尼也該有個待得住的世界了。"
L["Stay near, {name}. I lost a world once; I'm keeping hold of this party."] = "靠近點，{name}。丟過一個世界了，這隊我抓牢。"
L["Twenty-five thousand years on the run, {name}. Walking with friends is nicer."] = "逃了兩萬五千年，{name}。跟朋友一起走好多了。"
L["The naaru would call this a fellowship, {name}. I call it good luck."] = "那魯會稱之為同伴之誼，{name}。我稱之為好運。"
L["I've watched worlds end, {name}. Whatever's ahead of us hardly worries me."] = "世界末日我都看過了，{name}。前面那些，小意思。"
L["Stay together, {name}. The Light finds us easier when we're all in one place."] = "待在一起，{name}。我們聚在一處，聖光比較好找。"
L["Stay close, {name}. We draenei are very good at leaving places in a hurry."] = "跟緊，{name}。說到倉皇撤離，德萊尼是專家。"
L["We draenei take the long view, {name}. This fight will be a footnote."] = "德萊尼看得長遠，{name}。這場仗只是個註腳。"
L["Let me go first, {name}. Anything watching will see a very tall optimist."] = "我先上，{name}。暗處的傢伙只會看到一個高大的樂天派。"
L["We draenei follow prophets, {name}. Today I'll settle for following you."] = "德萊尼追隨先知，{name}。今天改追隨你，也不錯。"
L["The Exodar carried thousands, {name}, and this little party still feels safer."] = "艾克索達載過數千人，{name}，這支小隊還是更讓人安心。"
L["Shoulder to shoulder, {name}. Mine's a bit higher, but the principle holds."] = "並肩作戰，{name}。我的肩高了點，但道理不變。"
L["A short prayer for the party, {name}. The long one would take an age."] = "為隊伍念段短禱文，{name}。長版要念一個紀元。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. Gilneas never forgets a kindness, and nor does my nose."] = "多謝，{name}。吉爾尼斯不忘恩，我的鼻子也是。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You have my gratitude, and my best howl."] = "謝謝，{name}。獻上謝意和我最拿手的狼嚎！"
L["Thank you, {name}. If worgen had tails, mine would be wagging."] = "謝謝，{name}。狼人若有尾巴，我早搖起來了。"
L["You've made a friend for life, {name}. Loyalty is rather our thing."] = "從此是終生好友，{name}。忠誠可是我們的專長。"
L["The beast in me wants to growl, {name}. The Gilnean in me insists on thanks."] = "野獸的我想低吼，{name}，吉爾尼斯的我堅持道謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd offer a hand, but mine have claws now."] = "謝謝，{name}。想跟你握手，但我的手現在有爪子。"
L["We walled ourselves off for years, {name}. You make that look silly."] = "有你這樣的鄰居，{name}，葛雷邁恩之牆算白蓋了。"
L["Obliged, {name}. You've earned a spot by the fire. The good spot."] = "謝了，{name}。爐火邊給你留個位，最好的那個。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Gilneas had a word for folk like you: neighbour."] = "謝謝，{name}。吉爾尼斯管你這種人叫：鄰居。"
L["Returned, {name}, with a stiff upper lip. The lower one shows teeth; ignore it."] = "回禮，{name}。上唇很紳士，下唇在露牙，別理它。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd tip my hat, but it doesn't fit over the ears these days."] = "謝謝，{name}。本想脫帽致意，但帽子已經塞不下耳朵了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Most folk just scratch my ears and hope for the best."] = "謝謝，{name}。多數人只會搔搔我的耳朵，然後祈禱沒事。"
L["Returned, {name}. A Gilnean pays debts; a worgen pays them at a sprint."] = "回禮，{name}。吉爾尼斯人有債必還，狼人還得飛快。"
L["My mother would have had you round for tea, {name}. Thank you."] = "我母親一定會請你來喝茶，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Hold still, I don't bite. Much."] = "當然，{name}。別動，我不怎麼咬人。"
L["Right you are, {name}. Stand steady now."] = "好的，{name}，站穩了。"
L["Right away, {name}. Stay, now. I've always wanted to say that."] = "馬上，{name}。坐好，別動！這句我老早想說了。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Rain or shine, and in Gilneas it's rain."] = "樂意，{name}。風雨無阻，吉爾尼斯只有雨。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Mind the claws."] = "當然，{name}。小心爪子。"
L["Say no more, {name}. These ears heard you before you'd decided to ask."] = "不必說，{name}。你還沒決定要問，我就聽見了。"
L["Of course, {name}. You asked nicer than the last fellow who threw me a stick."] = "當然，{name}。你比上次丟樹枝給我的傢伙客氣。"
L["Glad to, {name}. Few people ask a seven-foot wolf for favours. I love it."] = "樂意，{name}。很少人找兩米高的狼幫忙，我好喜歡。"
L["Certainly, {name}. I'll stay in this form. The other one causes a scene."] = "當然，{name}。我就維持這個形態，另一個會引起騷動。"
L["Straight to business without tea, {name}? How un-Gilnean."] = "不喝茶就直接辦正事，{name}？真不吉爾尼斯。"
L["Of course, {name}. In Gilneas, nobody had to ask twice."] = "當然，{name}。在吉爾尼斯，沒人需要問第二次。"
L["Of course, {name}. It would be rude to keep you waiting."] = "當然，{name}。讓你久等太失禮了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Anything but a bath."] = "當然，{name}。洗澡以外都行。"
L["Stay off the moors after dark, {name}. Take this."] = "天黑後別去荒野，{name}。拿著這個。"
L["Keep your wits about you, {name}. Something is always hunting."] = "保持警覺，{name}。總有東西在狩獵。"
L["I'd have brought this sooner, {name}, but I stopped to chase something."] = "本該早點送來，{name}，半路去追了個東西。"
L["For you, {name}. No, I don't want a treat. Well. Perhaps a small one."] = "給你，{name}。不用給我零食。嗯……一小塊就好。"
L["Gilneans always offer, {name}. The claws are just part of the outfit."] = "吉爾尼斯人很熱心的，{name}。爪子只是配件。"
L["An old Gilnean remedy, {name}. Good for colds, gloom and most curses. Not mine."] = "吉爾尼斯偏方，{name}，百咒皆治。我的除外。"
L["Run with this, {name}. Trust me, I know about running."] = "帶著跑吧，{name}。信我，跑步我最在行。"
L["Brought you this, {name}. Don't make a fuss over it."] = "幫你帶來的，{name}。別大驚小怪。"
L["Here, {name}. Gilnean roads were never safe alone, and nor are these."] = "給你，{name}。吉爾尼斯的路從不適合獨行，這裡也一樣。"
L["For you, {name}. Not everything that prowls was as well raised as I was."] = "給你，{name}。夜裡潛行的東西，可不是都像我這麼有教養。"
L["From a Gilnean of good family, {name}. The fur is new; the manners are old."] = "來自吉爾尼斯名門，{name}。毛是新長的，教養是祖傳的。"
L["Someone did this for me in Duskhaven once, {name}. I never forgot."] = "以前在吉爾尼斯，有人這樣幫過我，{name}。我從沒忘記。"
L["Liam would have cried 'For Gilneas!', {name}. I'll just say: for you."] = "王子會高喊「為了吉爾尼斯！」，{name}。我只說：為了你。"
L["Tal'doren's druids taught me to leash the beast, {name}. It lets me do this."] = "德魯伊教我拴住心中的野獸，{name}。我才能做這個。"
L["Be careful out there, {name}. Take it from someone who was bitten once."] = "出門小心，{name}。這是被咬過一次的人的忠告。"
L["Here, {name}. In Gilneas we'd have sent it with a jar of preserves."] = "給你，{name}。在吉爾尼斯，還會附上一罐果醬。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd offer my coat, but it's attached."] = "拿著，{name}。本想把外套借你，可惜它長在我身上。"
L["Here, {name}. Chin up, hackles down. Words to live by."] = "給你，{name}。下巴抬高，頸毛放平。人生格言。"
L["The curse binds us, {name}, but Gilneas binds us tighter."] = "詛咒綁住我們，{name}，吉爾尼斯綁得更緊。"
L["No need to explain the ears to you, {name}."] = "耳朵的事不用跟你解釋，{name}。"
L["Fur, fog and rain, {name}. Only a Gilnean understands all three."] = "毛、霧和雨，{name}。只有吉爾尼斯人三樣都懂。"
L["Pack looks after pack, {name}. Always has."] = "狼群照顧狼群，{name}。向來如此。"
L["Do you shed this badly too, {name}? Between us we could knit a third worgen."] = "你也掉毛掉這麼兇嗎，{name}？我們的毛能織出第三個狼人。"
L["Two worgen, {name}. Somewhere, a cat's having a very bad day."] = "兩個狼人，{name}。某處有隻貓今天很倒楣。"
L["Honestly, {name}, do you ever forget which form you left home in?"] = "說真的，{name}，你會忘記自己是用哪個形態出門的嗎？"
L["Gilnean to Gilnean, {name}: the finest-mannered wolves in all Azeroth."] = "吉爾尼斯同鄉，{name}：全艾澤拉斯最有禮貌的狼。"
L["Pack rules, {name}: nobody wanders off, and nobody mentions the fleas."] = "狼群規矩，{name}：不准亂跑，不准提跳蚤。"
L["A pack again, {name}. I hadn't known how much I'd missed one."] = "又成群了，{name}。沒想到我這麼想念這感覺。"
L["I'll catch the scent of trouble first, {name}. It's the one perk of the curse."] = "麻煩我會先聞到，{name}。詛咒唯一的好處。"
L["If I howl, {name}, it's a battle cry. Howl back if you like."] = "我嚎的話，{name}，那是戰吼。想嚎就嚎回來。"
L["Lead on, {name}. I'll trot. It's undignified, but it's much quicker."] = "你帶路，{name}。我四腳小跑，不體面但快多了。"
L["If I stop and stare at a wall, {name}, something's behind it. Or it's a wall."] = "我要是盯著牆看，{name}，就是牆後有東西。不然就只是牆。"
L["Years on the Greymane Wall, {name}. Holding a line with you is a holiday."] = "守過葛雷邁恩之牆好幾年，{name}，跟你守防線像度假。"
L["After this, {name}, a proper cup of tea. Before this, a proper mauling."] = "打完，{name}，來杯像樣的茶。打之前，來場像樣的撕咬。"
L["If I limp back, {name}, don't fuss. Worgen mend quickly."] = "要是我瘸著回來，{name}，別緊張。狼人好得快。"
L["When we rest, {name}, I'll take first watch. I hear everything anyway."] = "休息時，{name}，我守第一班。反正我什麼都聽得到。"
L["Stay together, {name}. Being a lone wolf is overrated."] = "待在一起，{name}。當孤狼沒那麼好。"
L["Night again, {name}. I'm at my best and my worst. This is the best part."] = "夜裡的我最好也最壞，{name}。這是好的那面。"
L["Look at that moon, {name}. Gilneas taught us not to trust it."] = "看那月亮，{name}。吉爾尼斯教會我們別信它。"
L["Gilneas at night was fog and footsteps, {name}. These days I'm the footsteps."] = "吉爾尼斯的夜有霧有腳步，{name}。如今腳步是我。"
L["Curfew in Gilneas was sundown, {name}. For good reason, as it turned out."] = "吉爾尼斯的宵禁從日落開始，{name}。後來才知道有道理。"
L["Something out there keeps rustling, {name}. Stay close; I'll look."] = "外面一直有沙沙聲，{name}。跟緊，我去看看。"
L["Past dark, {name}: ears up, nose working, manners on. Two out of three will do."] = "天黑了，{name}：耳朵豎、鼻子動、禮貌在。有兩樣就好。"
L["Morning, {name}. I'd have been up sooner, but the rug by the fire was so warm."] = "早，{name}。本想早點起，但爐火邊的地毯太暖了。"
L["Smells like rain this morning, {name}. Everything in Gilneas smelled like rain."] = "今早有雨的味道，{name}。吉爾尼斯處處是雨味。"
L["Up already, {name}? I've been prowling since first light."] = "已經起來了，{name}？我天一亮就在外頭遊蕩了。"
L["Morning, {name}. Tea, toast, a shave. The shave takes rather longer now."] = "早，{name}。茶、吐司、刮鬍子。刮鬍子現在要花好久。"
L["Morning, {name}. The birds woke me, so I woke the birds. It seemed only fair."] = "早，{name}。鳥吵醒我，我就吵醒鳥。很公平吧。"
L["Morning, {name}. The fog's lifting, which it never did in Gilneas."] = "早，{name}。霧散了，吉爾尼斯的霧從來不散。"
L["Throm-ka, {name}! Honour is repaid."] = "Throm-ka，{name}！榮譽已償。"
L["You give freely, {name}. I return the favour."] = "你夠大方，{name}。這人情我還。"
L["Orcs keep their thanks short, {name}. Thanks."] = "獸人道謝很簡短，{name}。謝了。"
L["Orcs return every blow twice, {name}. The kind ones too."] = "獸人挨一拳還兩拳，{name}。受恩也一樣。"
L["You helped me, I help you, {name}. That is the old way."] = "你幫我，我幫你，{name}。這是古老的規矩。"
L["In the old days I'd have repaid you with a boar, {name}. This keeps better."] = "以前我會拿頭野豬還你，{name}。這個比較放得久。"
L["Owing somebody itches worse than Durotar sand, {name}. There. Itch gone."] = "欠人情比杜洛塔的沙還癢，{name}。好了，不癢了。"
L["Strong stuff, {name}. I could wrestle a kodo now. So can you."] = "夠勁，{name}。我能摔倒科多獸了，你也能。"
L["Ambushed by kindness, {name}. No orc trains for that. Returned in full."] = "被善意伏擊了，{name}。獸人沒練過這招。如數奉還。"
L["Honour is a debt, {name}, and orcs pay on the spot."] = "榮譽是債，{name}，獸人當場就還。"
L["An orc remembers a kindness like a scar, {name}: fondly, and for good."] = "獸人記恩像記傷疤，{name}：帶著懷念，一輩子。"
L["I'd give you my axe, {name}, but we're not that close yet. Take this."] = "想把斧頭給你，{name}，但我們還沒那麼熟。拿這個。"
L["Thanks, {name}. My wolf growled at you. That's how he says it."] = "謝了，{name}。我的狼對你低吼，那是牠在道謝。"
L["I've had gifts from shamans and chieftains, {name}. None came so freely."] = "薩滿和酋長都送過我禮，{name}。沒一份給得這麼爽快。"
L["We once took strength from demons, {name}. Yours comes on far better terms."] = "我們曾向惡魔借力，{name}。你給的條件好太多了。"
L["The spirits saw that, {name}. They'll remember it, and so will I."] = "眾靈看見了，{name}。祂們會記住，我也會。"
L["I'll carve that on my axe handle, {name}. Next to the notches. Thank you."] = "我會刻在斧柄上，{name}，就在那排刻痕旁邊。謝了。"
L["Kindness unasked is rare as rain in Durotar, {name}. Returned."] = "不請自來的善意，比杜洛塔的雨還稀有，{name}。還你。"
L["In my clan, {name}, a gift is answered with a bigger one. Here."] = "在我的氏族，{name}，收禮要回更大的。給你。"
L["Dabu, {name}. It is done."] = "Dabu，{name}。完成。"
L["Hold still, {name}. Strength for the fight ahead."] = "站好，{name}。為戰鬥添點力量。"
L["Ask an orc for help and you get it, {name}. Ask for subtlety and you wait."] = "要獸人幫忙，{name}，行。要獸人委婉，等著吧。"
L["Help, yes. Hugging, no. Hold still, {name}."] = "幫忙行，抱抱不行。站好，{name}。"
L["You want {buff}? You have {buff}, {name}. Next."] = "要{buff}？給你{buff}，{name}。下一個。"
L["Don't flinch, {name}. My helping face looks exactly like my fighting face."] = "別縮，{name}。我幫忙的臉跟打架的臉一模一樣。"
L["Short question, short answer, {name}: yes."] = "問得短，答得也短，{name}：行。"
L["Done, {name}. I was a peon once; I never refuse honest work."] = "完成，{name}。我當過苦工，正經活從不推辭。"
L["A challenge, {name}? Ah, a request. I accept either way."] = "挑戰嗎，{name}？啊，是請求。我都接。"
L["Yes, {name}. I was sharpening my axe, but it'll keep. It always keeps."] = "行，{name}。正在磨斧頭，晚點再磨，它又不會跑。"
L["In the Valley of Honor this would cost you a duel, {name}. For you, a nod."] = "在榮譽谷，這得跟你決鬥，{name}。對你，點個頭就好。"
L["Now, {name}? Now. Orcs never learned the word 'later'."] = "現在？{name}，現在。獸人沒學過「晚點」這個詞。"
L["One {buff}, {name}. Orc style: fast, direct, a bit too hard."] = "{buff}一份，{name}。獸人風格：快、直接，有點太用力。"
L["Stand still, {name}. I aim this like a throwing axe, and I rarely miss."] = "站好，{name}。我瞄這個跟丟飛斧一樣，很少失手。"
L["Lok'tar, {name}. It means 'victory'. Today it also means 'yes'."] = "Lok'tar，{name}。意思是「勝利」，今天也是「好」。"
L["Lok'tar ogar, {name}! Take this into battle. A tavern brawl also counts."] = "Lok'tar ogar，{name}！帶上戰場。酒館打架也算。"
L["Blood and thunder, {name}! Go and earn your glory."] = "血與雷霆，{name}！去贏得你的榮耀！"
L["Among orcs, {name}, making you stronger is how we say we like you."] = "獸人表達好感的方式，{name}：讓你變強。"
L["An orc giving gifts unasked? Tell no one, {name}. It ruins the image."] = "獸人主動送禮？別說出去，{name}。有損形象。"
L["The Warchief wants us diplomatic, {name}. This is my diplomacy."] = "大酋長要我們講外交，{name}。這就是我的外交。"
L["Go hit something for me, {name}. Or set it on fire. Orcs aren't fussy."] = "替我去揍點東西，{name}。或放火燒掉。獸人不挑。"
L["Don't thank me, {name}. Just win, and do it loudly."] = "別謝我，{name}。贏就對了，贏得大聲點。"
L["I'd make a speech, {name}, but it's mostly shouting. Just take it."] = "本想致詞，{name}，但大部分是吼叫。拿去就是。"
L["An orc at your back, {name}, even when I'm not there. Take this."] = "就算我不在，{name}，也有獸人在背後挺你。拿著。"
L["'Strike first,' Grom always said, {name}. So: here, before you could ask."] = "格羅姆說「先下手為強」，{name}。所以不等你開口，拿去。"
L["Take it, {name}. A grunt who walks past a comrade gets a talking-to. From me."] = "拿去，{name}。對同袍視而不見的步兵，要被我訓話。"
L["Frostwolves share the hunt, {name}. I caught nothing today, so share this."] = "霜狼氏族分享獵物，{name}。今天沒抓到，分你這個。"
L["Walk the Durotar way, {name}: head up, sun on your neck, scorpid underfoot."] = "照杜洛塔的走法，{name}：抬頭、曬脖子、腳踩蠍子。"
L["Here, {name}. The spirits favour the generous."] = "給你，{name}。眾靈眷顧慷慨之人。"
L["Orcs give two things freely, {name}: advice and this. Skip the advice."] = "獸人免費送兩樣東西，{name}：建議和這個。建議就免了。"
L["The Barrens don't end, {name}. They just get more zhevra. Take this."] = "貧瘠之地沒有盡頭，{name}，只有越來越多斑馬。拿著。"
L["Strength for your arm, {name}. The honour, I see, you brought yourself."] = "力量給你的手臂，{name}。榮譽嘛，你自己帶來了。"
L["My wolf wanted you to have his bone, {name}. I talked him down to this."] = "我的狼想把骨頭送你，{name}。我說服牠換成這個。"
L["Throm-ka, {name}! The blood of the clans runs strong in you."] = "Throm-ka，{name}！氏族之血在你體內奔騰！"
L["An orc, {name}! Finally, somebody who shouts at my volume."] = "獸人！{name}，終於有人跟我一樣大聲了。"
L["Frostwolf, Warsong or Blackrock, {name}, we all argue like family."] = "霜狼、戰歌還是黑石，{name}，吵起來都像一家人。"
L["Between orcs no words are needed, {name}. Good. I was out of them."] = "獸人之間不必多言，{name}。正好，我詞窮了。"
L["Grunt or shaman, {name}, it's the same stubborn blood."] = "步兵或薩滿，{name}，流的都是同樣倔的血。"
L["Two orcs, {name}, and nobody's shouted yet. The shamans will call it an omen."] = "兩個獸人，{name}，居然還沒人吼。薩滿會說這是預兆。"
L["Our clans probably feuded once, {name}. Everybody's did. Let's call it settled."] = "我們的氏族以前大概有仇，{name}。大家都有。就算扯平了。"
L["Between orcs, {name}, 'victory or death' is just how we say 'see you later'."] = "獸人之間，{name}，「不勝則死」就是「回頭見」。"
L["Your tusks and mine have seen worse days, {name}. This is a better one."] = "你我的獠牙都見過更糟的日子，{name}。今天好多了。"
L["The plan, {name}: we hit it. Questions? No? Good plan."] = "{name}，計畫：揍它。問題？沒有？好計畫。"
L["A true warband, {name}. Loud, angry, and all on the same side for once."] = "真正的戰團，{name}。又吵又兇，難得全站同一邊。"
L["Stay with the warband, {name}. Strength in numbers. And in axes."] = "跟緊戰團，{name}。人多力量大，斧頭多也是。"
L["If you fall, {name}, I carry you out. Complaining the whole way, but I carry."] = "你倒下，{name}，我扛你出去。一路抱怨，但會扛。"
L["Fight well, {name}, and tonight you share our fire. And our boasting."] = "打得好，{name}，今晚就來烤火。順便聽我們吹牛。"
L["Nobody runs, {name}. Walking briskly away is allowed. Barely."] = "不准逃，{name}。快步走開可以。勉強可以。"
L["I'll go first, {name}. I have the thickest skull here, and I'm proud of it."] = "我先上，{name}。這裡我頭殼最硬，我很驕傲。"
L["When the war drums start, {name}, charge. We have no drums. I'll hum."] = "戰鼓一響，{name}，就衝。我們沒鼓，我來哼。"
L["Watch my back, {name}. The front I can see; that's the part I hit."] = "顧好我背後，{name}。前面我看得到，那是我負責揍的。"
L["One clan today, {name}: the Clan of Whoever Showed Up. Finest there is."] = "今天只有一個氏族，{name}：「有來的」氏族。天下第一。"
L["Anything big comes through that door, {name}, it's mine. Anything bigger, ours."] = "大傢伙進門，{name}，歸我。更大的，歸我們。"
L["Scars are stories, {name}. Let's all come out of this with short ones."] = "傷疤就是故事，{name}。這次大家都只留短篇吧。"
L["Old chieftains had war councils, {name}. We have me pointing at things."] = "以前的酋長有戰爭議會，{name}。我們有我負責指東西。"
L["If I charge early, {name}, it isn't impatience. It's tradition."] = "我要是提早衝，{name}，不是沒耐心，是傳統。"
L["Thank you, {name}. It would warm my heart, if it still beat."] = "謝了，{name}。心要是還跳得動，肯定暖和。"
L["Such warmth, for one so cold? Returned in full, {name}."] = "對冰冷的我這麼溫暖？如數奉還，{name}。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd blush, but the blood stopped reaching my face."] = "謝謝，{name}。我很想臉紅，但血早就上不來了。"
L["My undying gratitude, {name}. For once, the phrase is accurate."] = "獻上不死的謝意，{name}。這次是字面意思。"
L["Most kind, {name}. You've lifted me from 'deceased' to 'mildly deceased'."] = "好心人，{name}。我從「死透」變成「半死」了。"
L["Returned, {name}. Death took my pulse, not my manners."] = "回敬你，{name}。死亡帶走了脈搏，沒帶走禮貌。"
L["I felt that, {name}, and I don't feel much these days. Here, feel this."] = "我感覺到了，{name}，難得啊。來，換你感受。"
L["Thank you, {name}. That's the first colour I've seen all week."] = "謝謝，{name}。這是我這週看到的第一抹顏色。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Kindness above ground; I'd almost forgotten it happens."] = "謝謝，{name}。地面上的善意，我都快忘了有這回事。"
L["Too kind, {name}. Returned, with a little grave chill on it."] = "太客氣了，{name}。還你，附贈一絲墳墓寒氣。"
L["The last gift I got was the plague, {name}. Yours is a big improvement."] = "我上次收到的禮是瘟疫，{name}。你的好多了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Nothing this fresh has touched me since Lordaeron fell."] = "謝謝，{name}。羅德隆陷落後，我就沒碰過這麼新鮮的東西。"
L["Sylvanas says we repay every debt, {name}. She rarely means the nice ones."] = "希瓦娜斯說有債必還，{name}。她指的通常是血債。"
L["My posture's improved, {name}. It's been slumping since the Third War. Thanks."] = "我的腰挺起來了，{name}。從第三次大戰就一直駝著。謝了。"
L["Repaid at once, {name}. We Forsaken never carry debts. They rot."] = "立刻還你，{name}。被遺忘者從不欠債，放久會爛。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I've an eternity to remember this, and I intend to."] = "謝謝，{name}。我有永恆可以記住這件事，我會記著。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll keep this somewhere safe. My ribcage has room."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會收好，肋骨裡還有空位。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Once I'd have baked you a pie for that."] = "謝謝，{name}。換作以前，我會為此烤個派給你。"
L["I'll mention you to the Dark Lady, {name}. She won't care, but I will."] = "我會跟黑暗女士提起你，{name}。她不會在乎，但我在乎。"
L["Kindness returned, {name}. Even the flies around me look impressed."] = "禮尚往來，{name}。連我身邊的蒼蠅都很佩服。"
L["In all my years with the Scourge, nobody once said this, {name}. Thank you."] = "在天譴軍那麼多年，{name}，沒人對我說過：謝謝你。"
L["I'll drink to you tonight, {name}. It all leaks out, but it's the thought."] = "今晚我敬你一杯，{name}。雖然會全漏光，心意到就好。"
L["The Dark Lady says trust no gift, {name}. I'll risk it, and send one back."] = "黑暗女士說別信任何禮物，{name}。我賭一把，還你一份。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You've made my list of reasons to keep going. It's short."] = "謝謝，{name}。你列入我「撐下去的理由」了。清單很短。"
L["Thank you, {name}. No contract, no fine print. Varimathras should take notes."] = "謝謝，{name}。沒契約，沒附註小字。瓦里瑪薩斯該學學。"
L["Grave dirt and gratitude, {name}: all I own. You'll prefer the gratitude."] = "墳土和謝意，{name}：我的全部家當。你會比較想要謝意。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Eternity drags; this was the best bit of the decade."] = "謝謝，{name}。永恆很難熬，這是這十年最棒的一刻。"
L["Faranell would want notes on that reaction, {name}. I'll just return it."] = "法拉尼爾會想記錄這反應，{name}。我直接還你就好。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Lordaeron had manners once. Glad somebody kept them."] = "謝謝，{name}。羅德隆曾經很有禮貌，幸好有人留住了。"
L["Even the Deathguard would nod at that, {name}, and they nod at nothing."] = "連亡靈衛兵都會點頭，{name}，他們從不點頭的。"
L["I'd have Lordaeron's bells rung for you, {name}, but they only do funerals now."] = "想為你敲響羅德隆的鐘，{name}，但它們現在只敲喪鐘。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Next time I'm in Brill, I'll name a pumpkin after you."] = "謝了，{name}。回布瑞爾就給南瓜取你的名字。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My afterlife had rather let itself go. You've tidied it up."] = "謝了，{name}。死後我就不修邊幅，你替我打理了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Try not to die. It's overrated."] = "當然，{name}。別死，死亡被高估了。"
L["You need only ask, {name}. The dead are patient."] = "開口就是了，{name}。死者很有耐心。"
L["Ask the dead for a favour, {name}. We rarely have other plans."] = "找死人幫忙準沒錯，{name}。我們行程很空。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Stand clear; I'd hate to drop anything on you."] = "當然，{name}。站開點，免得我掉什麼到你身上。"
L["A moment, {name}. Rigor mortis is hard on the casting hand."] = "稍等，{name}。屍僵對施法的手很不友善。"
L["Nice to be asked for something, {name}, besides the way to the graveyard."] = "難得有人問我事，{name}，不是問墓地怎麼走。"
L["Gladly, {name}. It takes my mind off the smell. Mine, I mean."] = "樂意，{name}。能讓我忘了那股味道。我身上的。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Hold still. My aim drifts when my eye does."] = "好，{name}。別動，我眼珠一飄，準頭也跟著飄。"
L["In Undercity nobody says please, {name}. Mostly they gurgle. Here you are."] = "幽暗城沒人說「請」，{name}，只會咕嚕。給你。"
L["Just {buff}, {name}? The apothecaries always want a sample too."] = "只要{buff}嗎，{name}？藥劑師通常還會順便要個樣本。"
L["I always rise when called, {name}. Unfortunate history. Here you are."] = "隨叫隨起，{name}。當年被喚醒的後遺症。給你。"
L["Anything for you, {name}. Within reason, and what's left of mine."] = "什麼都行，{name}。以我僅剩的理智為限。"
L["Of course, {name}. I'd say 'over my dead body', but that's been tried."] = "當然，{name}。本想說「除非我死了」，但死過了。"
L["Right away, {name}. The dead don't dawdle. We shamble with purpose."] = "馬上，{name}。死人做事不拖拉，只拖著腳走。"
L["Of course, {name}. Free will is a gift. I spend mine on things like this."] = "當然，{name}。自由意志難得，我就花在這上面。"
L["At once, {name}. I've had far worse requests from the Apothecarium."] = "馬上，{name}。藥劑師協會提過糟得多的要求。"
L["Of course, {name}. After a winter in the Plaguelands, this counts as a holiday."] = "當然，{name}。熬過瘟疫之地的冬天，這算度假。"
L["{buff}, {name}? With the Dark Lady's compliments."] = "{buff}？{name}，黑暗女士向你致意。"
L["Of course, {name}. I don't sleep or eat, so I may as well be useful."] = "當然，{name}。我不睡也不吃，不如做點有用的事。"
L["Glad to, {name}. The Scourge used my hands for worse."] = "樂意，{name}。天譴軍拿我這雙手做過更糟的事。"
L["Stay among the living a little longer, {name}."] = "在活人堆裡多待一會吧，{name}。"
L["Take this, {name}. The grave can wait."] = "拿著，{name}。墳墓等得起。"
L["I was a physician in Lordaeron, {name}. Old habits die harder than I did."] = "我在羅德隆當過醫生，{name}。老習慣比我還難死。"
L["No charge, {name}. The apothecaries would have made you sign something."] = "免費，{name}。換成藥劑師，會先叫你簽點東西。"
L["A gift from the grave, {name}. Don't worry, I washed it."] = "來自墳墓的禮物，{name}。放心，我洗過了。"
L["Every traveller needs a little help, {name}. Here's yours."] = "每個旅人都需要點幫助，{name}。這是你的。"
L["I've seen where heroes end up, {name}. I live there. Take this."] = "我見過英雄的歸宿，{name}。我就住那。拿著。"
L["Take this, {name}. I learned the hard way you can't take it with you."] = "拿著，{name}。生不帶來死不帶去，我親身證實過。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's the only thing I own that isn't slightly damp."] = "拿著，{name}。這是我身上唯一不潮的東西。"
L["Hold on to yourself, {name}. Trust me, the pieces are hard to find later."] = "保重身體，{name}。信我，散掉的零件很難找。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Plaguelands are full of people who didn't."] = "拿著，{name}。瘟疫之地到處都是沒拿的人。"
L["A small kindness, {name}. Tirisfal could use more of them."] = "一點心意，{name}。提里斯法正缺這個。"
L["Tirisfal fog gets into everything, {name}. So does this, but pleasantly."] = "提里斯法的霧無孔不入，{name}。這也是，舒服版。"
L["Here, {name}. Kept cool for you, like everything I carry."] = "給你，{name}。冰過了，我帶的東西都是冰的。"
L["I've outlived everyone I knew, {name}. I'd rather not outlive you. Take this."] = "熟人我都送走了，{name}，不想再送走你。拿著。"
L["Pardon me, {name}. I'm told I lurk. I'm trying to lurk helpfully."] = "打擾，{name}。都說我鬼鬼祟祟，就鬼祟地幫個忙。"
L["Out of my own pocket, {name}. The dead don't need much."] = "自掏腰包，{name}。死人需要的不多。"
L["I've already had the worst day there is, {name}. Let's spare you yours."] = "最糟的那天我已經過完了，{name}。你的就免了吧。"
L["Wind's off the Plaguelands, {name}. Take this, and breathe through your mouth."] = "風從瘟疫之地吹來，{name}。拿著，改用嘴巴呼吸。"
L["The crows have been watching you, {name}. Let's disappoint them."] = "烏鴉一直盯著你，{name}。讓牠們失望吧。"
L["Here, {name}. Tirisfal grows nothing but pumpkins and grudges. This is neither."] = "{name}，提里斯法只長南瓜跟怨恨。這兩樣都不是。"
L["Take this, {name}. The only thing in Undercity that needn't be boiled first."] = "拿著，{name}。幽暗城唯一不必先煮沸的東西。"
L["Eternity is long, {name}, and I've spent a fair bit of it practising this."] = "永恆很長，{name}，我花了不少時間練這個。"
L["For the road, {name}. Undercity-made, so do keep it away from open flame."] = "路上用，{name}。幽暗城製造，請遠離火源。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's odourless, which I'm told makes it my best feature."] = "拿著，{name}。無臭無味，據說是我最大的優點。"
L["Forsaken are famously patient, {name}. I just couldn't wait to give you this."] = "被遺忘者最有耐心，{name}，但這個我等不及了。"
L["No strings attached, {name}. I cut mine when the Lich King lost his grip."] = "不附條件也不附線，{name}。巫妖王鬆手時就剪了。"
L["Fresh from Tirisfal, {name}. Well, fresh for Tirisfal."] = "提里斯法新鮮直送，{name}。以提里斯法的標準啦。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Bulwark taught me to look out for the living."] = "拿著，{name}。壁壘教會我照顧活人。"
L["We Forsaken must look after each other, {name}."] = "我們被遺忘者得互相照應，{name}。"
L["Between us corpses, {name}, you're remarkably well preserved."] = "屍體之間說句實話，{name}，你保存得真好。"
L["Lose a finger, {name}, and I've a spare. Forsaken share."] = "手指掉了找我，{name}。被遺忘者有備品共享。"
L["Is your jaw clicking too, {name}, or is that just me?"] = "你的下巴也喀喀響嗎，{name}？還是只有我？"
L["Victory for Sylvanas, {name}. A small one this time, but it's ours."] = "勝利屬於希瓦娜斯，{name}。這次小勝，但歸我們。"
L["Brill or Deathknell, {name}? We all woke up somewhere. I got the damp crypt."] = "布瑞爾還是喪鐘鎮醒的，{name}？我抽到潮濕墓穴。"
L["When the Scourge comes calling, {name}, we won't be home. Not ever again."] = "天譴軍再來敲門，{name}，我們都不在。永遠不在。"
L["The Bulwark still holds, {name}, and so do we. Held together, but holding."] = "壁壘還撐著，{name}，我們也是。縫縫補補地撐著。"
L["Lordaeron raised us twice, {name}: once as children, once as Forsaken."] = "羅德隆生了我們，{name}，也「再生」了我們。"
L["Somewhere in Northrend, {name}, the Lich King is sulking about us. Good."] = "巫妖王在北裂境生我們的悶氣，{name}。很好。"
L["The Dark Lady needs us whole, {name}. Near enough will do."] = "黑暗女士要我們完好無缺，{name}。差不多就行。"
L["You smell of Tirisfal, {name}. From one of us, that's a compliment."] = "你有提里斯法的味道，{name}。自己人說這是稱讚。"
L["We've both got forever, {name}. Let's not spend it all waiting for the lift."] = "我們都有永恆，{name}。別全花在等升降梯上。"
L["One Forsaken to another, {name}: the sewer shortcut is not a shortcut."] = "自己人提醒你，{name}：走下水道不是捷徑。"
L["If the Deathguard ask, {name}, we're on patrol. A very, very slow patrol."] = "亡靈衛兵問起，{name}，就說在巡邏，龜速巡邏。"
L["Our kind don't get many kindnesses, {name}. Let's keep them in the family."] = "我們這種人很少被善待，{name}。肥水不落外人田。"
L["Same grave dirt, same Dark Lady, {name}. That's family."] = "同樣的墳土，同一位黑暗女士，{name}。這就是家人。"
L["Keep the faith, {name}. In each other, I mean. It answers more often."] = "保持信仰，{name}。我是說信彼此，比較常有回應。"
L["The dead look after the dead, {name}. The living could learn a thing or two."] = "死人照顧死人，{name}。活人該好好學學。"
L["We've both seen the inside of a grave, {name}. Dreadful service. No view."] = "我們都住過墳墓，{name}。服務很差，也沒景觀。"
L["Stay alive, {name}. Undercity's housing list is already very long."] = "保住小命，{name}。幽暗城的房子要排很久。"
L["If I fall down, {name}, give it a minute. Old habit."] = "我若倒下，{name}，等一下。老習慣。"
L["I'll take the front, {name}. What's the worst that could happen? Again?"] = "我打頭陣，{name}。最糟又能怎樣？再死一次？"
L["Keep upwind of me, {name}. It's better for morale."] = "站我上風處，{name}。對士氣比較好。"
L["The last party I joined, {name}, I woke up in a crypt. Let's improve on that."] = "上次組隊，{name}，我在墓穴裡醒來。這次爭氣點。"
L["Anything that bites, {name}, point it at me. There's nothing left worth eating."] = "會咬的都丟給我，{name}。我身上沒啥好吃的了。"
L["Heal the others first, {name}. I run on spite and embalming fluid."] = "先治療別人，{name}。我靠怨氣和防腐液運轉。"
L["If this goes badly, {name}, don't worry. I've died before; it passes."] = "搞砸也別怕，{name}。我死過，會過去的。"
L["I've fought the Scourge from both sides, {name}. This side's better company."] = "天譴軍兩邊我都待過，{name}。這邊同伴好多了。"
L["Stay close, {name}. I'm the one who won't scream at the ghouls. Old neighbours."] = "跟緊，{name}。見到食屍鬼不尖叫的是我，老鄰居。"
L["I've walked the Plaguelands at night, {name}. This is a stroll by comparison."] = "我半夜走過瘟疫之地，{name}。這根本是散步。"
L["The corpse at the back is me, {name}. Please don't bury it."] = "後面那具屍體是我，{name}。請勿掩埋。"
L["Stay together, {name}. It's easier than putting somebody back together."] = "大家黏緊點，{name}。總比把人重新黏回去容易。"
L["Don't wait for me, {name}. I shamble, but I shamble forever. I'll catch up."] = "別等我，{name}。我走得慢，但永遠不停，追得上。"
L["Keep the torches clear of me, {name}. I'm old, dry and very flammable."] = "火把離我遠點，{name}。我又老又乾，一點就著。"
L["Don't check me for a pulse after, {name}. It only worries people."] = "打完別摸我脈搏，{name}。只會嚇到人。"
L["Mind the green puddles, {name}. I've seen what they do. I'm what they do."] = "小心綠色水窪，{name}。踩了會怎樣？就是我這樣。"
L["Lordaeron fell with me in it, {name}. This won't be worse."] = "羅德隆陷落時我就在城裡，{name}。這次不會更糟。"
L["Stick together, {name}. The apothecaries pay well for strays."] = "別走散，{name}。藥劑師收走失的人，價錢不錯。"
L["If this ends underwater, {name}, don't mind me. Breathing's optional now."] = "要是得潛水，{name}，別管我。呼吸現在是選配。"
L["The Dark Lady trusts no one, {name}. I've made an exception for this party."] = "黑暗女士誰都不信，{name}。我為這支隊伍破個例。"
L["When we win, {name}, drinks at the Gallows' End in Brill. My treat. Your risk."] = "贏了去布瑞爾喝一杯，{name}。我請客，風險你擔。"
L["Don't mind the flies, {name}. They're with me."] = "別理蒼蠅，{name}。牠們是跟我的。"
L["I'll watch the rear, {name}. Nothing sneaks up on someone who can't blink."] = "我來顧後面，{name}。誰都偷襲不了不會眨眼的人。"
L["Any blood on the floor after, {name}, it isn't mine. I stopped carrying any."] = "地上有血，{name}，都不是我的。我早就不帶血了。"
L["The dead keep terrible hours, {name}. Nice to have company for once."] = "死人作息很糟，{name}。難得有人作伴。"
L["Midnight, {name}: the best hour to be up and about when you shouldn't be."] = "午夜了，{name}：最適合不該起來的人起來走動。"
L["The living are all asleep, {name}. We Forsaken call this the quiet shift."] = "活人都睡了，{name}。被遺忘者的大夜班開始了。"
L["Late, {name}? In Undercity, this is lunchtime."] = "晚了？{name}，這在幽暗城算午餐時間。"
L["This is the hour the Scourge used to walk, {name}. Now it's ours."] = "這曾是天譴軍出沒的時辰，{name}。現在歸我們了。"
L["Night, {name}. The one time nobody can tell I'm pale."] = "晚上了，{name}。只有這時沒人看出我臉色蒼白。"
L["Dark as the Undercity, {name}. Finally, some proper lighting."] = "暗得跟幽暗城一樣，{name}。總算有像樣的燈光了。"
L["Fog, moonlight and a hint of mildew, {name}. Proper Tirisfal weather."] = "霧、月光加點霉味，{name}。道地提里斯法天氣。"
L["The banshees start singing about now, {name}. Relax. They're only practising."] = "女妖快開唱了，{name}。放輕鬆，她們在練習而已。"
L["Stars over Tirisfal, {name}. The one thing up there that never rotted."] = "提里斯法的星星，{name}。天上唯一沒爛掉的東西。"
L["Past midnight, {name}. The graveyards are quiet. The good ones, anyway."] = "過午夜了，{name}。墓地很安靜，至少好墓地是。"
L["An owl just saw me and left, {name}. They're sensible birds."] = "貓頭鷹一看到我就飛走了，{name}。牠們很識相。"
L["Morning already, {name}? I've been up all night. And all of last decade."] = "已經早上了，{name}？我整晚沒睡，過去十年也是。"
L["The sun's up, {name}. I'll stand in the shade, if you don't mind. Things peel."] = "太陽出來了，{name}。我站陰影裡，不然會脫皮。"
L["Early start, {name}. Of all things, I miss yawning."] = "起真早，{name}。說也奇怪，我最懷念打呵欠。"
L["Sunrise, {name}. My least favourite colour."] = "日出了，{name}。我最討厭的顏色。"
L["Dawn over Tirisfal, {name}: grey, then slightly less grey. Glorious."] = "提里斯法黎明，{name}：灰，然後沒那麼灰。壯觀。"
L["Morning, {name}. The Gallows' End porridge moved again. Have this instead."] = "早，{name}。布瑞爾旅店的粥又在動了，拿這個吧。"
L["The roosters in Brill still crow, {name}. Nobody's had the heart to tell them."] = "布瑞爾的公雞照樣啼，{name}。沒人忍心告訴牠們。"
L["Morning, {name}. The Deathguard change shifts now. They just turn round."] = "早，{name}。亡靈衛兵換班了：就是原地轉個身。"
L["Take the lift slowly, {name}. The last man who rushed it is still coming down."] = "升降梯慢慢搭，{name}。上個趕時間的還在往下掉。"
L["Undercity has it all, {name}: a bank, an inn, and opinions in the sewers."] = "幽暗城樣樣有，{name}：銀行、旅店、下水道名嘴。"
L["Even the rats bow to the Dark Lady here, {name}. Take this before one asks."] = "老鼠都向黑暗女士鞠躬，{name}。趁牠開口前拿去。"
L["Mind the canal, {name}. It's green for a reason, and the reason isn't moss."] = "小心運河，{name}。它綠有原因，而且不是青苔。"
L["Undercity's lovely this time of year, {name}. It's always this time of year."] = "幽暗城這季節最美，{name}。這裡永遠是這季節。"
L["We moved into Lordaeron's cellar, {name}, and kept the good silver."] = "我們搬進了羅德隆的地窖，{name}，好銀器都留著。"
L["The Royal Quarter's that way, {name}. Bow low; the banshees keep score."] = "皇家區在那邊，{name}。鞠躬低點，女妖會打分。"
L["The bat handler swears they're friendly, {name}. Take this before you test it."] = "蝙蝠管理員發誓牠們友善，{name}。測試前先拿著。"
L["Magic Quarter's that way, {name}. The glowing puddles aren't for drinking."] = "魔法區在那邊，{name}。發光的水窪不能喝。"
L["The throne room's just upstairs, {name}. Nobody sits in it. Bad memories."] = "王座廳就在樓上，{name}。沒人坐，回憶太差。"
L["Most folk greet a Forsaken with holy water, {name}. You're a welcome change."] = "大家見到我就潑聖水，{name}。你真讓人耳目一新。"
L["Few stop for a Forsaken, {name}. You did, and I noticed. Thank you."] = "很少人為我停步，{name}。你停了，我記著。謝謝。"
L["Contrary to rumour, {name}, not everything a Forsaken hands out is a plague."] = "別聽傳聞，{name}，被遺忘者送的不全是瘟疫。"
L["Forsaken can't be charmed, {name}, they say. Asking nicely works, though."] = "聽說被遺忘者不吃魅惑，{name}。好好拜託倒有用。"
L["Take this instead of small talk, {name}. Mine tends to unsettle people."] = "拿著，當作寒暄，{name}。我一開口大家就發毛。"
L["They say the Forsaken have no friends, {name}. I'm recruiting."] = "聽說被遺忘者沒朋友，{name}。我正在招募。"
L["Take this, {name}. If anyone asks, the Forsaken were perfectly charming."] = "拿著，{name}。有人問起，就說被遺忘者超有魅力。"
L["Stay alive, {name}. I've tried the alternative, and I can't recommend it."] = "好好活著，{name}。另一個選項我試過，不推。"
L["The Earth Mother saw your kindness, {name}. She nudged me. Quite hard."] = "大地之母看到了，{name}。她推了我一把，很用力。"
L["Thank you, {name}. May the winds guide you."] = "謝謝你，{name}。願風指引你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'm deeply moved, and it takes a lot to move a tauren."] = "謝謝，{name}。我被打動了，牛頭人可不好推動。"
L["It's a long way up to a tauren's heart, {name}. You found it."] = "要爬很高才到得了牛頭人的心，{name}。你到了。"
L["I felt that from horn to hoof, {name}. Returned, hoof to horn."] = "從角到蹄都感受到了，{name}，回敬你，從蹄到角。"
L["A gift given is a seed planted, {name}. Here is the harvest."] = "你種下善意，{name}。這就是收成。"
L["That deserves a feast, {name}. The feast can wait; {buff} can't."] = "這值得辦場宴席，{name}。宴席能等，{buff}不能。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Should you ever need a wall to hide behind, I'm free."] = "謝謝，{name}。哪天需要一堵牆躲，我有空。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My grandmother said kindness comes back on the wind."] = "謝謝，{name}。我祖母說，善意會隨風歸來。"
L["Returned faster than a wind rider, {name}, and with much less screeching."] = "還得比雙足飛龍還快，{name}，而且沒那麼吵。"
L["Returned, {name}. The quilboar never learned to give back, and look at them."] = "還你，{name}。野豬人從不懂回報，看看他們。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My ancestors are all nodding. It's a great deal of nodding."] = "謝謝，{name}。先祖們都在點頭，好多好多頭在點。"
L["In Mulgore we return a gift before the grass under it grows back, {name}."] = "在莫高雷，{name}，禮物下的草還沒挺起就得回禮。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll name my next kodo calf after you. They're lovely."] = "謝謝，{name}。小科多獸要取你的名，牠們超可愛。"
L["Kindness is rarer than shade in the Barrens, {name}. Here's some back."] = "善意比貧瘠之地的樹蔭還稀有，{name}。還你一點。"
L["I'll carve this on a totem, {name}. Tauren carve slowly; expect it by spring."] = "我會刻在圖騰上，{name}。牛頭人刻得慢，春天見。"
L["Bloodhoof Village will hear of this at supper, {name}. Thank you."] = "血蹄村晚餐時就會聽說這件事，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Cairne taught us to honour every kindness, {name}, and so I do."] = "凱恩教我們珍惜每份善意，{name}，我一直如此。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand tall and be at peace. I'll handle the tall part."] = "當然，{name}。挺直站好，至於高，交給我。"
L["Ask and it is given, {name}. The herd shares what it has."] = "有求必應，{name}。族群向來有福同享。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand back a pace; I do this with my whole body."] = "當然，{name}。退後一步，我這是全身出動。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Mind the tail."] = "樂意，{name}。小心尾巴。"
L["The Earth Mother gives freely, {name}, and so do her largest children."] = "大地之母慷慨給予，{name}，她最大隻的孩子也是。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Tauren are slow to anger and quick to help."] = "樂意，{name}。牛頭人發火慢，幫忙快。"
L["Refuse you, {name}? My ancestors would never let me hear the end of it."] = "拒絕你，{name}？祖靈會唸我唸到天荒地老。"
L["Of course, {name}. A tauren says yes the way the plains grow grass: easily."] = "當然，{name}。牛頭人說好，像草原長草一樣自然。"
L["Of course, {name}. One moment; my hands are big and the spell is small."] = "當然，{name}。稍等，我的手太大，法術太小。"
L["After a season herding kodo, {name}, a polite request is a holiday. Here."] = "趕完一季科多獸，{name}，有人客氣拜託就像放假。"
L["The Earth Mother says share, {name}. My stomach says lunch. She outranks it."] = "大地之母說分享，{name}，胃說吃飯。她官比較大。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand still as a totem; this won't take long."] = "當然，{name}。像圖騰一樣站好，很快就好。"
L["Spirits of the plains, lend me your strength. Here, {name}."] = "平原之靈啊，借我力量。給你，{name}。"
L["Magatha would want a favour for it, {name}. Baine would just say yes. So: yes."] = "瑪加薩會討人情，{name}，貝恩會說好。所以：好。"
L["Hold still, {name}. I've practised on kodo, and they're far less polite."] = "別動，{name}。我拿科多獸練過，牠們可沒你乖。"
L["Of course, {name}. A shu'halo never refuses a traveller. Or a second helping."] = "當然，{name}。牛頭人不拒絕旅人，也不拒絕添飯。"
L["Walk with the Earth Mother, {name}. She's everywhere, so you can't get lost."] = "與大地之母同行，{name}。她無處不在，迷不了路。"
L["May An'she light your path, {name}."] = "願安榭照亮你的路，{name}。"
L["You looked like you could use a friend, {name}. I'm a very big one."] = "看你像是需要個朋友，{name}。我這個特大號。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Earth Mother would scold me if I walked past."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是路過不管，大地之母會罵我。"
L["Tread lightly, {name}. Take it from someone who never has."] = "腳步放輕，{name}。聽我這個從沒放輕過的人說。"
L["The wind said you'd pass this way, {name}. The wind is a terrible gossip."] = "風說你會路過，{name}。風是個大嘴巴。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd lend you my kodo too, but he's less generous than me."] = "拿著，{name}。本想借你科多獸，但牠沒我大方。"
L["The shu'halo say carry what you can for others, {name}. I can carry a lot."] = "牛頭人說能扛就幫人扛，{name}。我很能扛。"
L["Take this, {name}. If the centaur trouble you, say Thunder Bluff sends regards."] = "拿著，{name}。半人馬找碴就說雷霆崖問候他們。"
L["Here, {name}. Plainstriders run from me for no reason at all. You needn't."] = "給你，{name}。平原陸行鳥無故見我就跑，你不用。"
L["For you, {name}. Visit Mulgore sometime. The grass is soft and nobody hurries."] = "給你，{name}。來莫高雷走走，草軟，沒人趕路。"
L["Here, {name}. Grandmother blessed travellers and fed them. I'm out of bread."] = "給你，{name}。奶奶祝福旅人又管飯，我沒麵包了。"
L["The spirits asked me to mind you, {name}. I said yes before they'd finished."] = "眾靈請我照看你，{name}。話沒說完我就答應了。"
L["Here, {name}. Kodo share the watering hole; I can share this."] = "給你，{name}。科多獸共用水塘，我也能分你這個。"
L["Here, {name}. Tauren leave the world a little better, and a little trampled."] = "給你，{name}。牛頭人讓世界好一點，也扁一點。"
L["The Earth Mother would offer you a nap, {name}. I offer this."] = "大地之母會讓你午睡，{name}。我給這個。"
L["Druids call it a blessing, hunters luck, {name}. Tauren call it manners."] = "德魯伊說祝福，獵人說運氣，{name}。牛頭人說禮貌。"
L["Take this, {name}. If a harpy screeches at you, screech back. They hate that."] = "鷹身人對你尖叫，{name}，就叫回去，她們最討厭。"
L["Here, {name}. A tauren blessing: sturdy, slow to fade, smells faintly of sage."] = "{name}，牛頭人祝福：耐用、持久，帶點鼠尾草香。"
L["The Earth Mother watches over us both, {name}."] = "大地之母看顧著我們倆，{name}。"
L["Somebody warn the doorframes, {name}. There are two of us now."] = "快去警告門框，{name}，現在我們有兩個了。"
L["Plains or peaks, {name}, a shu'halo heart is a big one."] = "莫高雷或高嶺，{name}，牛頭人的心一樣寬大。"
L["Horns and helmets, {name}. Only another tauren knows the pain."] = "角和頭盔，{name}。只有牛頭人懂這種痛。"
L["Rain on fur takes a week to dry, {name}. Only another tauren ever believes me."] = "毛淋濕要一週才乾，{name}。只有牛頭人信我。"
L["Between tauren, {name}: Thunder Bluff's lifts were built by somebody smaller."] = "自己人才說，{name}：雷霆崖升降梯是小個子蓋的。"
L["Our ancestors watch us both, {name}. Let's give them something nice to see."] = "先祖看著我們倆，{name}。演點好看的給祂們看。"
L["From Mulgore to Feralas, {name}, the herd always finds itself."] = "從莫高雷到菲拉斯，{name}，族群總會找到彼此。"
L["Get behind me, {name}. There's room back there for the whole party."] = "躲我後面，{name}。後面塞得下全隊。"
L["The herd moves together, {name}. Mind my hooves; the herd has learned to."] = "牛群同進退，{name}。小心我的蹄，大家都學乖了。"
L["Low ceilings ahead, {name}? I'll be the first to find out. Take this."] = "前面天花板很低？{name}，我會第一個撞到。拿著。"
L["I'm slow to anger, {name}, but I hold a grudge for the whole party."] = "我不容易生氣，{name}，但我會替全隊記仇。"
L["Need a wall to hide behind, {name}? I'm most of one. Come on."] = "要堵牆躲嗎，{name}？我算大半堵了。來。"
L["When I war stomp, {name}, everybody sit down. It saves you falling over."] = "我放戰爭踐踏時，{name}，大家先坐下，省得跌倒。"
L["Everyone fed? Everyone blessed? Good, {name}. Tauren never lead a hungry herd."] = "吃飽了？祝福了？好，{name}。牛群不能餓著上路。"
L["Tauren don't swim, {name}, we wade. If it's deep, you're riding on me."] = "牛頭人不游泳，{name}，用走的。水深的話你騎我。"
L["Stay close, {name}. My ancestors walk with us. They're quieter than you lot."] = "跟緊，{name}。先祖與我們同行，比我們安靜多了。"
L["If I fall, {name}, don't try to carry me. Drag me. Fondly."] = "我倒了，{name}，別想扛我，用拖的。溫柔地拖。"
L["We move like a stampede, {name}: all together, and sorry about the flowers."] = "我們像牛群狂奔，{name}：一起衝，對花草說抱歉。"
L["Nobody walks alone at the rear, {name}. That's where I'll be, looming kindly."] = "沒人獨自殿後，{name}。我在後頭慈祥地罩著大家。"
L["Tell me when to charge, {name}. Tauren are slow to start, and slower to stop."] = "要衝鋒就說，{name}。牛頭人起步慢，煞車更慢。"
L["Nobody wander, {name}. The last party that did in the Barrens is still walking."] = "別亂跑，{name}。在貧瘠之地亂跑的上一隊還在走。"
L["An'she rises, {name}, and so do we. Slower, in my case."] = "安榭升起，{name}，我們也起身。我慢一點。"
L["The sun is An'she's eye, {name}. He's watching, so let's look busy."] = "太陽是安榭之眼，{name}。他在看，快裝忙。"
L["Morning, {name}. The kodo are up, the grass is wet, and this is yours."] = "早，{name}。科多獸起來了，草還濕著，這個給你。"
L["Morning, {name}. I've greeted the sun, the wind and two plainstriders. Now you."] = "早，{name}。問候完太陽、風和兩隻陸行鳥，換你。"
L["Morning, {name}. Dew on the grass, dew on my fur. I'll be damp till noon."] = "早，{name}。草上有露水，我毛上也有，濕到中午。"
L["Early, {name}. That mist over Mulgore at dawn? Mostly kodo breath."] = "真早，{name}。莫高雷晨霧？多半是科多獸呼的氣。"
L["Mu'sha keeps the night watch, {name}. I'll tell her to keep an eye on you."] = "月亮守夜，{name}。我請她多看你一眼。"
L["The moon's out, {name}. Mu'sha sees you, and she approves. I asked."] = "月亮出來了，{name}。她看見你，很滿意。我問過。"
L["Late, {name}. The kodo are asleep, and they snore like thunder. Take this."] = "夜深了，{name}。科多獸睡了，打呼像打雷。拿著。"
L["Stars out, {name}. Each one's an ancestor, they say. That one's winking at you."] = "聽說星星都是先祖，{name}。那顆在對你眨眼。"
L["Late, {name}. Mulgore is so quiet at night you can hear the grass argue."] = "夜深了，{name}。莫高雷安靜到聽得見草在吵架。"
L["Quiet now, {name}. At this hour, even my hooves try to tiptoe."] = "小聲點，{name}。這時候連我的蹄都想躡手躡腳。"
L["Ya too kind, {name}! This one's from me."] = "你太客氣啦，{name}！這個咱送的。"
L["Thanks, mon! Da spirits smile on ya, {name}."] = "謝啦老兄！眾靈對你笑哩，{name}。"
L["Ya gave me good mojo, {name}. Now ya get some back, extra spicy."] = "你給咱好巫毒，{name}。現在還你，加辣的。"
L["Death's gonna be real disappointed, {name}. Thanks, mon."] = "死神這下要失望透了，{name}。謝啦，老兄。"
L["Fine work, {name}. Almost as fine as me. Almost."] = "幹得漂亮，{name}。快跟咱一樣漂亮了。快了。"
L["A troll can grow back a hand, {name}. Can't grow back honour. Here."] = "斷手咱能再長，{name}，榮譽可長不回來。拿去。"
L["Ya just made a troll smile, {name}, and we got a lot of teeth."] = "你讓食人妖笑了，{name}，咱牙齒可多了。"
L["Da loa keep a tally, {name}. You're on the good side of it."] = "羅亞會記帳，{name}。你在好人那欄。"
L["Beat me to it, {name}! Darkspear hate bein' second. Now we're even."] = "被你搶先啦，{name}！暗矛最恨當第二。這下扯平。"
L["I owe ya now, {name}, and trolls only like owin' da loa. Settled."] = "咱欠你了，{name}，食人妖只愛欠羅亞。還清啦。"
L["I'll tell all of Sen'jin 'bout ya, {name}. Makes a change from crabs."] = "咱要讓森金村都知道你，{name}。總比老聊螃蟹好。"
L["My hair just stood up taller, {name}. Didn't know it could. Thanks, mon."] = "咱頭髮又豎高了，{name}，還能更高耶。謝啦老兄。"
L["The spirits say give it back, {name}. They nag, but they're right."] = "眾靈說「還回去」，{name}。祂們很囉唆，但沒錯。"
L["Mojo for mojo, {name}: oldest trade in the jungle."] = "巫毒換巫毒，{name}：叢林最古老的生意。"
L["Vol'jin said repay kindness quick, {name}. He said a lot. Dat one stuck."] = "沃金說有恩快報，{name}。他講很多，這句記住了。"
L["That deserves a dance, {name}. Lucky ya: {buff} instead."] = "這值得跳支舞，{name}。算你走運：改送你{buff}。"
L["Jungle rule, {name}: what ya give comes back, often with teeth. Not this one."] = "叢林規矩，{name}：送出去的會回來，常常帶牙。這個不帶。"
L["A gift for a troll, {name}? We never forget a kindness."] = "送禮給食人妖，{name}？咱們從不忘記恩情。"
L["Sure thing, {name}. Hold still; mojo hates a movin' target."] = "沒問題，{name}。別動，巫毒最討厭移動靶。"
L["No trouble, {name}. Da loa like ya."] = "小事，{name}。羅亞喜歡你。"
L["Stay away from da voodoo, {name}. Except this one. This one's fine."] = "離巫毒遠一點，{name}。這個除外，這個沒事。"
L["Close ya eyes, {name}. Mojo gets shy when people watch."] = "閉上眼睛，{name}。巫毒被人看會害羞。"
L["Ya don't gotta ask twice, {name}. Ya barely gotta ask once."] = "不用問第二次，{name}。第一次都不太用問。"
L["Sure, {name}. A troll is mostly swagger. The rest is this."] = "好啊，{name}。食人妖八成靠氣勢，剩下靠這個。"
L["Ya asked polite, {name}. Polite gets the good stuff."] = "你問得有禮貌，{name}。有禮貌的拿好貨。"
L["Ya came to the right troll, {name}. The wrong one's over there, fishin'."] = "你找對食人妖了，{name}。找錯的那個在那邊釣魚。"
L["Yes, {name}. The loa owe me a favour, and I'm spendin' it on you."] = "好啊，{name}。羅亞欠咱人情，咱就花在你身上。"
L["Got a pouch full of mojo, {name}. Don't touch the other pouch."] = "咱有一袋巫毒，{name}。另一袋別碰。"
L["Anything for ya, {name}. Not my hair, though. Hair is sacred."] = "什麼都給你，{name}。頭髮除外，頭髮是神聖的。"
L["Troll magic, {name}, served hot. Blow on it first."] = "食人妖魔法，{name}，熱騰騰上桌。先吹一吹。"
L["Right away, {name}. A Zandalari priest would make a week of this."] = "馬上，{name}。換贊達拉祭司，這要搞一週。"
L["Easy one, {name}. Hard one's gettin' a raptor to sit still."] = "簡單啦，{name}。難的是叫迅猛龍坐好。"
L["Troll rule, {name}: never make a friend beg or a raptor wait. Here."] = "食人妖規矩，{name}：不讓朋友求，不讓迅猛龍等。"
L["Don't wiggle, {name}. Last one who did got the spell and a new haircut."] = "別亂動，{name}。上個亂動的，法術到手還附贈新髮型。"
L["Da loa watch over ya, {name}. They're real nosy that way."] = "羅亞在看著你，{name}。祂們就是這麼愛管閒事。"
L["Stay sharp, {name}. Take this with ya."] = "保持警覺，{name}。帶上這個。"
L["Ya look like somebody who appreciate quality, {name}. Here: quality."] = "你看起來很識貨，{name}。來，好貨。"
L["Here, {name}. Walk like ya own the jungle. I do."] = "給你，{name}。走路要像叢林是你家的。咱就這樣走。"
L["Everybody need mojo, {name}. I make so much I gotta give it away."] = "人人都需要巫毒，{name}。咱做太多了，只好送人。"
L["A little somethin' for ya, {name}. Don't ask where da loa got it."] = "一點小東西給你，{name}。別問羅亞從哪弄來的。"
L["Go on, {name}. Whatever tries to eat ya now gets indigestion."] = "去吧，{name}。現在誰想吃你，都會消化不良。"
L["Ya look dangerous now, {name}. Almost as dangerous as a troll."] = "你現在看起來很危險，{name}。快趕上食人妖了。"
L["No charge, {name}. Ya don't owe the loa a thing. Probably."] = "免費，{name}。你不欠羅亞什麼。大概啦。"
L["Raptors got bigger teeth than me, {name}. Now they got a problem."] = "迅猛龍牙比咱大，{name}。現在換牠們頭痛了。"
L["Troll hospitality, {name}: ya get mojo, ya get a smile, ya don't get my fish."] = "食人妖待客，{name}：巫毒有，笑容有，魚免談。"
L["Walk with mojo, {name}. Everybody else is just walkin'."] = "帶著巫毒走，{name}。別人那只叫走路。"
L["Free mojo, {name}! Quick, before the witch doctor finds out."] = "免費巫毒，{name}！快拿，別讓巫醫發現。"
L["The loa said give this to the next good soul, {name}. That's you."] = "羅亞說交給下一個好心人，{name}。就是你啦。"
L["Here, {name}. Hakkar never shared. Look what happened to him."] = "給你，{name}。哈卡從不分享，看看他的下場。"
L["Jungle's got two kinds of folk, {name}: ready, and lunch. You're ready."] = "叢林分兩種人，{name}：準備好的，和當午餐的。你是前者。"
L["Easy, {name}. This one tickles. Don't laugh; it gets offended."] = "放鬆，{name}。這個會癢。別笑，它會生氣。"
L["Take this, {name}. Darkspear never send a friend off empty-handed."] = "拿著，{name}。暗矛從不讓朋友空手上路。"
L["We look after our own, {name}. Always, mon."] = "自己人自己顧，{name}。永遠都是，老兄。"
L["Da rest of Azeroth stand up straight, {name}. We got more style."] = "別人都站得直挺挺，{name}。咱們彎著才有型。"
L["Ya tusks look sharp, {name}. Mine too, obviously."] = "你的獠牙很利喔，{name}。咱的也是，廢話。"
L["Every troll's family, {name}. Even the ones who still owe me gold."] = "食人妖都是一家人，{name}。連還欠咱錢的也是。"
L["One day we take the Echo Isles back from Zalazane, {name}. Together."] = "總有一天，咱們要奪回回音群島，{name}。一起。"
L["Two trolls, {name}. Da room just got taller and a lot more relaxed."] = "兩個食人妖，{name}。這裡瞬間變得又高又悠哉。"
L["The loa got their eyes on both of us now, {name}. Behave."] = "羅亞現在盯著咱倆，{name}。乖一點。"
L["Troll to troll, {name}: only we know how hard it is to buy boots."] = "食人妖對食人妖，{name}：只有咱懂買鞋多難。"
L["Our ancestors had empires, {name}. We got each other. Fair trade, I say."] = "祖先有帝國，{name}，咱們有彼此。咱說划算。"
L["Stay close, {name}. Trolls regenerate; da rest of ya gotta be careful."] = "跟緊，{name}。食人妖會再生，你們其他人小心點。"
L["Crew's got style, {name}. Now it's got mojo too."] = "這隊有型，{name}。現在還有巫毒了。"
L["We go in together, {name}, we come out together. That's the plan, mon."] = "一起進去，{name}，一起出來。計畫就這樣，老兄。"
L["Nobody fallin' today, {name}. Death can wait for the next group."] = "今天誰都不准倒，{name}。死神等下一隊吧。"
L["Keep ya head down, {name}. I keep mine up. Somebody gotta look good."] = "頭低一點，{name}。咱的頭抬著，總得有人帥。"
L["Raptor formation, {name}: fast, loud, and nobody look back."] = "迅猛龍陣形，{name}：要快、要吵、不准回頭。"
L["If a big snake shows up, {name}, don't run. Stand behind me."] = "大蛇來了別跑，{name}。躲咱後面。"
L["Need more mojo, {name}? Just shout. Not too loud; the loa are nappin'."] = "還要巫毒，{name}？喊一聲。小聲點，羅亞在午睡。"
L["They'll tell this one at Sen'jin, {name}. Let's give it a happy endin'."] = "森金村會講這段故事，{name}。給它個好結局吧。"
L["My tusks are sharp, {name}, but they can't be everywhere. Stay near."] = "咱獠牙很利，{name}，但沒辦法分身。跟緊。"
L["Nobody panic, {name}. Panic is bad mojo. Swagger is good mojo."] = "別慌，{name}。驚慌是壞巫毒，氣勢是好巫毒。"
L["See an idol with glowin' eyes, {name}? Don't touch it. Trust me."] = "看到眼睛發光的神像，{name}？別碰。相信咱。"
L["Night's the best time for mojo, {name}. Nobody sees where it's from."] = "夜裡最適合巫毒，{name}。沒人看得到是誰給的。"
L["The jungle wakes at night, {name}. So do I. This one's fresh."] = "叢林晚上才醒，{name}。咱也是。這個新鮮的。"
L["High moon, {name}, restless spirits. This keeps 'em off ya."] = "月正高，{name}，眾靈不安。這個幫你擋著。"
L["Hir'eek the bat loa keeps late hours too, {name}. This is from us both."] = "蝙蝠羅亞也是夜貓子，{name}。這份是咱倆送的。"
L["This late, {name}, only trolls and trouble are up. I'm the nice one."] = "這麼晚，{name}，只有食人妖跟麻煩還醒著。咱是好的那個。"
L["Stars out, {name}. Each one a loa, Granny said. That's a lot of watchers."] = "星星出來了，{name}。阿嬤說每顆都是羅亞。好多雙眼睛。"
L["Such courtesy does you credit, {name}. Nearly as much as it does me."] = "如此禮數為你增光，{name}。差點跟我一樣光彩了。"
L["How gracious, {name}. Allow me to return the favour."] = "何等風度，{name}。容我回敬一番。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I haven't felt this radiant since... well, this morning."] = "謝謝，{name}。上次這麼光彩照人是……今早。"
L["Kind of you, {name}. We sin'dorei never turn down free magic. Ask anyone."] = "{name}，免費魔法，辛多雷來者不拒。不信你問。"
L["Exquisite, {name}. I would know; I only accept the exquisite."] = "真是精品，{name}。我很懂，我只收精品。"
L["Lovely, {name}. I'll be insufferable about this all day. More than usual."] = "太美了，{name}。我會臭屁一整天，比平常還臭屁。"
L["Thank you, {name}. It even goes with my gold trim. You have an eye."] = "謝謝，{name}。還跟我的金邊很搭。你真有眼光。"
L["Returned in kind, {name}. A prettier kind, admittedly. I can't help it."] = "原樣奉還，{name}。只是更漂亮，我也沒辦法。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Visit Silvermoon; I'll show you all of it but Murder Row."] = "謝謝，{name}。來銀月城我帶你逛，兇殺路除外。"
L["Returned, {name}. Unlike Kael'thas, I give things back."] = "奉還，{name}。我可不像凱爾薩斯，拿了會還。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I felt that to the tips of my ears, and that's a long way."] = "謝謝，{name}。暖到耳尖了，那可是好長一段。"
L["Thank you, {name}. That was so kind my eyes nearly changed colour again."] = "謝謝，{name}。好心到我眼睛差點又變色了。"
L["A gift, unasked? Farstriders would call that an ambush. A lovely one, {name}."] = "沒問就送？遠行者叫這伏擊。好美的伏擊，{name}。"
L["Better than a mana crystal, {name}, and I've given those up. Mostly. Thank you."] = "勝過法力水晶，{name}。那個我戒了，大概。謝謝。"
L["Quick of you, {name}. Elves live for centuries, and you still beat me to it."] = "手真快，{name}。精靈活了幾百年，還是被你搶先。"
L["Charming, {name}. The sun favours the generous, and so do I."] = "真迷人，{name}。太陽眷顧慷慨的人，我也是。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll mention you at court. Well, at a very exclusive picnic."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會在宮廷……在高級野餐上提你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Courtesy is rare outside Silvermoon. Yours shines."] = "謝謝，{name}。銀月城外少見禮數，你的閃閃發光。"
L["Unasked kindness, {name}! Somebody tell Rommath; he'll want to study it."] = "主動行善，{name}！快告訴羅曼斯，他會想研究。"
L["Naturally, {name}. Only the finest for you."] = "自然，{name}。只給你最好的。"
L["For you, {name}? Of course. The sun gives freely."] = "給你？當然，{name}。太陽從不吝嗇。"
L["Patience, {name}. Radiance can't be rushed, only admired."] = "耐心點，{name}。光彩急不得，只能欣賞。"
L["Of course, {name}. {buff}, delivered with impeccable posture."] = "當然，{name}。{buff}，以無懈可擊的姿態送上。"
L["You asked nicely, {name}. In Silvermoon that counts for everything."] = "你問得很客氣，{name}。在銀月城，這最重要。"
L["One moment, {name}. I never cast anything without checking my hair."] = "稍等，{name}。施法前我一定先整理頭髮。"
L["At once, {name}. Keeping someone waiting is so terribly unfashionable."] = "馬上，{name}。讓人等候實在太不時尚了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Stand back a step; my sleeves are enchanted and very wide."] = "當然，{name}。退後點，我袖子附了魔，還超寬。"
L["Magisters would bill you, {name}. Blood Knights would lecture. I merely glow."] = "魔導師收錢，{name}，血騎士說教，我只發光。"
L["At once, {name}. If it goes well, tell everyone. If not, blame the robe."] = "馬上，{name}。成功了就到處說，失敗了怪長袍。"
L["At once, {name}. The dragonhawk can wait; it's used to waiting while I dress."] = "馬上，{name}。龍鷹可以等，我換衣服時牠等慣了。"
L["Gladly, {name}. We once took the Light from a naaru. Asking is so much nicer."] = "樂意，{name}。聖光我們跟那魯搶過，還是問的好。"
L["Three centuries of casting, {name}, and you're the first to say please."] = "施法三百年，{name}，你是第一個說「請」的。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Silvermoon's brooms sweep themselves, so my hands are free."] = "樂意，{name}。銀月城掃帚會自己掃，我閒得很。"
L["Of course, {name}. I keep my other spells for the rude."] = "當然，{name}。別的法術留給沒禮貌的人。"
L["Anar'alah belore, {name}. May the sun guide you, and light your good side."] = "Anar'alah belore，{name}。願太陽指引你，照亮你最美的角度。"
L["Shorel'aran, {name}. Fight with elegance."] = "Shorel'aran，{name}。優雅地戰鬥。"
L["Take this, {name}. Whatever happens out there is merely a setback."] = "拿著，{name}。外頭不管發生什麼，都只是小挫折。"
L["Everyone deserves to shine, {name}. Only a little less than me, of course."] = "人人都該閃耀，{name}。當然，比我暗一點。"
L["The sun is with you, {name}. I simply held the door for it."] = "太陽與你同在，{name}。我只是幫它開門。"
L["Go on, {name}, take it. The Sunwell's back; we can afford to be generous."] = "拿去吧，{name}。太陽之井回來了，我們大方得起。"
L["For you, {name}: {buff}, lightly scented with Silvermoon."] = "給你，{name}：{buff}，帶點銀月城的香氣。"
L["Here, {name}. Hand-cast in Silvermoon, so do try not to scuff it."] = "給你，{name}。銀月城手工施放，請小心別刮傷。"
L["A little Sunwell for you, {name}. It's been through a lot; treat it kindly."] = "一點太陽之井，{name}。它命很苦，溫柔點。"
L["Be prepared, {name}. We weren't, once, and now we have a scar for a road."] = "有備無患，{name}。上次沒備，換來死亡之痕。"
L["Here, {name}. I only give to the worthy. How convenient that you walked by."] = "給你，{name}。只送值得的人。你路過，真是剛好。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's been in my family for moments."] = "拿著，{name}。這是傳家寶，傳了好幾秒。"
L["We sin'dorei have lost much, {name}. Never our generosity. Or our cheekbones."] = "辛多雷失去很多，{name}，但慷慨沒丟，顴骨也沒。"
L["Take this, {name}. Should a mana wyrm follow you, it's only jealous."] = "拿著，{name}。要是法力浮龍跟著你，牠只是眼紅。"
L["Seven thousand years to perfect generosity, {name}. We started last week."] = "花了七千年修練慷慨，{name}。從上週開始。"
L["Take this, {name}. It came through the Undercity orb, so it's slightly dizzy."] = "拿著，{name}。搭幽暗城寶珠來的，還在暈。"
L["For you, {name}. It matches everything. I checked, obviously."] = "給你，{name}。什麼都搭，我當然試過了。"
L["If a ghoul stops you, {name}, say Silvermoon's still standing. They hate that."] = "遇到食屍鬼，{name}，就說銀月城還在。氣死牠們。"
L["The Sunwell shines for us both, {name}."] = "太陽之井為你我閃耀，{name}。"
L["Two sin'dorei in one place, {name}. The day just got twice as elegant."] = "兩位辛多雷同框，{name}。今天優雅度加倍。"
L["You too, {name}? Two sin'dorei, one mirror. We'll have to take turns."] = "{name}，兩個辛多雷一面鏡子，得輪流照了。"
L["Like the phoenix, {name}: we keep rising, and we look good doing it."] = "像鳳凰，{name}：我們浴火重生，而且姿態優美。"
L["Between sin'dorei, {name}: yes, the Horde is loud. Yes, we're used to it now."] = "私下說，{name}：部落確實很吵。對，習慣了。"
L["Sin'dorei to sin'dorei, {name}: we never speak of the green eyes. Agreed?"] = "同為辛多雷，{name}：綠眼睛那段，絕口不提。說好了？"
L["Magister or Farstrider, {name}, the sun rises for us all."] = "魔導師或遠行者，{name}，太陽為我們所有人升起。"
L["We both remember Quel'Thalas before the Scourge, {name}. Let's earn the after."] = "你我都記得天譴之前，{name}。之後，一起掙回來。"
L["Do keep pace, {name}. We have a reputation for arriving beautifully."] = "請跟上，{name}。我們以優雅登場聞名。"
L["Stand where the light is good, {name}. If we must fight, we'll look splendid."] = "站光線好的地方，{name}。要打，也要打得好看。"
L["A party at last, {name}. I did dress for one."] = "有隊伍了，{name}。我可是盛裝出席。"
L["The sun shines on all of us, {name}. Mostly on me, but it shares."] = "陽光普照大家，{name}。主要照我，但也分你們。"
L["One for you, {name}, and one for the party's image, which I've taken on myself."] = "一份給你，{name}。另一份給隊伍門面，也就是我。"
L["If I fall, {name}, arrange me attractively. The rest I leave to the priest."] = "我若倒下，{name}，把我擺好看點。其他交給牧師。"
L["Nobody touch the enchanted relics, {name}. Well, I may. I've had training."] = "誰都別碰附魔古物，{name}。我除外，受過訓練的。"
L["Every expedition needs a ranger, {name}. I'm not one, but I have the boots."] = "遠征隊少不了遊俠，{name}。我不是，但靴子有。"
L["We fight together, {name}, then tell it beautifully. I'll handle the telling."] = "一起打，{name}，然後說得漂亮。說的交給我。"
L["Whoever mends us is to be thanked, {name}. Me, admired. Carry on."] = "治療我們的人要謝，{name}。我嘛，要欣賞。繼續。"
L["If this goes badly, {name}, we blame the Scourge. It's traditional."] = "要是搞砸了，{name}，就怪天譴軍團。這是傳統。"
L["Mana potions are for emergencies, {name}. I've had eleven emergencies today."] = "法力藥水救急用，{name}。今天已經急了十一次。"
L["We walked out of the ashes once, {name}. We'll walk out of whatever's ahead."] = "灰燼我們都走出來了，{name}。前面的也行。"
L["The sun has risen, {name}, and so have I. We coordinate."] = "太陽升起了，{name}，我也起了。我們有默契。"
L["Dawn over Quel'Thalas is lovelier, {name}, but this will do. Just."] = "奎爾薩拉斯的晨光更美，{name}。這裡勉強及格。"
L["Morning light, {name}. The most flattering hour. For both of us, naturally."] = "晨光，{name}。最上相的時段，我們倆都是，當然。"
L["Breakfast in Eversong is fruit, tea and arcane, {name}. Skip to the arcane."] = "永歌早餐有水果、茶和秘法，{name}。先上秘法。"
L["Dawn, {name}. Red and gold across the sky. Somebody's been copying us."] = "黎明，{name}。滿天紅金，天空抄我們配色。"
L["Morning, {name}. Only Silvermoon's arcane guardians are up this early. And me."] = "早，{name}。銀月城這時只有秘法守衛醒著。和我。"
L["Your generosity is noted, {name}. In triplicate. Suramar remembers its friends."] = "慷慨已記下，{name}，一式三份。蘇拉瑪爾不忘友。"
L["Most gracious, {name}. Allow me to repay you in kind."] = "承蒙厚意，{name}。容我以禮相報。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Ten thousand years under a dome; I'm still practising that."] = "謝謝，{name}。穹頂下關了一萬年，這句還在練。"
L["A gift with no favour owed? The court would faint. Thank you, {name}."] = "不附帶人情的禮物？宮廷會嚇昏。謝謝，{name}。"
L["Returned, {name}. We keep careful accounts of kindness. And of slights."] = "奉還，{name}。恩情我們記得清清楚楚，怠慢也是。"
L["I'll mention you to First Arcanist Thalyssra, {name}. Favourably, even."] = "我會跟首席秘法師提起你，{name}。甚至說好話。"
L["Most kind, {name}. In Suramar we'd hold a banquet. Consider it held."] = "承蒙厚意，{name}。蘇拉瑪爾該設宴的，就當辦了。"
L["I'd send a formal letter of thanks, {name}, but this seemed quicker."] = "本該寄正式謝函，{name}，但這樣比較快。"
L["In Elisande's court a gift hid a knife, {name}. Yours hides none. Thank you."] = "艾莉珊德宮廷禮裡藏刀，{name}。你的沒有，謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My manasaber approves of you, and she approves of no one."] = "謝謝，{name}。我家刃豹喜歡你，牠誰都不喜歡。"
L["Exquisite, {name}. Once I'd have said 'adequate'. The world has humbled me."] = "精緻，{name}。以前頂多給「尚可」。我謙虛了。"
L["You fed a mind that once went hungry, {name}. We never forget those who do."] = "你餵飽了曾經飢餓的心靈，{name}。我們永不忘記。"
L["Centuries of court etiquette, {name}, and 'thank you' still says it best."] = "幾百年宮廷禮儀，{name}，還是「謝謝」說得最好。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You're invited to the next masquerade. Masks mandatory."] = "謝謝，{name}。邀你參加下次假面舞會，面具必備。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Oculeth would open a portal to say so. I'll simply cast."] = "{name}，歐庫雷斯道謝會開傳送門，我施個法就好。"
L["Of course, {name}. A little arcane polish, just for you."] = "當然，{name}。特地為你添點秘法光彩。"
L["A reasonable request, {name}. Granted."] = "合理的請求，{name}。准了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. The short version; the long one takes a lunar cycle."] = "當然，{name}。給你簡短版，完整版要念一個月。"
L["A request, how refreshing. The court only ever made demands. Here, {name}."] = "有人請求，真新鮮。宮廷只會下令。給你，{name}。"
L["Done, {name}, and free. Elisande would have charged you a favour for it."] = "好了，免費，{name}。艾莉珊德可是要收人情的。"
L["There, {name}. No need to bow. A small nod would be lovely, though."] = "好了，{name}。不必鞠躬。不過點個頭倒挺好。"
L["Of course, {name}. I've perfected this since before most cities had walls."] = "當然，{name}。多數城市還沒蓋城牆，我就練成了。"
L["Granted, {name}. I'd ask a favour back, but I'm trying to be less Suramar."] = "准了，{name}。本想討人情，但我在改蘇拉瑪爾腔。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Forgive the flourish. We can't cast plainly; we've tried."] = "當然，{name}。花俏請見諒，樸素試過，辦不到。"
L["At once, {name}. Elisande once stopped time. I only need a second."] = "馬上，{name}。艾莉珊德停過時間，我只需一秒。"
L["Of course, {name}. The ley lines here are shallow, but I'll make do."] = "當然，{name}。這裡的地脈淺得可憐，我將就用。"
L["Very well, {name}. Stand in the moonlight. Or by that lamp. Lamps will do."] = "好吧，{name}。站到月光下。或那盞燈旁，燈也行。"
L["Naturally, {name}. Suramar had a spell for everything. I remember several."] = "自然，{name}。蘇拉瑪爾凡事有法術，我記得幾個。"
L["Take this, {name}. Arcane gifts are wasted on the idle."] = "拿去，{name}。秘法可不送給懶人。"
L["A spark of Suramar's arcana for you, {name}. Use it wisely."] = "送你一絲蘇拉瑪爾秘法，{name}。善用它。"
L["I've gone without magic once, {name}. I don't recommend it. Take this."] = "我戒過一次魔法，{name}。不建議。拿著吧。"
L["The world outside the dome is so large, {name}. And so under-enchanted. Here."] = "穹頂外的世界真大，{name}。附魔卻真少。拿去。"
L["Arcwine is traditional, {name}, but {buff} travels better."] = "照傳統該送秘法酒，{name}，但{buff}比較好帶。"
L["Do take this, {name}. It's rude to refuse Suramar's hospitality. Very rude."] = "請收下，{name}。拒絕蘇拉瑪爾的款待，失禮至極。"
L["Here, {name}. I'm told this is how outsiders say hello. Charming custom."] = "給你，{name}。聽說外地人這樣打招呼，真可愛。"
L["Take this, {name}. Magic hoarded is magic spoiled, as Suramar learned."] = "拿著，{name}。魔法囤久會壞，問蘇拉瑪爾就知道。"
L["Once, I'd have made you bow for this, {name}. We've all grown."] = "以前這要你鞠躬才給，{name}。大家都成長了。"
L["The Kirin Tor do this too, {name}, bless them. Quite nicely, for newcomers."] = "祈倫托也會這招，{name}。新手嘛，挺可愛的。"
L["A gift from under the dome, {name}. Kept fresh for a very, very long time."] = "穹頂出品，{name}。冷藏一萬年，保證新鮮。"
L["Enjoy this, {name}. I used to cast it on nobility. You're an improvement."] = "請享用，{name}。以前只施給貴族，你強多了。"
L["I packed for the outside world like a gala, {name}. Four capes. Take this."] = "出門我照舞會打包，{name}：四件披風。這個給你。"
L["Here, {name}. Suramar work: overdesigned, overdecorated, and flawless."] = "給你，{name}。蘇拉瑪爾出品：浮誇、繁複、完美。"
L["Here, {name}. In Suramar this came with a string quartet. Do hum something."] = "給你，{name}。蘇拉瑪爾會配四重奏，麻煩哼一段。"
L["Suramar's children shine together again, {name}."] = "蘇拉瑪爾的子民再度同輝，{name}。"
L["Shal'dorei, {name}! You packed arcwine? Outsider wine is just... grapes."] = "夏多雷！{name}，有帶秘法酒吧？外頭的只是葡萄。"
L["Suramar's own, {name}. Try not to be too impressed by the rest of the world."] = "蘇拉瑪爾的同胞，{name}。別對外面的世界太驚豔。"
L["We survived the Legion and the withering, {name}. The rest is small talk."] = "燃燒軍團和枯萎都熬過了，{name}。其餘都是閒話。"
L["Our tailors made it out of Suramar too, {name}. Thank the stars."] = "我們的裁縫也逃出蘇拉瑪爾了，{name}。感謝群星。"
L["We both remember going hungry, {name}. Never again, for either of us."] = "我們都挨過餓，{name}。以後誰都不會了。"
L["Out from under the dome, {name}. Is the sky still this big for you too?"] = "出了穹頂，{name}。你也還覺得天好大嗎？"
L["Two shal'dorei in one place, {name}. The locals will assume it's a gala."] = "兩位夏多雷，{name}。路人會以為在辦晚宴。"
L["An expedition, {name}! In Suramar this needed six permits and a masquerade."] = "遠征！{name}，在蘇拉瑪爾要六份許可加假面舞會。"
L["The dome kept us safe, {name}. Now we must make do with one another. Gladly."] = "以前靠穹頂，{name}，現在靠彼此。我很樂意。"
L["Arcane for everyone, {name}. The court would call it waste. I call it company."] = "人人有份秘法，{name}。宮廷說浪費，我說是交情。"
L["Do follow my lead, {name}. I've had ten thousand years of walking in step."] = "請跟著我，{name}。我練了一萬年的整齊步伐。"
L["In a party one shares one's magic, {name}. How novel. I rather like it."] = "組隊就要分享魔法，{name}。真新奇，我挺喜歡。"
L["An outing is like a masquerade, {name}: smile, keep moving, watch for knives."] = "出征如假面舞會，{name}：微笑、走動、防暗箭。"
L["Stay in the light of my spells, {name}. It's the most flattering in the party."] = "待在我法術的光裡，{name}。全隊最上相的打光。"
L["After Elisande's court, {name}, this outing is a holiday. Nobody plots."] = "待過艾莉珊德的宮廷，{name}，這趟就是度假。沒人算計。"
L["Lost? Follow the one who glows, {name}. That's me. It's always me."] = "迷路？跟著發光的，{name}。是我。一直都是我。"
L["If I start lecturing on ley lines, {name}, do interrupt. Politely."] = "我若開講地脈學，{name}，請打斷。客氣地。"
L["I watched my people wither, {name}. I won't watch friends fade. Nobody falls."] = "我看過族人枯萎，{name}。朋友不行，誰都不准倒。"
L["Tell me if I'm being grand, {name}. I lose track. It's the millennia."] = "我太浮誇就提醒我，{name}。活了一萬年，難免。"
L["Night at last, {name}. Add a few thousand lanterns and it's nearly Suramar."] = "入夜了，{name}。再掛幾千盞燈，就像蘇拉瑪爾了。"
L["Under the dome it was always night, {name}. I feel quite at home."] = "穹頂下永遠是夜，{name}。像回到家了。"
L["The stars are out, {name}. We had better ones in Suramar. These will do."] = "星星出來了，{name}。蘇拉瑪爾的更美，這些將就。"
L["Nightborne, {name}, and here's the night. At last I'm dressed for the hour."] = "夜裔精靈遇上夜，{name}。這身終於應景了。"
L["At this hour, {name}, Suramar was only just getting dressed for dinner."] = "這個時間，{name}，蘇拉瑪爾才剛更衣準備晚餐。"
L["Daylight, {name}. Ten thousand years under a dome, and it still startles me."] = "天亮了，{name}。關了一萬年，陽光還是嚇我一跳。"
L["An early hour, {name}. The court never rose before noon. I'm reforming."] = "真早，{name}。宮廷向來睡到中午，我正改過自新。"
L["Morning, {name}. The sun here is so very... unenchanted. Take this instead."] = "早，{name}。這裡的太陽……沒附魔。用這個吧。"
L["Morning, {name}. We warded Suramar against every threat but the sun."] = "早，{name}。蘇拉瑪爾什麼都防，就是沒防太陽。"
L["Dawn, {name}: when the court's gossip went to bed. Here's mine: you look well."] = "宮廷八卦天亮收工，{name}。爆料：你氣色真好。"
L["A favour for a favour, {name}! Pleasure doing business."] = "人情換人情，{name}！合作愉快！"
L["Thanks, {name}! Consider your account settled in full."] = "感謝惠顧，{name}！帳款全數結清！"
L["Aw, {name}. I'd invoice you, but I'm feeling sentimental. It'll pass."] = "發票免了，{name}，我一時感性。很快會退的。"
L["Thanks, {name}! I checked it for fine print. There wasn't any. Weird!"] = "謝啦，{name}！我找過小字條款，沒有。怪了！"
L["Returned with interest, {name}. Minus the interest. Don't get used to it."] = "連本帶利還你，{name}。利息扣掉。別習慣了。"
L["Much obliged, {name}! You've just been upgraded to preferred customer."] = "感謝，{name}！恭喜升級為貴賓客戶！"
L["I'd name a rocket after you, {name}, but my rockets never last long. Thanks!"] = "想拿你命名火箭，{name}，可我的火箭短命。謝啦！"
L["I'd have charged fifty gold for that, {name}. Let's call us even."] = "這個我本來收五十金，{name}。就算扯平吧。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Quick hands. You'd do well in Booty Bay."] = "謝啦，{name}！手真快，在藏寶海灣一定吃得開。"
L["A deal where both sides profit, {name}! I'd heard of those. Never seen one."] = "雙贏耶，{name}！只聽說過，今天第一次看到。"
L["First free gift since Kezan blew up, {name}. Returning it before I price it."] = "凱贊爆了後首次白拿，{name}。趁沒標價先還你。"
L["Thanks, {name}! I appraised it at priceless. Here's one appraised the same."] = "謝啦，{name}！我估價：無價。這份同樣無價。"
L["Kindness in, kindness out, {name}. Best returns since the kaja'mite boom."] = "好心進好心出，{name}，報酬率凱贊以來最高。"
L["Even trade, {name}? My accountant just fainted. He does that around fair deals."] = "公平交易？{name}，我會計昏倒了。他對公道過敏。"
L["Thanks, {name}! I'd shake on it, but I count my fingers after. Habit, not you."] = "謝啦，{name}！握完手我習慣數手指，不是針對你。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Gadgetzan could use a few more like you."] = "謝啦，{name}！加基森就缺你這種人。"
L["You got it, {name}! Time is money, friend!"] = "好說，{name}！時間就是金錢，朋友！"
L["Deal, {name}! I'll put it on your tab. Kidding!"] = "成交，{name}！記你帳上。開玩笑！"
L["Right away, {name}! Satisfaction guaranteed or your {buff} back."] = "馬上來，{name}！保證滿意，否則退你{buff}！"
L["{buff}, {name}! Tips optional. Encouraged. Optional."] = "{buff}，{name}！小費隨意。歡迎給。隨意。"
L["Fast, cheap or good, {name}? Today you get all three. Don't spread it around."] = "快、便宜、好，{name}？今天三樣全給你。別張揚。"
L["Sure thing, {name}! No explosions this time, I promise. Mostly promise."] = "好說，{name}！這次不爆炸，我保證。大概保證。"
L["For you, {name}? No charge. Put that in writing and I'll deny it."] = "對你，{name}？免費。白紙黑字的話，我不認帳。"
L["Sure, {name}! Quote's zero gold. Lowest I've ever quoted. It stings a little."] = "沒問題，{name}！報價零金，我史上最低。有點痛。"
L["Coming up, {name}! Full warranty included. Valid until it wears off."] = "馬上來，{name}！全面保固，保到它消失為止。"
L["Sure, {name}! I'd tinker with it, but you look in a hurry."] = "好啊，{name}！本想再改裝一下，看你在趕時間。"
L["Easy, {name}. Steamwheedle rule: keep customers alive. They pay longer."] = "小事，{name}。熱砂規矩：讓客人活著，才能一直付錢。"
L["Gadgetzan's got the water trade, {name}. I've got this. Better margins."] = "加基森賣水，{name}，我賣這個，利潤更好。"
L["Kezan standard, {name}: fast, loud, and done before you read the terms."] = "凱贊規格，{name}：又快又吵，條款沒讀完就好了。"
L["On it, {name}! Goblins never keep a customer waiting. Unless it pays."] = "馬上，{name}！哥布林從不讓客人等。除非等了有錢賺。"
L["This one's on the house, {name}. Don't tell the Trade Prince."] = "這次免費，{name}。別跟貿易親王說。"
L["Top-shelf stuff, zero fees, {name}. Today only!"] = "頂級貨零手續費，{name}，只限今天！"
L["Free sample, {name}! If you like it, you know where to find me."] = "免費試用，{name}！喜歡的話，你知道去哪找我。"
L["Here, {name}. If anything explodes near you today, that was unrelated."] = "給你，{name}。今天附近若有爆炸，純屬巧合。"
L["Goodwill's an asset, {name}. Here's some {buff} for my books."] = "商譽也是資產，{name}。這份{buff}，入帳！"
L["Take this, {name}. Safety first! Or third. It's on the list somewhere."] = "拿著，{name}。安全第一！或第三。反正在清單上。"
L["Cast in record time, {name}! The record's mine. I set it just now."] = "破紀錄施法，{name}！紀錄是我的，剛剛才創的。"
L["Kaja'Cola gives you ideas, {name}. This does the rest. Take it!"] = "卡亞可樂給你靈感，{name}，其餘交給這個！"
L["Here, {name}. Go make your fortune. I'll want a cut."] = "給你，{name}。去發大財吧。我要抽成。"
L["Zeppelin's late again, {name}, so I've time to be generous."] = "飛艇又誤點了，{name}，我剛好有空大方一下。"
L["Here, {name}. Patent pending. Try it out and tell your rich friends."] = "專利申請中，{name}。好用就推給有錢朋友。"
L["Consider this an investment, {name}. In you. I expect heroic returns."] = "當作投資，{name}。投資你。期待英雄級報酬。"
L["Take it, {name}! My last shipment sank off Kezan, so everything's clearance."] = "拿去，{name}！上批貨在凱贊外海沉了，全面清倉。"
L["The Venture Company charges for this, {name}. I'm the competition. Here."] = "風險投資公司收費，{name}，我是對手，免費。"
L["Every goblin has a soft spot, {name}. Mine's small and guarded. You found it."] = "哥布林的心軟處又小又上鎖，{name}，被你找到了。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's the only thing I own with no lien on it."] = "拿著，{name}。這是我唯一沒被抵押的東西。"
L["You'll be rich someday, {name}. I can tell. Remember who gave you this."] = "你會發財的，{name}。苟富貴，勿相忘啊。"
L["Anything for a fellow entrepreneur, {name}!"] = "同是生意人，一切好說，{name}！"
L["Kezan's finest, together again, {name}. Keep a hand on your coin purse."] = "凱贊菁英再度聚首，{name}。錢包看緊。"
L["Fellow goblin, {name}? Then you know this is a very, very rare discount."] = "同是哥布林？{name}，那你知道這折扣有多稀有。"
L["Goblins look after goblins, {name}. It's cheaper than hiring guards."] = "哥布林照顧哥布林，{name}。比請守衛便宜。"
L["Kezan's gone, {name}, but the greed made it out. Look at us."] = "凱贊沒了，{name}，貪心倒是一點沒少。看看我們。"
L["Between goblins, {name}, this never happened. I have a reputation."] = "自己人說，{name}：這事沒發生過。我要顧名聲。"
L["Bilgewater or Steamwheedle, {name}, we always float to the top. Like oil."] = "污水或熱砂，{name}，我們總浮在上面，像油。"
L["Remember the volcano, {name}? We sold tickets to it. Proud times."] = "還記得火山嗎，{name}？我們賣過門票。光榮歲月。"
L["Group rate, {name}! Everybody here gets it half off. Of free."] = "團體價，{name}！全隊打五折。免費的五折。"
L["Nobody dies on my contract, {name}. The paperwork's a nightmare."] = "我合約期間不准死人，{name}。手續超麻煩。"
L["We split the take even, {name}. I'll do the maths. Trust me."] = "收穫平分，{name}。帳我來算。相信我。"
L["There, {name}. Everyone's stronger, and everyone owes me. Invoices later."] = "好了，{name}。大家都變強了，也都欠我。帳單隨後寄。"
L["Stick together, {name}. Mercenaries cost gold; friends only cost this."] = "團結點，{name}。傭兵要收金幣，朋友只要這個。"
L["Everybody's covered, {name}. Not insured, mind. Covered. Different price."] = "全員有罩，{name}。是罩，不是保險。價格不同。"
L["I read the risk report on this outing, {name}. Short read. It just says 'no'."] = "這趟的風險評估，{name}，只有一句：「不要。」"
L["Nobody touches the big red lever, {name}. There's always a big red lever."] = "誰都別碰紅色大拉桿，{name}。每次都有一根。"
L["If this goes south, {name}, I've got a rocket. Seats one. I'm working on it."] = "苗頭不對，{name}，我有火箭。只坐一人，改良中。"
L["We're a company now, {name}. I'm treasurer. The vote was unanimous. Mine."] = "組公司了，{name}。我當財務，全票通過：我那票。"
L["Stay alive, {name}. Nobody's found a way to sell resurrections yet. I'm trying."] = "別死，{name}。復活還沒辦法賣，我在研究。"
L["Stay close, {name}. I've already sold the story of this trip. Make it good."] = "跟緊，{name}。這趟的版權賣掉了，演精彩點。"
L["Early bird gets the gold, {name}! Here's a freebie. Don't tell the other birds."] = "早鳥優惠，{name}！這份免費，別告訴其他鳥。"
L["Morning, {name}! Markets open in an hour. Until then, I'm feeling generous."] = "早，{name}！市場一小時後開，在那之前我很大方。"
L["Up early, {name}? Smart. Time is money, and it's cheapest in the morning."] = "早起？{name}，聰明。時間就是金錢，早上最便宜。"
L["Dawn, {name}. Rich goblins sleep in. I'm not rich yet."] = "天亮了，{name}。有錢的哥布林都睡到自然醒。我還沒發財。"
L["Fresh day, fresh ledger, {name}. You're the first entry. The good column."] = "新一天新帳本，{name}。第一筆是你，收入欄。"
L["Thank you, {name}! The caravan always repays a kindness. Usually in string."] = "謝謝，{name}！商隊向來知恩圖報，通常用繩子報。"
L["How kind, {name}! You're on the caravan's good list now."] = "真好心，{name}！你上了商隊的好人名單啦。"
L["Oh, I'll keep this, {name}! I keep everything. Here's one for you."] = "這我要留著，{name}！我什麼都留。這份給你。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Here's yours back. Well, a new one. Hardly used."] = "謝啦，{name}！還你。呃，新的，幾乎沒用過。"
L["My ears just went straight up, {name}. That means I'm very pleased."] = "我的耳朵豎起來了，{name}，代表我超開心。"
L["By tonight's campfire, {name}, this story will have a sandworm in it. Thanks!"] = "今晚營火邊，{name}，這故事會多一隻沙蟲。謝啦！"
L["I'd gift-wrap yours, {name}, but all my wrapping is somebody's old map."] = "本想包裝，{name}，但包裝紙都是別人的舊地圖。"
L["The alpacas saw that, {name}. They'll tell everyone how nice you are. Thanks!"] = "羊駝都看到了，{name}，會到處說你人真好。謝啦！"
L["Thank you, {name}! I'd give you my best button, but this is better. Slightly."] = "謝謝，{name}！這比我最好的鈕扣還棒。一點點。"
L["Ooh, a present, {name}! I'll trade you one of mine."] = "哇，禮物，{name}！我拿一樣我的跟你換。"
L["Thanks, {name}! That goes in the good pouch. Not the rock pouch. The good one."] = "謝啦，{name}！收寶貝袋，不是石頭袋。寶貝袋！"
L["In Vol'dun that would've cost a whole waterskin, {name}. Thank you!"] = "這在沃魯敦值一整袋水，{name}。謝謝！"
L["Thanks, {name}! Your name goes on the wagon. Between the alpaca and the dent."] = "謝啦，{name}！名字寫到車上，羊駝跟凹痕之間。"
L["Kindness is the one thing the desert never buried, {name}. Thank you."] = "沙漠什麼都埋，就是埋不了善意，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Rakera says repay quick, {name}, before you forget which pocket it's in. Here!"] = "族長說快還，{name}，免得忘了在哪個口袋。來！"
L["Nobody's given me anything I didn't dig up first, {name}. Thank you!"] = "第一次收到不是我挖出來的東西，{name}。謝謝！"
L["Of course, {name}! Shake the sand out and hold still."] = "當然，{name}！抖掉沙子，站好別動。"
L["Coming right up, {name}! Caravan service, no waiting."] = "這就來，{name}！商隊服務，不用等！"
L["Sure, {name}! Let me dig it out... rope, rocks, a nice rock... here it is!"] = "{name}，等等……繩子、石頭、漂亮石頭……有了！"
L["Hold on, {name}! Tail's in the way, one moment... there!"] = "等等，{name}！尾巴擋到了，稍等……好了！"
L["One {buff}, {name}! Only slightly sandy."] = "{buff}一份，{name}！沾了點沙。"
L["Ask a vulpera and you'll get something, {name}. Usually odd. Not today!"] = "狐狸人有求必應，{name}，常常很怪。今天正常！"
L["Yours, {name}! Vulpera love giving things. Almost as much as finding them."] = "給你，{name}！狐狸人愛送東西，就跟愛撿一樣。"
L["Here, {name}! Patched it up myself. Holds better than it looks."] = "給你，{name}！我自己補的，比看起來牢靠。"
L["Sure, {name}! Stand upwind. Sandstorm last week; I'm still shedding it."] = "好，{name}！站上風處。上週沙塵暴，我還在掉沙。"
L["YES! Sorry, {name}, too loud? The desert's very big. You have to shout in it."] = "好！抱歉，{name}，太大聲？沙漠很大，要用喊的。"
L["Of course, {name}. Caravan rule: nobody asks twice for water or for help."] = "當然，{name}。商隊規矩：水和幫忙，不必問兩次。"
L["On it, {name}! Small spell, big fox, bigger ears. Wait. Other way round."] = "來，{name}！法術小、狐狸大……不對，說反了。"
L["For you, {name}? Easy! Caravan folk never say no to a neighbour."] = "給你？簡單，{name}！商隊的人從不拒絕鄰居。"
L["Every traveller needs something for the road, {name}. I checked: not a rock."] = "出門總要帶點盤纏，{name}。我檢查過，不是石頭。"
L["Keep this, {name}. The desert is long and the water is short."] = "收下吧，{name}。沙漠漫長，飲水難尋。"
L["Found this lying around, {name}. Kidding! It's fresh. Take it!"] = "路邊撿到的，{name}。開玩笑的！新鮮的，拿去！"
L["Here, {name}. Best thing in my pack, and I've got a lot of pack."] = "給你，{name}。我背包裡最好的，而我背包超大。"
L["In the dunes you share your shade and your spells, {name}. Here."] = "在沙丘上，陰涼和法術都要分享，{name}。給你。"
L["Some {buff} for you, {name}. I'd haggle, but you look busy."] = "{buff}給你，{name}。想跟你殺價，但你好像在忙。"
L["A gift from the whole caravan, {name}! They'll never know."] = "整個商隊送你的，{name}！他們不會知道的。"
L["For the road, {name}. Roads are the best part. Roads, and snacks."] = "路上用，{name}。路是最棒的。路，還有零食。"
L["Here, {name}! I swapped a hat for a thing, and the thing for this. Good trade!"] = "給你，{name}！帽子換東西，東西換這個。賺到！"
L["Nobody walks past anybody in the dunes, {name}. Bad luck, and rude. Here."] = "沙丘上不能見人就走，{name}。會衰又失禮。拿去。"
L["My nose says trouble's ahead of you, {name}. Take this. My nose is never wrong."] = "鼻子說前面有麻煩，{name}。拿著，鼻子不會錯。"
L["Too many spells in my pack, {name}. They jingle. Take one, please."] = "包裡法術太多，{name}，叮叮噹噹。拜託拿一個。"
L["If you find anything shiny later, {name}, you know where my ears are. Here!"] = "看到亮晶晶的，{name}，找這對耳朵就對了。給你！"
L["Wait, {name}! You nearly left without this. Deserts eat people who do that."] = "等等，{name}！差點空手走。沙漠專吃空手的。"
L["Stew's not ready yet, {name}, so this is the starter."] = "燉菜還沒好，{name}，先上這道開胃菜。"
L["A fellow wanderer! The caravan is never far, {name}."] = "同是流浪人！商隊總在不遠處，{name}。"
L["Ears up, {name}! Always nice to share a spell with a fellow fox."] = "耳朵豎起來，{name}！跟同是狐狸的分享法術真好。"
L["One vulpera to another, {name}: I've three spare spoons if you need one."] = "都是狐狸人，{name}：我有三支備用湯匙，要嗎？"
L["Vol'dun raised us both, {name}. Sand in the fur, luck in the pack."] = "都是沃魯敦長大的，{name}。毛裡有沙，包裡有福。"
L["Ears to ears, {name}: between us we've heard everything said in this place."] = "四隻大耳朵，{name}：這裡的話全被我們聽光了。"
L["Remember the caravan fires, {name}? Everybody sang badly. It was perfect."] = "記得商隊營火嗎，{name}？大家唱得超難聽，完美。"
L["Vol'dun's far behind us, {name}. Half of it followed us here in our fur."] = "沃魯敦遠了，{name}。半個沃魯敦還卡在毛裡。"
L["Caravan rules, {name}: stay together, share the water, nobody sells the alpaca."] = "商隊規矩，{name}：別走散、水要分、不准賣羊駝。"
L["Anything shiny in there, {name}, I saw it first. Caravan law."] = "裡頭亮晶晶的，{name}，我先看到的。商隊慣例。"
L["One for the party, {name}! A caravan's only as fast as its slowest alpaca."] = "全隊一份，{name}！商隊的速度取決於最慢的羊駝。"
L["Keep your pack shut, {name}. I don't mean to take things. They follow me."] = "背包關好，{name}。我沒想拿，是東西自己跟來的。"
L["Lost in a city, {name}, never in a cave. Caves are just houses with no rent."] = "城裡會迷路，{name}，洞穴不會——免房租的家嘛。"
L["I'm small, {name}, so I'll check the tiny tunnels. You lot take the big ones."] = "我個子小，{name}，小地道我來查。大的交給你們。"
L["Shout if you need anything, {name}. I've probably got it. It's probably dented."] = "需要什麼就喊，{name}。我大概有，大概也凹了。"
L["I'll take the back, {name}. Nobody gets left behind in a caravan."] = "我殿後，{name}。商隊裡誰都不能落下。"
L["A caravan with no wagon, {name}! Very fast. Very light. Nowhere to nap."] = "沒篷車的商隊，{name}！超快超輕，就是沒地方睡午覺。"
L["Scouted ahead, {name}. By nose. Smells of danger and very old cheese."] = "前方探好了，{name}。鼻子說：有危險，還有過期起司。"
L["Everybody fed? Everybody watered? Good. Now this, {name}. Caravan order."] = "吃飽了？喝足了？好。{name}，再來這個。商隊規矩。"
L["We vulpera travel by night, {name}. Cool sand, sleepy scorpids."] = "狐狸人夜裡趕路，{name}。沙子涼，蠍子睏。"
L["Desert nights get cold, {name}. Here, something warm-ish."] = "沙漠夜裡冷，{name}。來，這個還算暖。"
L["Stars out, {name}. Every one's a signpost if you know how to read it. I don't."] = "星星出來了，{name}。懂的人顆顆是路標。我不懂。"
L["Good hour for foxes, {name}. The ears work best when everything's quiet."] = "狐狸的好時辰，{name}。四下越靜，耳朵越靈。"
L["Past dark and I'm just waking up, {name}. In the dunes, noon's for napping."] = "天黑了我才剛醒，{name}。在沙丘，中午是拿來睡的。"
L["I'll curl up in my tail later, {name}. Best blanket I own. First, this."] = "尾巴是我最好的被子，{name}。晚點再窩，先給你這個。"
L["A kindness returned is a kindness doubled, {name}."] = "投桃報李，善意加倍，{name}。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You have restored my balance."] = "謝謝你，{name}。你讓我重歸平衡。"
L["Somewhere, a Sha just went hungry. Thank you, {name}."] = "某處的煞剛餓了一頓。謝謝你，{name}。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Aysa would bow, Ji would cheer. I will do both, badly."] = "謝謝，{name}！像艾莎鞠躬、像吉歡呼，都很拙。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I will think of you at my next meal, and the one after."] = "謝謝，{name}。下一餐我會想起你，下下餐也會。"
L["Chen always said: never refuse a gift. Or a drink. Thank you, {name}."] = "老陳說過：禮不可拒，酒也是。謝啦，{name}。"
L["I was about to nap, {name}, but this is better. Slightly. Thank you."] = "正想睡個午覺，{name}，這更好。一點點。謝謝。"
L["A hozen would have thrown something, {name}. I was raised better. Thank you."] = "換成猢猻早就丟東西了，{name}。我有家教。謝謝。"
L["That was very pandaren of you, {name}. All that's missing is a dumpling."] = "你這很有熊貓人風範，{name}。就只差一顆餃子了。"
L["At Halfhill that earns a prize turnip, {name}. I left mine at home. Thank you."] = "半丘市會頒你冠軍蘿蔔，{name}。我的忘在家，先謝啦。"
L["Grandmother kept a jar of kindnesses, {name}. Yours goes in; this comes out."] = "奶奶有個善意罐，{name}。你的放進去，這個拿出來。"
L["Thank you, {name}. In the Jade Forest my door is open, and my pantry more so."] = "謝謝，{name}。翠玉林我家大門常開，廚房全天營業。"
L["You move like the Shado-Pan, {name}. I never saw that coming. Thank you."] = "身手跟影潘一樣，{name}，我連影子都沒看到。謝謝！"
L["Like rain on a rice paddy, {name}. The paddy never says thank you. I do."] = "如稻田逢甘霖，{name}。稻田不會道謝，我會。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Li Li would put this in her travel journal. With drawings."] = "謝謝，{name}。莉莉會把這寫進旅行日記，還附插圖。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The August Celestials are busy, so I thank you for all four."] = "四大天神都在忙，{name}，我一口氣替四位謝你。"
L["Stormstout ale knocks a pandaren flat, {name}. So did that. Thank you."] = "風暴烈酒能放倒熊貓人，{name}。你這一下也是。謝謝！"
L["Now we are even, {name}. A pandaren never lets a kindness go cold."] = "這下扯平了，{name}。熊貓人從不讓人情放涼。"
L["Of course, {name}. Patience, and it is done. Patience is the slow part."] = "當然，{name}。有耐心就成。耐心是比較慢的那步。"
L["With pleasure, {name}. A kind deed is never wasted."] = "樂意效勞，{name}。善行從不白費。"
L["At once, {name}. Quick for a pandaren, which is not saying much."] = "馬上，{name}。以熊貓人標準算快，雖然標準不高。"
L["Master Shang Xi said: help whoever asks, {name}. I listened."] = "師父說過：有求必應，{name}。我聽進去了。"
L["A Tushui master would make you meditate first, {name}. I will skip that part."] = "水派大師會叫你先打坐，{name}。這步我省了。"
L["Anything for you, {name}. Except the last dumpling. Let us not be silly."] = "什麼都給你，{name}。除了最後一顆餃子，別傻了。"
L["One {buff}, {name}, brewed strong. The recipe stays a secret."] = "一份{buff}，{name}，特濃釀造。配方保密。"
L["Stand like a crane, {name}: one leg, calm face. Two legs is also fine."] = "像鶴那樣站，{name}：單腳，神情淡定。兩腳也行。"
L["We never refuse a request, {name}. Or a second helping."] = "我們從不拒絕請求，{name}。也不拒絕添飯。"
L["The last to ask me for help, {name}, was an island-sized turtle. You're easier."] = "上個拜託我的是隻像島的烏龜，{name}。你好辦多了。"
L["Pandaren help like we cook, {name}: slowly, generously, and far too much of it."] = "熊貓人幫忙跟煮飯一樣，{name}：慢、大方、份量爆多。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Let me put down my bowl. ...There. That was the hard part."] = "當然，{name}。先放下碗……好了。最難的部分完成。"
L["Yes, {name}. Grandfather said never make guests ask twice. He said it twice."] = "好，{name}。爺爺說別讓客人開口兩次。他說了兩次。"
L["Hold still, {name}. I am calm, you are calm, the spell is calm. Nobody panic."] = "別動，{name}。我淡定，你淡定，法術也淡定。別慌。"
L["Take this, {name}. And perhaps a cup of tea afterward?"] = "給你，{name}。待會兒一起喝杯茶？"
L["Balance in all things, {name}. Now go with a light heart."] = "萬事講求平衡，{name}。放寬心去吧。"
L["Take this, {name}. A grummle would sell it to you for a luckydo."] = "拿著，{name}。山上的挑夫會跟你要幸運符換。"
L["The jinyu say the waters foretold this, {name}. They say that a lot."] = "錦魚人說這是水的預言，{name}。他們常這麼說。"
L["The Huojin say act first. The Tushui say think first. I say: here, {name}."] = "火派說先做，水派說先想。我說：拿去，{name}。"
L["A pandaren stood up to give you this, {name}. Treasure it."] = "熊貓人特地站起來給的，{name}。要珍惜。"
L["Fight like a monk, {name}: calm, quick, and then a long lunch."] = "打得像武僧，{name}：沉穩、迅捷，再慢慢吃午飯。"
L["Go gently, {name}. The turtle got where it was going and never hurried once."] = "慢慢走，{name}。烏龜從沒趕過路，還是到了。"
L["A hug would be forward, {name}. This is next best, and less furry."] = "抱抱太冒昧了，{name}。這是次選，毛比較少。"
L["If a fight finds you, {name}, roll away. Rolling is very underrated."] = "遇上打架，{name}，就地一滾。翻滾實在太被小看了。"
L["For you, {name}. It is warm, round and full of good intentions. Like me."] = "給你，{name}。溫暖、圓滾滾、滿滿好意。跟我一樣。"
L["Take this, {name}. My kite is stuck in a tree, so I have time for good deeds."] = "拿著，{name}。我的風箏卡在樹上，剛好有空做好事。"
L["I carried this from Pandaria, {name}. Also a keg. The keg is mine."] = "從潘達利亞帶來的，{name}。還扛了桶酒。酒是我的。"
L["The virmen stole my carrots, {name}, but this they will never get. Here."] = "兔妖偷走我的紅蘿蔔，{name}，這個牠們別想拿。給你。"
L["On the Wandering Isle, {name}, strangers get soup. This travels better."] = "在漂流島，{name}，陌生人都有湯喝。這個比較好帶。"
L["Pandaren look soft, {name}. So does a sack of rice, until it lands on you."] = "熊貓人看起來軟，{name}。米袋也是，直到它砸下來。"
L["Chi-Ji says there is always hope, {name}. I say there is always a spare. Here."] = "赤吉說永遠有希望，{name}。我說永遠有備用的。給你。"
L["We must share a brew when the road allows, {name}!"] = "改天得空，一起喝壺酒，{name}！"
L["Shen-zin Su would be proud of us both, {name}. Or asleep. Hard to tell."] = "神龜會以我們為榮，{name}。或者牠在睡，難說。"
L["Two pandaren together, {name}. Somewhere, an innkeeper just felt a chill."] = "兩個熊貓人碰頭，{name}。有個旅店老闆發抖了。"
L["Liu Lang would approve, {name}: two of us, both a long way from home."] = "劉浪會贊同的，{name}：我們倆都離家好遠。"
L["Tushui or Huojin, {name}, we both left the turtle, and we both miss the food."] = "不管水派火派，{name}，都下了龜背，也都想念家鄉菜。"
L["One pandaren to another, {name}: the brews out here are thin. Share mine later."] = "同胞說句實話，{name}：外頭的酒太淡，改天喝我的。"
L["We both smell of rice wine and road dust, {name}. The smell of home."] = "我們都一身米酒味加風塵味，{name}。家的味道。"
L["Pandaren look after pandaren, {name}. Mostly by feeding them. This comes first."] = "熊貓人照顧熊貓人，{name}，主要靠餵。這是前菜。"
L["A fight, then a meal, {name}. That is the correct order. Never the reverse."] = "先打，再吃，{name}。這才是正確順序，反了不行。"
L["Stay together, {name}, like dumplings in a steamer. Warm, and ready."] = "靠攏點，{name}，像蒸籠裡的包子，熱騰騰待命。"
L["We move as one, {name}. Slowly, perhaps, but as one."] = "同進同退，{name}。慢是慢，但一致。"
L["Balance, {name}: one fights, one heals, and one carries the snacks. Me."] = "平衡，{name}：一個打、一個補、一個扛零食。我。"
L["If we fall, {name}, we fall together, and then we nap. Let us not."] = "要倒一起倒，{name}，倒了就睡。還是別吧。"
L["Stay behind me, {name}. I am soft, but I am very wide."] = "站我後面，{name}。我是軟，但我很寬。"
L["If we win, {name}, I will cook. If we lose, I will also cook, but sadly."] = "贏了我下廚，{name}。輸了也下廚，邊哭邊煮。"
L["Everyone breathe, {name}. In, and out. Now hit things, calmly."] = "深呼吸，{name}。吸，吐。好，現在心平氣和地開打。"
L["Keep up, {name}. I am in a hurry. It happens to pandaren about once a decade."] = "跟上，{name}。我在趕時間。熊貓人十年才急一次。"
L["A party is like a brew, {name}: odd ingredients, wonderful together. Mostly."] = "隊伍就像釀酒，{name}：料很怪，混起來超讚。通常啦。"
L["If I fall, {name}, roll me somewhere safe. Carrying me is not an option."] = "我倒了就把我滾走，{name}。用扛的？別想了。"
L["Pandaren fight like water, {name}: calm, patient, and then suddenly everywhere."] = "熊貓人如水，{name}：平靜、耐心，然後突然到處都是。"
L["Up before the tea, {name}? Brave. Here, instead of the tea."] = "茶還沒泡就起床？{name}，勇敢。以此代茶。"
L["Morning, {name}. First this, then breakfast, then more breakfast."] = "早，{name}。先這個，再早餐，然後再來點早餐。"
L["A new day, {name}, and nobody has spilled anything yet. Let us begin gently."] = "新的一天，{name}，還沒人打翻東西。輕輕開始吧。"
L["Halfhill's farmers have been up for hours, {name}. I have been up for minutes."] = "半丘市農夫起床好幾小時了，{name}。我才起來幾分鐘。"
L["Morning mist, {name}. It looked just like home. Then a kobold walked by."] = "晨霧，{name}。好像回到老家。然後一隻狗頭人走過去。"
L["Good morning, {name}. My stomach woke first and has been giving orders since."] = "早安，{name}。我的肚子先醒，一直在發號施令。"
L["Past my first nap, {name}, and before my second. Quickly, while I'm awake."] = "第一覺睡過了，第二覺還沒，{name}。趁醒著快點。"
L["Late, {name}. The brewmasters are asleep. The brews, I suspect, are not."] = "夜深了，{name}。釀酒大師睡了，酒我看還醒著。"
L["Midnight snack time, {name}. This is the appetiser."] = "宵夜時間，{name}。這是開胃菜。"
L["Dark already, {name}? Back home, Grandfather's stories would just be starting."] = "天黑啦，{name}？在老家，這時爺爺的故事才剛開講。"
L["The moon is round and full tonight, {name}. We have a great deal in common."] = "今晚月亮又圓又滿，{name}。跟吃飽的我很像。"
L["Your kindness is noted, {name}. Dragons do not forget."] = "好意我記住了，{name}。龍族從不遺忘。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Returned on swift wings."] = "謝謝，{name}。乘疾翼回禮！"
L["Wings, fire and scales, {name}, and still you thought I needed help. Touching."] = "有翼有火有鱗，{name}，你還想幫我。真感人。"
L["I would bow, {name}, but last time my wings cleared a table. Thank you."] = "想鞠躬，{name}，但上次翅膀掃翻了整桌。謝謝你。"
L["That goes straight into my hoard, {name}. Kind deeds are the only gold I keep."] = "直接收進寶庫，{name}。我只囤善行這種金子。"
L["I was made to be a weapon, {name}. I much prefer this part. Thank you."] = "我被造成武器，{name}，但更愛這部分。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Wrathion would have made a speech of it. I will not."] = "謝謝，{name}。瑞希歐會為此發表演說。我不會。"
L["Returned with a little fire in it, {name}. Only a little. I am practising."] = "還你，附帶一點火，{name}。只有一點。我在練習。"
L["A mortal gift, {name}: small, brief and kind. I am learning to like all three."] = "凡人的禮：小、短、暖，{name}。這三樣我正學著喜歡。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Mortal customs are new to me. Do I pay you? No? Then this."] = "謝謝，{name}。凡人規矩我不熟。付錢？不用？那回這個。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I have scales where most have feelings. That got through."] = "謝謝，{name}。我全身是鱗刀槍不入，卻被你打動了。"
L["You're on my list of favourite mortals, {name}. It was empty until today."] = "我的愛凡人名單上有你了，{name}。今天以前是空白的。"
L["The red in me is grateful, {name}. The black in me is suspicious. The red wins."] = "我體內的紅龍很感激，{name}，黑龍很懷疑。紅龍勝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Dragons are not used to receiving. I find I like it."] = "謝謝，{name}。龍不習慣收禮。我發現我挺喜歡的。"
L["A dragon's thanks comes with a roar, {name}. I will spare the neighbours."] = "龍道謝要配一聲咆哮，{name}。為了鄰居，就省了。"
L["Very well, {name}. Stand still, I would hate to singe you."] = "好吧，{name}。站好，我可不想燒焦你。"
L["Granted, {name}. A dragon keeps its word."] = "應允了，{name}。龍族一諾千金。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Stand clear of the tail."] = "當然，{name}。離尾巴遠點。"
L["Of course, {name}. Is this still how it is done? I was asleep for a while."] = "當然，{name}。現在還這麼做嗎？我睡了一小陣子。"
L["Gladly, {name}. All five dragonflights are in me, and all five say yes."] = "樂意，{name}。我體內的五大龍族，五票全數贊成。"
L["Right away, {name}. Dragon-sized help, in a conveniently smaller form."] = "馬上來，{name}。巨龍級援手，隨身迷你版。"
L["Of course, {name}. Neltharion only gave orders. A request is much nicer."] = "當然，{name}。奈薩里奧只會下令，被拜託好多了。"
L["Right away, {name}. Stand back a little; I am still learning how big I am."] = "馬上，{name}。退後點，我還在摸清自己有多大隻。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Claws are not ideal for spellwork, but I manage."] = "當然，{name}。爪子不太適合施法，但我應付得來。"
L["Of course, {name}. Dragons usually demand tribute. I'm waiving it, this once."] = "當然，{name}。龍通常要收貢品。這次免了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Please don't scream. Mortals often do. It's the horns."] = "當然，{name}。請別尖叫，凡人常這樣。都是角的錯。"
L["My breath is fire, {name}, so we will do this the other way."] = "我吹的不是仙氣是火，{name}，所以換個方式。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Mortals so rarely ask a dragon for anything but mercy."] = "樂意，{name}。凡人求龍，向來只求饒命。"
L["A small magic, {name}, but I cast it with enormous dignity."] = "小小法術，{name}，但我施放得無比莊嚴。"
L["Take this, {name}. Even a dragon needs allies. Especially one this size."] = "拿著，{name}。龍也需要盟友，尤其是小號的龍。"
L["A gift from the Dragon Isles, {name}. Fly well."] = "巨龍群島的禮物，{name}。好好飛吧。"
L["Alexstrasza says every life is precious, {name}. I am starting with yours."] = "雅立史卓莎說命都珍貴，{name}。我從你這條開始。"
L["I slept through ten thousand years of good deeds, {name}. Catching up now."] = "我睡掉了一萬年的善行，{name}。現在來補進度。"
L["Tell them a dragon did this, {name}. It sounds far grander than it was."] = "就說是龍幫你的，{name}。聽起來比實際氣派多了。"
L["Scalecommander's orders, {name}. I am not a Scalecommander, but still."] = "鱗長有令，{name}！我不是鱗長，但氣勢要到。"
L["Take this, {name}. Ancient dragon magic, only slightly out of date."] = "拿著，{name}。上古龍魔法，版本只舊了一點點。"
L["A dragon giving, {name}, not taking. I am trying something new."] = "龍在送東西，{name}，不是搶。我在嘗試新作風。"
L["In visage form I look harmless, {name}. So did Lady Prestor. I really am."] = "人形的我很無害，{name}。普瑞斯托女士也是。我是真的。"
L["A gift from above, {name}. I landed specially. It took two tries."] = "天降好禮，{name}。我專程降落，落了兩次才成功。"
L["Here, {name}. Every dragon should guard something. I have chosen you, for now."] = "給你，{name}。每條龍都該守護點什麼。暫時就選你了。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's from five dragonflights, so it clashes with everything."] = "拿著，{name}。五大龍族聯名款，跟什麼都撞色。"
L["I'd fly you there myself, {name}, but dracthyr carry no riders. Take this."] = "本想載你飛過去，{name}，但半龍人不載人。拿著吧。"
L["Dragons gifted the world at its dawn, {name}. Mine is smaller, and later."] = "巨龍在創世之初送過禮，{name}。我的小一點，晚一點。"
L["A little essence for you, {name}. It is what I'm made of, so handle it gently."] = "一點精華給你，{name}。我就是它做的，輕拿輕放。"
L["Take this, {name}. It will feel warm. Most things do, after I touch them."] = "拿著，{name}。會有點熱。被我碰過的大多如此。"
L["The Forbidden Reach feels far behind us now, {name}."] = "禁忌之境彷彿已遠在身後，{name}。"
L["Two dracthyr in one place, {name}. Mind the wings; there is not room for four."] = "兩個同族擠一塊，{name}。小心翅膀，擺不下四片。"
L["Remember when the whole world was new to us, {name}? It still is, mostly."] = "記得當初萬物都新奇嗎，{name}？現在大多還是。"
L["In visage form nobody can tell, {name}. Between us: we look better in scales."] = "化成人形誰也認不出，{name}。可我們有鱗更帥。"
L["Made for war, {name}, and look at us: sharing. Somebody's plans went wrong."] = "生來為戰，{name}，結果我們在分享。某人的計畫泡湯了。"
L["Visage or scales, {name}, I would know one of us anywhere. It is the posture."] = "人形或鱗片，{name}，同族我一眼就認得。看站姿。"
L["Mortals always ask us the same thing, {name}: will we fly them. Still no."] = "凡人老問我們，{name}：能不能載他們飛？還是不行。"
L["Between two dracthyr, {name}: the horns never get any easier with hats."] = "半龍人私下說，{name}：頭上有角，帽子永遠戴不好。"
L["Tell me when to breathe fire, {name}. And, please, when not to."] = "何時該噴火跟我說，{name}。也拜託說何時別噴。"
L["I woke in a cave full of strangers, {name}. This is far better company."] = "醒來時滿洞陌生人，{name}。這群夥伴好多了。"
L["Neltharion made us to fight alone, {name}. We have improved on him."] = "奈薩里奧要我們獨自作戰，{name}。我們青出於藍。"
L["Stay clear of my tail, {name}. It hasn't yet learned whose side it's on."] = "離我尾巴遠點，{name}。它還搞不清楚自己站哪邊。"
L["A flight of our own, {name}. So this is what the dragons meant."] = "我們也成軍團了，{name}。原來巨龍是這個意思。"
L["If I say 'take cover', {name}, I mean behind my wings. They are good for that."] = "我喊「找掩護」，{name}，是指躲我翅膀後面。超好用。"
L["Stand beside me, {name}, never in front. I cannot aim my breath politely."] = "站旁邊，{name}，別站前面。我的吐息瞄不了那麼客氣。"
L["Leave the big ones to me, {name}. Well, the ones smaller than me. That is most."] = "大隻的交給我，{name}。呃，比我小的。反正大多都是。"
L["Stay close, {name}. I can glide us all down from anywhere. Up is your problem."] = "靠緊，{name}。哪裡我都能帶大家滑下去。往上請自理。"
L["Keep moving, {name}. A dragon in a hurry is grand. One waiting is just big."] = "別停，{name}。趕路的龍很威風，等人的龍只是很大隻。"
L["Tell me the plan slowly, {name}. I was made for battles, not for plans."] = "計畫慢慢講，{name}。我是為打仗造的，不是為開會。"
L["Mortals live so briefly, {name}. Let us not make today any shorter."] = "凡人壽命好短，{name}。今天就別再讓它更短了。"
L["It is good to see one of our own, {name}."] = "能見到同胞真好，{name}。"
L["Our people are few, {name}. That makes each of us count."] = "我們族人不多，{name}。每一個都很重要。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The Alliance looks after its own, and today that's me."] = "謝謝你，{name}。聯盟照顧自己人，今天輪到我。"
L["Kindness answered, {name}. For the Alliance!"] = "以善意回應，{name}。為了聯盟！"
L["Stormwind has a statue for every hero, {name}. I'm putting in a word for yours."] = "暴風城英雄都有雕像，{name}。我幫你報名了。"
L["The Alliance way, {name}: you help me, I help you, a dwarf buys the drinks."] = "聯盟之道，{name}：你幫我，我幫你，矮人請喝酒。"
L["Bolvar would bow, Magni would hug, {name}. I'll just return it."] = "伯瓦爾會鞠躬，麥格尼會熊抱，{name}。我回個禮就好。"
L["If the Alliance gave medals for manners, {name}, you'd need a second tabard."] = "聯盟若頒禮貌勳章，{name}，你外袍都掛不下了。"
L["Returned in full, {name}. An ally who gives first is worth a whole garrison."] = "如數奉還，{name}。先出手的盟友抵得上一座要塞。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll mention you in my letter home. Mother reads them aloud."] = "謝謝，{name}。家書裡會提到你。我媽會大聲唸出來。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Even the Stormwind guards would smile at that."] = "謝謝，{name}。連暴風城衛兵看了都會笑。"
L["The Alliance at its finest, {name}: nobody asked, somebody helped. Thanks."] = "這才是聯盟本色，{name}：沒人開口，有人出手。謝啦。"
L["I'll tell everyone on the Deeprun Tram, {name}. It's a long tram. Thank you."] = "我會講給礦道地鐵全車聽，{name}。那車很長。謝謝。"
L["Most gallant, {name}. If I had a lion on my tabard, it would be purring."] = "真有風度，{name}。我外袍上要是有獅子，牠正在呼嚕。"
L["Our kings bicker, {name}, but their people get on splendidly. Thank you."] = "國王們吵個不停，{name}，百姓倒處得很好。謝謝。"
L["The Alliance was forged by folk keeping their word, {name}. Here's mine."] = "聯盟是守信的人打造的，{name}。這是我的那份。"
L["Of course, {name}. Allies help each other. It's practically in the name."] = "當然，{name}。「聯盟」嘛，就是要聯手。"
L["At once, {name}. The Alliance does not leave a friend wanting."] = "立刻來，{name}。聯盟從不虧待朋友。"
L["Of course, {name}. It's in the Alliance charter. Somewhere near the back."] = "當然，{name}。聯盟憲章裡有寫，大概在後面幾頁。"
L["By order of the Alliance, {name}: one {buff}, effective at once."] = "奉聯盟之命，{name}：{buff}一份，即刻生效。"
L["Anything for an ally, {name}. Within reason. This is well within reason."] = "為盟友什麼都行，{name}。合理範圍內。這很合理。"
L["Right away, {name}. SI:7 knew you would ask. I only just found out."] = "馬上來，{name}。軍情七處早料到了，我剛知道。"
L["Straight away, {name}. The Alliance marches on requests like yours. And bread."] = "馬上，{name}。聯盟靠你這種請求行軍。還有麵包。"
L["Yes, {name}. From Stormwind to Ironforge, 'please' opens every gate."] = "好，{name}。暴風城到鐵爐堡，一聲「請」開遍城門。"
L["Right away, {name}. I've worn the blue all day hoping somebody would ask."] = "馬上，{name}。我穿了一整天藍色，就等有人開口。"
L["Hold still, {name}. I learned this faster than the Alliance anthem."] = "別動，{name}。這招我學得比聯盟國歌還快。"
L["Of course, {name}. Armies win wars; small favours win allies. Here's one."] = "當然，{name}。大軍打贏戰爭，小忙贏得盟友。來一個。"
L["For the Alliance, {name}! Stay strong out there. Stronger, now."] = "為了聯盟，{name}！挺住。現在更挺得住了。"
L["Onward, {name}. The Alliance is with you."] = "前進吧，{name}。聯盟與你同在。"
L["Take this, {name}. Had a gnome made it, it would come with twelve levers."] = "拿著，{name}。要是地精做的，還會附十二根拉桿。"
L["Compliments of the Alliance, {name}. We've done these since the Second War."] = "聯盟敬贈，{name}。這項服務從第二次大戰就有了。"
L["Chin up, {name}. Somewhere in Stormwind, a bard is writing about this."] = "打起精神，{name}。暴風城有個吟遊詩人正在寫你。"
L["Every ally counts, {name}. Today, you count double."] = "每個盟友都算數，{name}。今天你算兩個。"
L["Anduin would want me to share, {name}, and I'd hate to disappoint him."] = "安度因會希望我分享，{name}，我可不想讓他失望。"
L["Take this, {name}. Stormwind's walls can't follow you, so this will have to."] = "拿著，{name}。暴風城的城牆跟不了你，就讓這個跟著。"
L["Here, {name}. The gryphons get you there; this gets you back."] = "給你，{name}。獅鷲載你去，這個保你回來。"
L["Alliance rule, {name}: keep your word, your walls, your friends. Here, friend."] = "聯盟守則，{name}：守信、守城、守朋友。給你，朋友。"
L["Every ally deserves a lion at their back, {name}. I'm the nearest lion."] = "每個盟友背後都該有頭雄獅，{name}。最近的就是我。"
L["A gift from the Alliance, {name}. Signed, sealed and hand-delivered."] = "聯盟的禮物，{name}。簽名、蓋章、專人送達。"
L["The Alliance never forgets the brave, {name}. Give it something to remember."] = "聯盟不會忘記勇者，{name}。去做點值得記住的事。"
L["Together we stand, {name}. For the Alliance!"] = "團結一心，{name}。為了聯盟！"
L["Right, {name}: shields up, heads down, and nobody charges before the plan does."] = "聽好，{name}：舉盾、低頭，計畫沒動誰都別衝。"
L["The finest company the Alliance ever fielded, {name}. Or at least the nearest."] = "聯盟史上最精銳的部隊，{name}。至少是最近的。"
L["Together, {name}, we're practically a regiment. A small, well-dressed regiment."] = "我們湊起來就是一個團，{name}。小而體面的團。"
L["Watch each other's backs, {name}. The Alliance was built by people who did."] = "互相掩護，{name}。聯盟就是這樣的人建起來的。"
L["Shields together, {name}. The Alliance never won anything in single file."] = "盾牌併攏，{name}。聯盟從沒排一列縱隊打贏過。"
L["If this goes in the history books, {name}, let's be a chapter, not a footnote."] = "要是寫進史書，{name}，我們要當一章，別當註腳。"
L["Whoever carries the banner, {name}, gets painted looking noble. Volunteers?"] = "扛旗的人，{name}，畫像會很英挺。有人自願嗎？"
L["Dwarven nerve, elven patience, human stubbornness, {name}: the Alliance recipe."] = "矮人膽、精靈耐性、人類固執，{name}：聯盟配方。"
L["Keep the lion roaring, {name}. Softly, mind. We're sneaking."] = "讓雄獅繼續咆哮，{name}。小聲點，我們在潛行。"
L["Strength and honour, {name}. And kindness, it turns out. Repaid in full."] = "力量與榮譽，{name}。原來還有善意。如數奉還。"
L["The Horde takes care of its own, {name}."] = "部落照顧自己人，{name}。"
L["Strength given, strength returned, {name}. That's all of Horde diplomacy."] = "給我力量，還你力量，{name}。部落外交就這麼多。"
L["I'd carve your name on Orgrimmar's gates, {name}, but they're full. Thanks."] = "想把你刻上奧格瑪城門，{name}，但刻滿了。謝了。"
L["A goblin would've sent you an invoice, {name}. I'm sending this instead."] = "換作哥布林，早寄帳單給你了，{name}。我寄這個。"
L["You did not have to do that, {name}. That is why the Horde remembers it."] = "你沒必要這麼做，{name}。所以部落會記住。"
L["In the Horde we do not say thank you twice, {name}. So: once, and meant."] = "部落謝謝不說兩次，{name}。所以：一次，真心的。"
L["In the Horde a debt is carried like an axe, {name}: openly, and not for long."] = "部落的債像斧頭一樣扛，{name}：光明正大，扛不久。"
L["The gate grunts will hear of you, {name}. They'll grunt. It means respect."] = "守門步兵會聽說你，{name}。他們會哼一聲。那是敬意。"
L["The Horde keeps two lists, {name}: grudges and favours. Yours is the short one."] = "部落記兩本帳，{name}：仇和恩。你在薄的那本。"
L["Honour says repay you, {name}. Manners say smile. I'm working on the smile."] = "榮譽要我回報你，{name}。禮貌要我微笑。微笑還在練。"
L["That landed softer than any zeppelin I've ridden, {name}. Thank you."] = "這比我搭過的飛艇都降得溫柔，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Thanks, {name}, in Orcish, Taur-ahe, Zandali and Gutterspeak. Pick one."] = "謝啦，{name}。獸人語、牛頭人語、贊達拉語、亡靈語，任選。"
L["Thrall taught the Horde honour, {name}. Nobody had to teach you. Thank you."] = "索爾教會部落榮譽，{name}。你卻無師自通。謝謝。"
L["You gave first, {name}. In the Horde that earns first cut of the roast. Here."] = "你先出手，{name}。在部落，這能分到烤肉第一刀。給。"
L["The Warchief can't thank everyone himself, {name}. He's delegated it to me."] = "大酋長沒空一一道謝，{name}。這差事交給我了。"
L["Consider it done, {name}. For the Horde, and for anyone who asks nicely."] = "交給我，{name}。為了部落，也為了客氣開口的人。"
L["You only had to ask, {name}. The Horde answers."] = "你開口就行，{name}。部落必有回應。"
L["The Horde usually helps with axes, {name}. Today, {buff}."] = "部落通常用斧頭幫忙，{name}。今天用{buff}。"
L["Done, {name}. No speeches. The Horde has plenty of those already."] = "好了，{name}。不演講，部落的演講已經夠多了。"
L["You asked, {name}. In Orgrimmar, that counts as a formal treaty."] = "你開口了，{name}。在奧格瑪，這就算正式條約。"
L["Asking is no weakness, {name}. Refusing an ally would be."] = "開口求助不是軟弱，{name}。拒絕盟友才是。"
L["No need to bang a war drum, {name}. You asked; it's done."] = "不必敲戰鼓，{name}。你開口，就辦好了。"
L["Of course, {name}. In the Horde, 'please' outranks everyone but the Warchief."] = "當然，{name}。在部落，「請」字官階僅次於大酋長。"
L["In Orgrimmar we'd have argued about it first, {name}. Tradition. Here."] = "在奧格瑪，我們會先吵一架，{name}。傳統。給。"
L["Consider it requisitioned, {name}. The quartermaster needn't hear about it."] = "就當是徵用的，{name}。軍需官不必知道。"
L["Done, {name}. If anyone asks, I scowled the whole time. I've a reputation."] = "好了，{name}。有人問就說我全程臭臉。名聲要顧。"
L["Of course, {name}. Horde hospitality: rough edges, full helpings."] = "當然，{name}。部落待客：粗歸粗，份量足。"
L["The Horde came together because somebody always said yes, {name}. Yes."] = "部落能聚起來，是因為總有人說「好」，{name}。好。"
L["For the Horde, {name}! Go with strength. I've just handed you some."] = "為了部落，{name}！力量隨行，我剛塞了一些給你。"
L["Go with honour, {name}. Victory awaits."] = "榮譽隨行，{name}。勝利在前方。"
L["Go and do something worth a song, {name}. Loud songs. The Horde likes loud."] = "幹件值得高歌的事，{name}。部落就愛大聲。"
L["Walk tall, {name}. The Horde always made room for those the world turned away."] = "抬頭挺胸，{name}。部落總會收留被世界拒絕的人。"
L["Take this, {name}, and a word of Horde wisdom: hit first, apologise never."] = "拿著，{name}。部落格言：先動手，永不道歉。"
L["Victory or death, {name}. I'd prefer victory, so take this."] = "勝利或死亡，{name}。我選勝利，所以拿著。"
L["Blood and thunder, {name}! Go and be the thunder."] = "鮮血與雷霆，{name}！去當那道雷霆。"
L["For the Horde, {name}, and for you. The Horde's big; you're closer."] = "為了部落，{name}，也為了你。部落太大，你比較近。"
L["Here, {name}. Stronger together, they say, and I've just done my half."] = "給你，{name}。都說團結力量大，我這半邊做完了。"
L["Carry this, {name}. It weighs less than a Horde banner and flies just as proud."] = "帶上這個，{name}。比部落戰旗輕，飄得一樣威風。"
L["Here, {name}. The Horde feeds its own, arms its own, and now enchants them."] = "給你，{name}。部落包吃包武器，現在連法術也包。"
L["Take this, {name}. Whatever's out there is about to meet the Horde."] = "拿著，{name}。外頭那些東西，就要見識部落了。"
L["Here, {name}. Wherever you're headed, arrive looking like the Horde sent you."] = "給你，{name}。不管去哪，到的時候要像部落派來的。"
L["The Crossroads never turned a traveller away, {name}. It overcharged a few."] = "十字路口從不拒絕旅人，{name}。只是敲過幾次竹槓。"
L["The Horde raises you tough, {name}. This is for the days tough isn't enough."] = "部落把你養得夠硬，{name}。這給硬也撐不住的日子。"
L["Take this, {name}. A Horde gift: no ribbon, no speech, no refunds."] = "拿著，{name}。部落禮物：不綁緞帶、不致詞、不退換。"
L["Stand tall, {name}. Taller than that. The Horde has tauren to keep up with."] = "站直，{name}。再高點。部落裡還有牛頭人要比。"
L["Our strength is each other, {name}. For the Horde!"] = "有彼此就有力量，{name}。為了部落！"
L["Forward, {name}. The Horde advances together. Retreats... never, officially."] = "前進，{name}。部落從不撤退，官方說法。"
L["Together we're a war band, {name}. Apart, we're just loud."] = "聚在一起是戰團，{name}。分開了只是很吵。"
L["Shoulder to shoulder, {name}. Whoever charges first buys the grog."] = "肩並肩，{name}。誰先衝誰請喝酒。"
L["Nobody gets left behind, {name}. I've counted us twice."] = "誰都不丟下，{name}。我點了兩次名。"
L["Rule of the warband, {name}: nobody eats until everybody's back."] = "戰團規矩，{name}：人沒到齊，誰都不准開飯。"
L["Drums up, {name}. If we can't be quiet, we'll be terrifying."] = "戰鼓敲起來，{name}。安靜不了，就嚇死他們。"
L["The Horde never won a thing alone, {name}. Let's not start now."] = "部落從沒單打獨鬥贏過，{name}。現在也別開先例。"
L["We fight like the Horde, {name}: all at once, and nobody waits for the signal."] = "照部落打法，{name}：一擁而上，誰也不等信號。"
L["Right, {name}. Spoils shared, blame shared, glory to the loudest."] = "好，{name}。戰利品平分，黑鍋平分，榮耀歸嗓門最大的。"
L["Look at us, {name}. The Warchief would be proud. Mildly. From a distance."] = "看看我們，{name}。大酋長會很驕傲。稍微。遠遠地。"
L["Tusks, horns, long ears and bare bone, {name}. Finest warband going."] = "獠牙、犄角、長耳朵、白骨頭，{name}。天下第一戰團。"
L["The war stories get bigger after, {name}. Let's give them a head start."] = "打完仗故事只會越吹越大，{name}。先幫它起個好頭。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Good hearts turn up on every side, and apparently here."] = "謝謝你，{name}。好心人哪邊都有，看來這裡也有。"
L["Thank you, {name}. No side, no title, just kindness. Legends start like this."] = "謝謝，{name}。沒陣營沒頭銜，傳奇都這麼開始的。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Kindness has no faction, which is handy, since I have none."] = "謝謝，{name}。善意不分陣營，剛好我也沒有。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Whichever side gets you is getting a bargain."] = "謝謝你，{name}。哪個陣營得到你都賺到了。"
L["Whoever claims me in the end, {name}, I'll remember you first. Thank you."] = "不管最後我歸哪邊，{name}，都會先記得你。謝謝。"
L["Strictly neutral, {name}, but gratitude doesn't count. Thank you."] = "我嚴守中立，{name}，但感謝不算選邊。謝謝你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I carry no banner, so both hands are free to return this."] = "謝謝，{name}。我不扛旗，兩手空空，正好回禮。"
L["The Steamwheedle stay neutral for gold, {name}. I do it for moments like this."] = "熱砂為了金幣保持中立，{name}。我為了這種時刻。"
L["Neither side has taught me their thanks yet, {name}, so here's the plain kind."] = "兩邊都還沒教我怎麼道謝，{name}，先來個原味的。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I stand between two great banners, and still you noticed me."] = "謝謝，{name}。我夾在兩面大旗中間，你還是看見我了。"
L["Two sides at war, {name}, and us being lovely right in the middle. Thank you."] = "兩邊在開戰，{name}，我們在正中間溫馨互助。謝謝。"
L["Gladly, {name}, whatever banner you fly. I don't even own a banner."] = "樂意，{name}，不論你舉哪面旗。我連旗子都沒有。"
L["Certainly, {name}. I help everyone. It's the one thing I've decided."] = "當然，{name}。我誰都幫，這是我唯一決定好的事。"
L["Everyone asks me which side I'm on, {name}. Much nicer to be asked for help."] = "大家都問我站哪邊，{name}。被請求幫忙好多了。"
L["Of course, {name}. No war council to ask; just me, and I say yes."] = "當然，{name}。不必請示議會，我說了算：好。"
L["Here you are, {name}. No oath, no colours, no fee."] = "給你，{name}。不宣誓、不掛旗、不收費。"
L["I can't pick a side yet, {name}, but I can pick a good cause. This is one."] = "陣營還不能選，{name}，好事倒是能選。這就是一件。"
L["At once, {name}. I have no side to be on, so for now I am entirely on yours."] = "馬上，{name}。我沒有陣營可站，所以現在全站你這邊。"
L["Of course, {name}. Nobody pays me to take sides, so I take requests instead."] = "當然，{name}。沒人付錢要我選邊，我就改接點單。"
L["Neutral does not mean unwilling, {name}. It means I help first and argue never."] = "中立不代表不願意，{name}。是先幫忙，永不爭論。"
L["Friends can come from any side, {name}. Or, like me, from none in particular."] = "朋友不分陣營，{name}。或者像我，根本沒陣營。"
L["Soon they'll hand us tabards, {name}. Until then, we look after each other."] = "很快會發外袍給我們，{name}。在那之前互相照應。"
L["I haven't chosen a side yet, {name}, so I'm being kind to both. Take this."] = "我還沒選邊，{name}，所以兩邊都善待。拿著。"
L["A gift with no strings, {name}. I don't even have a faction to tie them to."] = "這禮物不綁定，{name}。我連陣營都沒得綁。"
L["Go on, {name}. Two whole factions are waiting to argue over us."] = "去吧，{name}。兩大陣營正等著搶我們呢。"
L["No quartermaster yet, {name}, so nobody's counting. Have plenty."] = "還沒有軍需官，{name}，沒人記帳。多拿點。"
L["Take this, {name}. Neutral ground travels with me; you're standing on some."] = "拿著，{name}。中立地帶跟著我走，你就踩在上面。"
L["The Argent Dawn helps whoever needs it, {name}. I'm learning from the best."] = "銀色黎明誰有需要就幫誰，{name}。我在跟最好的學。"
L["Booty Bay's rule: no fighting on the docks, {name}. Mine: no refusing a gift."] = "藏寶海灣：碼頭禁止鬥毆，{name}。我這：禮物禁止拒收。"
L["The one thing both factions agree on, {name}. They just don't know it yet."] = "兩大陣營唯一的共識，{name}。只是他們還不知道。"
L["This goes with any tabard, {name}. I made sure by giving it no colours at all."] = "配哪件外袍都行，{name}。我特地沒給它上色。"
L["For you, {name}. Neither Orgrimmar nor Stormwind sent it. It works anyway."] = "給你，{name}。非奧格瑪、非暴風城出品，照樣有效。"
L["Here, {name}. I belong to no nation yet, so I practise belonging to everyone."] = "給你，{name}。我還沒有國家，先練習屬於大家。"
L["Side by side, {name}, whatever comes."] = "並肩同行，{name}，無論如何。"
L["No flag over this party, {name}, just us. That's plenty."] = "這隊沒掛旗，{name}，只有我們。這就夠了。"
L["One day we'll pick sides, {name}. Today we pick fights, together."] = "有天我們得選陣營，{name}。今天先一起找架打。"
L["Whatever side the rest of the world is on, {name}, I'm on this party's."] = "不管世界站哪邊，{name}，我站這隊這邊。"
L["Neutral in the war, {name}, but very partial to this group."] = "戰爭中我中立，{name}，但對這隊很偏心。"
L["They call us a neutral party, {name}. Nobody said it had to be a quiet one."] = "都說我們是中立隊伍，{name}。又沒說要安靜。"
L["Whatever we fight today, {name}, it's nothing personal. Just very thorough."] = "今天打誰都不是針對誰，{name}。只是打得很徹底。"
L["One side in this party, {name}: ours. Smallest faction on Azeroth. The best."] = "這隊只站一邊，{name}：我們。最小的陣營，也是最好的。"
L["No orders from any capital, {name}. We choose our road. Let's choose quickly."] = "沒有主城下令，{name}。路自己選。選快點。"
L["No war to win today, {name}, just this one fight. Much more manageable."] = "今天沒戰爭要贏，{name}，只有這一仗。好應付多了。"
L["One good turn deserves another, {name}."] = "好心有好報，{name}。"
L["Have some {buff} in return, {name}."] = "回贈你一份{buff}，{name}。"
L["Kindness should go both ways, {name}. Thank you."] = "善意該是互相的，{name}。謝謝你。"
L["You went first, {name}, so I'll go second and we'll call it friendship."] = "你先出手，{name}，我接第二棒，這就叫友誼。"
L["I'd write you a song, {name}, but {buff} is less off-key."] = "本想為你寫首歌，{name}，但{buff}比較不走音。"
L["A gift for a gift, {name}. At this rate we'll be unstoppable by supper."] = "禮尚往來，{name}。照這速度，晚餐前就天下無敵。"
L["All square, {name}. Unless you'd like to make it best of three."] = "扯平了，{name}。除非你想來個三戰兩勝。"
L["You started it, {name}. I'm only finishing it."] = "你先開始的，{name}。我只是收尾。"
L["That was kind, {name}. The day just got noticeably better. Here's my half."] = "真好心，{name}。今天變好了，這是我的那一半。"
L["I was about to do that for you, {name}. Honestly. Here's proof."] = "我正要替你施法呢，{name}。真的，證據在此。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll sleep better tonight, and I sleep in a ditch."] = "謝謝，{name}。今晚會睡得更香，雖然我睡水溝。"
L["Two good things today, {name}: your kindness, and the chance to return it."] = "今天兩件好事，{name}：你的好意，和回報它的機會。"
L["You had me in your debt for all of three seconds, {name}. There."] = "我欠了你整整三秒，{name}。還清了。"
L["Gratitude is best served quickly, {name}. Here it is, still warm."] = "謝意要趁熱，{name}。來，還熱騰騰的。"
L["Well, {name}, now I have to be a better person all day. Thanks for that."] = "好吧，{name}，這下我整天都得當個好人了。真是謝囉。"
L["Returned with a bow, {name}. A figurative one. My back isn't what it was."] = "鞠躬回禮，{name}。比喻上的。我的腰不比當年。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Somebody had to go first, and I'm glad it was you."] = "謝謝，{name}。總要有人先開頭，很高興是你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You've rescued a day I'd written off at breakfast."] = "謝謝，{name}。這天我早餐時就放棄了，被你救回來。"
L["You asked, {name}, and here it is."] = "你要的來了，{name}。"
L["{buff}, coming right up, {name}."] = "{buff}馬上來，{name}。"
L["Gladly, {name}. One moment."] = "很樂意，{name}。稍等。"
L["Asked and answered, {name}. Next question?"] = "有問必答，{name}。下一題？"
L["Say the word and it's yours, {name}. You said several. Here."] = "你開口就給，{name}。你開了好幾次口。拿去。"
L["For you, {name}? Gladly. I was hoping someone would ask."] = "給你？樂意，{name}。我正盼著有人開口。"
L["Of course, {name}. Easiest yes I'll say all day."] = "當然，{name}。今天最好答應的事。"
L["Right away, {name}. Finally, a question I know the answer to."] = "馬上來，{name}。終於有題我會答了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Nicely asked, gladly given."] = "當然，{name}。問得客氣，給得樂意。"
L["Hold still, {name}. It works best on people who aren't fidgeting. So, nobody."] = "別動，{name}。這對不亂動的人最靈。也就是說：沒人。"
L["Here you are, {name}. I'd make you wait for effect, but that seems rude."] = "給你，{name}。本想吊你胃口，但那太失禮了。"
L["Yes, {name}. I'd have said it sooner if you'd asked sooner."] = "好啊，{name}。你早點問，我就早點答應。"
L["Say no more, {name}. Done before you finished asking."] = "不用多說，{name}。你還沒問完就好了。"
L["There, {name}. Next time, don't ask; just stand near me looking hopeful."] = "好了，{name}。下次別問，眼巴巴站我旁邊就行。"
L["Coming up, {name}. This is the one part of my day that goes to plan."] = "馬上來，{name}。這是我今天唯一照計畫走的事。"
L["Asking nicely works, {name}. Tell everyone. The world could use the news."] = "客氣問就有，{name}。去宣傳吧，世界需要好消息。"
L["At once, {name}. Stay put, or this lands on your shadow instead."] = "馬上，{name}。別動，不然會加到你影子上。"
L["Safe travels, {name}. {buff} packs lighter than a sword."] = "路上小心，{name}。{buff}比劍輕便多了。"
L["A small blessing for the road, {name}."] = "路上的一點小祝福，{name}。"
L["Go well, {name}, and come back in one piece."] = "保重，{name}，要平安歸來。"
L["No reason, {name}. It just felt like a {buff} sort of day."] = "沒什麼原因，{name}。只是今天很適合{buff}。"
L["Don't mind me, {name}. Just passing, with a spare {buff}."] = "別在意，{name}。路過，剛好多一份{buff}。"
L["Consider it a gift, {name}. I'd wrap it, but it glows through the paper."] = "當作禮物吧，{name}。本想包裝，但它會透光。"
L["Here, {name}. Pass it on when you meet someone who needs it."] = "給你，{name}。遇到需要的人，再傳下去。"
L["Whatever brings you here, {name}, may it go better than planned."] = "不管你為何而來，{name}，願一切比計畫更順。"
L["Just being neighbourly, {name}. Very, very temporary neighbours."] = "敦親睦鄰嘛，{name}。非常非常短暫的鄰居。"
L["You looked about to do something brave, {name}. Here, for that."] = "你一臉要去幹大事的樣子，{name}。拿去壯膽。"
L["No need to stop, {name}. It works while you walk."] = "不用停下來，{name}。它邊走邊生效。"
L["Nothing asked, nothing owed, {name}. Nothing to do but go and be splendid."] = "不求回報，不欠人情，{name}。只管去發光發熱。"
L["Call it a wager, {name}, that you'll do something worthwhile with it."] = "就當我押注吧，{name}，賭你會拿它幹番大事。"
L["A gift from a passing stranger, {name}. The best kind, the old stories say."] = "路人送的禮，{name}。老故事說這種最靈。"
L["It's rude to pass someone without a greeting, {name}. This is mine."] = "擦身而過不打招呼很失禮，{name}。這是我的招呼。"
L["Same road as me, {name}? Then take this for the journey."] = "跟我同路，{name}？那帶上這個上路吧。"
L["If today goes well, {name}, remember me. If it goes badly, I was never here."] = "今天順利，{name}，記得我。不順，我沒來過。"
L["Hold still a moment, {name}. There. Best-prepared person in sight."] = "別動，{name}。好了，放眼望去你準備最周全。"
L["Everyone ready? You are now, {name}."] = "準備好了嗎？{name}，現在你好了。"
L["A little something for the party, {name}."] = "給隊伍的一點小心意，{name}。"
L["Stay close, {name}. We go further together."] = "跟緊點，{name}。一起走才走得遠。"
L["House rules, {name}: nobody dies, nobody sulks, everybody eats after."] = "家規，{name}：不准死，不准鬧，打完一起吃。"
L["There, {name}. Now if this goes badly, it won't be my fault."] = "好了，{name}。現在要是出事，可不是我的錯。"
L["All set, {name}. I'd give a speech, but we'd be here all day."] = "都好了，{name}。本想演講，但會講到天黑。"
L["Look after that, {name}. It's the only one I brought for you."] = "好好保管，{name}。我只帶了你這一份。"
L["Now we look the part, {name}. Let's go and be it."] = "架勢有了，{name}。去拿出實力吧。"
L["Fresh {buff} all round, {name}. The rest is luck and elbows."] = "{buff}全員更新，{name}。其餘就靠運氣和卡位。"
L["If anyone has a plan, {name}, now's the time. No? Wonderful. Onward."] = "誰有計畫，{name}，快說。沒有？太好了，出發。"
L["One each, {name}. Don't swap; they're fitted."] = "一人一個，{name}。別互換，都是量身訂做的。"
L["Whoever starts the fight, {name}, has to tell the story afterwards."] = "誰先開怪，{name}，打完就由誰來交代。"
L["Good friends, sharp steel, {buff}. What else is there, {name}?"] = "好夥伴、利刃、{buff}。還缺什麼，{name}？"
L["Stay where I can see you, {name}. I can't help what I can't find."] = "別離開我視線，{name}。找不到人我可幫不了。"
L["If this ends up a legend, {name}, I want a line in it. Just the one."] = "要是寫成傳奇，{name}，我要一句台詞。一句就好。"
L["Brace yourselves, {name}. And each other, if it comes to that."] = "大家撐住，{name}。必要時互相撐著。"
L["Chin up, {name}. Whatever's ahead has never met this lot before."] = "抬頭挺胸，{name}。前面那些還沒見識過我們這群。"
L["Do try to stay in one piece, {name}. I'm only equipped for small repairs."] = "盡量保持完整，{name}。我只會小修小補。"
L["Well, {name}, we look ready. Let's go before we find out otherwise."] = "看起來準備好了，{name}。趁還沒露餡，快出發。"
L["If we get lost, {name}, we're exploring. Nobody ever scolded an explorer."] = "要是迷路，{name}，就叫探險。沒人會罵探險家。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd conjure a gift in return, but it would only be water."] = "謝謝，{name}。本想變個回禮，但我只變得出水。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. I'll write it up properly later. Several pages."] = "感激不盡，{name}。我之後寫成報告，好幾頁。"
L["Thank you, {name}. They never taught gratitude at Dalaran. I'm self-taught."] = "謝謝，{name}。達拉然沒教過感恩，我是自學的。"
L["Kind of you, {name}. Everyone assumes mages need no help. We do."] = "真好心，{name}。大家都以為法師不需要幫忙。我們需要。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I nearly Counterspelled that on reflex. So glad I didn't."] = "謝謝，{name}。我差點反射性法術反制，還好沒有。"
L["Even a frost mage would thaw at that, {name}. Thank you."] = "連冰法都被你融化了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Noted in my spellbook, between Frost Nova and lunch."] = "謝謝，{name}。已記入法術書，冰霜新星和午餐間。"
L["Repaid at once, {name}, before I pass a bookshop. I've lost weeks that way."] = "先還你，{name}，趁我還沒逛書店。一逛就好幾週。"
L["Twenty years in the library, {name}, and no book mentioned people like you."] = "圖書館待了二十年，{name}，沒書寫過你這種好人。"
L["Arcane theory says nothing comes free, {name}. Theory was wrong. Thank you."] = "秘法理論說沒有白吃的午餐，{name}。錯了。謝謝。"
L["Of course, {name}. And yes, I suppose you'll want water as well."] = "當然，{name}。我知道，你還要水，對吧。"
L["As requested, {name}. I'll find my page again later."] = "如你所求，{name}。讀到哪頁，我等等再找。"
L["At once, {name}. Carefully, too; I've blinked into two walls today."] = "馬上，{name}。會小心的，今天已閃現撞牆兩次。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Knowledge should be shared. The Kirin Tor say so, reluctantly."] = "樂意，{name}。知識該分享——祈倫托勉強這麼說。"
L["Certainly, {name}. I'll cast it slowly. The hand movements are the best part."] = "當然，{name}。我慢慢施法，手勢才是精華。"
L["Of course, {name}. Think of it as homework, and I've done it for you."] = "當然，{name}。就當是作業，我幫你寫好了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Antonidas taught me this. He also taught me to duck."] = "當然，{name}。安東尼達斯教的。他還教我怎麼閃。"
L["At once, {name}. Arcane, not fire. I did check."] = "馬上，{name}。是秘法不是火，查過了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. It's this or a lecture on ley lines, and you've been kind."] = "當然，{name}。不然就聽我講地脈。你人好，免了。"
L["You asked a mage, {name}. The spell is instant; the explanation is not."] = "你問的是法師，{name}。法術瞬發，解說可不是。"
L["I've cast this a thousand times, {name}. Nine hundred and ninety went well."] = "這我施放過一千次了，{name}。九百九十次都很順。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Stand still. Fidgeters have been known to end up woolly."] = "當然，{name}。別動。亂動的人有時會長出羊毛。"
L["Here, {name}. I had a spare thought and nowhere to put it."] = "給你，{name}。我多了一個念頭，沒地方放。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd add bread, but conjured bread tastes of nothing."] = "拿著，{name}。本想附麵包，但魔法麵包沒味道。"
L["{buff} for you, {name}. No charge, unlike the portals."] = "{buff}送你，{name}。免費，不像傳送門。"
L["Here, {name}. Most folk I point at turn into sheep. Today's your lucky day."] = "給你，{name}。被我指到的多半變羊，你今天走運。"
L["Nothing on fire, nothing frozen, {name}. I'm branching out."] = "沒燒到，也沒冰到，{name}。我在拓展業務。"
L["For you, {name}. I was practising, and you happened to be the nearest head."] = "給你，{name}。我在練習，你剛好是最近的腦袋。"
L["Here, {name}. Freshly cast, and hardly crackling at all."] = "給你，{name}。剛施放的，幾乎沒在劈啪響。"
L["Kings once hired Dalaran for this, {name}. You get it for nothing."] = "以前國王得花錢請達拉然做這個，{name}。你免費。"
L["Take this, {name}. It wears off, unlike my last experiment."] = "拿著，{name}。它會消退，不像我上次的實驗。"
L["For you, {name}: everything I learned in Dalaran, minus the essays."] = "給你，{name}：我在達拉然學的一切，扣掉報告。"
L["Here, {name}. Arcane magic is best shared, before it gets ideas of its own."] = "給你，{name}。秘法要早點分享，免得它自作主張。"
L["Evocation takes an age, {name}, so I spend my mana where it counts. Here."] = "喚醒超久，{name}，所以法力只花在刀口上。給你。"
L["Here, {name}. A mage who walks past without helping is just a very tall hat."] = "給你，{name}。見人不幫的法師，就只是頂高帽子。"
L["Now that you're clever, {name}, stand between me and the angry things."] = "你變聰明了，{name}，那就站到我跟怪物中間吧。"
L["For the record, {name}, I only blink away when it's tactically sound."] = "先說清楚，{name}，我只在戰術需要時才閃現跑掉。"
L["Water's on me after, {name}. Please don't ask for it mid-fight."] = "打完水我請，{name}。戰鬥中請別跟我要。"
L["Minds sharpened, {name}. I'll handle the fire, the frost and the panicking."] = "腦袋磨利了，{name}。火焰、冰霜和慌亂交給我。"
L["Right, {name}: if I say 'Frost Nova', run. If I say 'run', also run."] = "好，{name}：喊「冰霜新星」就跑，喊「跑」也跑。"
L["Pyroblast takes a while, {name}. Whatever interrupts it, I take personally."] = "炎爆術要讀很久，{name}。誰打斷它，我就記仇。"
L["If I ice-block, {name}, I'm not frozen with fear. I'm frozen on purpose."] = "我若開冰箱，{name}，不是嚇到凍住，是故意的。"
L["Portals home are on me after, {name}. Getting there alive is on all of us."] = "回程傳送門我包，{name}。活著回去靠大家。"
L["Anything you'd rather not fight, {name}, point at it. It'll be wool by teatime."] = "不想打的，{name}，指給我看。下午茶前就變羊毛。"
L["I'll drop a Blizzard on them, {name}. You're welcome to watch, from outside it."] = "我來下場暴風雪，{name}。歡迎觀賞，請站外面。"
L["Keep them off me, {name}, and I'll keep them on fire."] = "別讓它們近我身，{name}，我就讓它們一直燒。"
L["If I go quiet, {name}, it's Evocation, not sulking. Usually."] = "我不說話時，{name}，是在喚醒，不是賭氣。通常。"
L["If this goes badly, {name}, I've a teleport home. I'd never use it. Probably."] = "若出事，{name}，我能傳送回家。絕不會用。大概。"
L["How thoughtful, {name}. The Light keeps accounts; I settle mine early."] = "真貼心，{name}。聖光有記帳，我提早結清。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll put in a good word with the Light. It owes me several."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會向聖光美言，它欠我好幾次。"
L["Thank you, {name}. A small miracle, and I didn't even have to pray for it."] = "謝謝，{name}。一個小奇蹟，我連禱告都不用。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My faith in people is restored. It was only resting."] = "謝謝，{name}。我對人的信心回來了，它只是休息。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You're in tonight's prayers. Near the top."] = "謝謝，{name}。今晚禱告有你，排很前面。"
L["Healers are rarely on this end of it, {name}. I'd forgotten how nice it is."] = "補師很少當收的那方，{name}。都忘了這麼舒服。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You've saved me a prayer, and I'm always one short."] = "謝謝，{name}。幫我省了一次禱告，我老是差一次。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd give a sermon on generosity, but you've just given it."] = "謝謝，{name}。本想講道談慷慨，你剛示範完了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll light a candle for you. Two. I'm feeling reckless."] = "謝謝，{name}。為你點根蠟燭。兩根，我豁出去了。"
L["Even my shadowy side is smiling, {name}. It has no face, so take my word."] = "我的暗影面都笑了，{name}。它沒臉，你信我就好。"
L["Of course, {name}. The Light keeps no hours, and neither, sadly, do I."] = "當然，{name}。聖光全年無休，可惜我也是。"
L["Straight away, {name}. Most prayers take longer; you've found a shortcut."] = "馬上，{name}。禱告通常沒這麼快，你找到捷徑了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. The Light shines on those who ask. I just aim it."] = "當然，{name}。聖光照耀開口的人，我只負責瞄準。"
L["With pleasure, {name}. Faith moves mountains; I'm starting smaller."] = "樂意，{name}。信仰能移山，我先從小的開始。"
L["Of course, {name}. Confessions are extra, and I'd rather not hear them."] = "當然，{name}。告解另外收費，而且我不太想聽。"
L["Of course, {name}. Nobody who asks goes without. The Light's rule, and mine."] = "當然，{name}。開口的人不會落空。聖光的規矩，也是我的。"
L["Certainly, {name}. A warm glow means the Light. A cold one, tell me at once."] = "當然，{name}。暖光是聖光。冷光的話，馬上說。"
L["Of course, {name}. I'll pray it lasts. I'm told I have an in."] = "當然，{name}。我會祈禱它持久，聽說我上面有人。"
L["Certainly, {name}. I heal, I smite, I do funerals. This is the cheerful bit."] = "當然，{name}。補血、懲擊、辦喪事，這個最歡樂。"
L["Bless you, {name}. No, you didn't sneeze; I'm simply thorough."] = "聖光保佑，{name}。連坐騎和背包，我很周到。"
L["Here, {name}. Think of it as a prayer that arrived early."] = "給你，{name}。就當是提早應驗的禱告。"
L["The Light asked me to pass this along, {name}. I'm paraphrasing."] = "聖光託我轉交給你，{name}。原話我稍微意譯了。"
L["Take this, {name}. It saves us both an awkward resurrection later."] = "拿著，{name}。免得待會兒還得尷尬地復活你。"
L["Freely given, {name}. Faith costs nothing. The robes, sadly, did."] = "免費送你，{name}。信仰不花錢，法袍可就貴了。"
L["Here, {name}. Think of me as a small, walking temple. No steps to climb."] = "給你，{name}。當我是會走的小神殿，免爬台階。"
L["A blessing for a stranger, {name}. The Light insists there's no such thing."] = "給路人的祝福，{name}。聖光說世上沒有路人。"
L["Take this, {name}. No collection plate follows. Look: empty hands."] = "拿著，{name}。不會傳奉獻盤。你看，兩手空空。"
L["Here, {name}. I'd preach, but you look like somebody with somewhere to be."] = "給你，{name}。本想傳道，但你看起來趕時間。"
L["Small mercies are my speciality, {name}. Here's one."] = "小小的慈悲是我的專長，{name}。給你一份。"
L["Here, {name}. I'd float over properly, but levitating in public draws a crowd."] = "給你，{name}。本想飄過來，當街漂浮會被圍觀。"
L["Your turn, {name}. Now, I beg you all: make my job boring."] = "輪到你，{name}。拜託各位：讓我閒到發慌。"
L["Everyone stay near me, {name}. The Light has a limited range."] = "大家靠近我，{name}。聖光也是有距離限制的。"
L["There, {name}. If anyone falls, I'll be very disappointed, then fix it."] = "好了，{name}。誰倒下我會很失望，然後修好他。"
L["Done, {name}. I'll be at the back, praying loudly."] = "好了，{name}。我在後面大聲禱告。"
L["If I scream, {name}, it's a spell, and everything runs. Please don't join in."] = "我若尖叫，{name}，是法術，怪會逃。你別跟著跑。"
L["If I Fade, {name}, I haven't gone. I've just become deeply uninteresting."] = "我若漸隱，{name}，不是走了，是變得超無趣。"
L["One shield each, {name}. After that, souls need a lie-down. Pace yourselves."] = "一人一盾，{name}。之後靈魂得躺一下，省著用。"
L["Let's all come back from this the usual way, {name}: walking."] = "大家用正常方式回來，{name}：用走的，別跑屍。"
L["I'll keep you alive, {name}. You keep me from having to say 'I told you so'."] = "我讓你活著，{name}。你別讓我說「我早說過」。"
L["I prayed over this group, {name}. The Light said 'good luck'. I'll take it."] = "為這隊禱告了，{name}。聖光說「祝好運」。也行。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd offer you berries, but I ate them all."] = "謝謝，{name}。本想請你吃莓果，但我全吃光了。"
L["Thanks, {name}. Like rain in a dry season."] = "謝了，{name}。像旱季裡的一場雨。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. My cat form wants to bring you a rabbit. I've said no."] = "多謝，{name}。我變豹時想叼兔子送你，被我攔了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll plant a tree in your honour. Give it a century."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會為你種棵樹。給它一百年。"
L["Thank you, {name}. May your road stay green and your water sweet."] = "謝謝，{name}。願你的路常青，水常甜。"
L["Kindly done, {name}. I felt that right down to my roots."] = "真好心，{name}。一路暖到我的根。"
L["Nature returns everything eventually, {name}. I'm quicker. Thank you."] = "自然終究會歸還一切，{name}。我比較快。謝謝。"
L["Barkskin keeps most things out, {name}. Kindness got straight through. Thanks."] = "樹皮術擋得住刀劍，{name}，擋不住善意。謝了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. As a bear this would be a hug. Be glad I'm in this shape."] = "謝謝，{name}。變熊的話就是熊抱了，算你好運。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Give me a moment to remember which shape has hands."] = "當然，{name}。等等，我想想哪個形態有手。"
L["Of course, {name}. Hold still, like an oak. Oaks are wonderful at it."] = "當然，{name}。像橡樹一樣站好。橡樹超會站。"
L["Gladly, {name}. The wild shares everything. Well, not the bears."] = "樂意，{name}。大自然什麼都分享。呃，熊除外。"
L["Right away, {name}. The wild's had a good season; it can spare this."] = "馬上，{name}。荒野今年收成好，分得出這個。"
L["Of course, {name}. Nature doesn't take requests, but I do."] = "當然，{name}。大自然不接受點歌，我接受。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Ask a tree and you'll wait a year. Ask a druid and it's now."] = "樂意，{name}。問樹要等一年，問德魯伊馬上有。"
L["Of course, {name}. The balance tips a little your way. Don't tell the balance."] = "當然，{name}。平衡稍微偏向你了。別告訴平衡。"
L["I'd have run over, {name}, but as a cheetah, and you'd have screamed. Here."] = "本想跑過來，{name}，但變成獵豹你會尖叫。給你。"
L["Of course, {name}. The wild is kind to all who ask. Midges excepted."] = "當然，{name}。荒野善待每個開口的人。蚊子除外。"
L["Fresh from the Emerald Dream, {name}. Sorry if I yawn."] = "剛出翡翠夢境，{name}。打呵欠請見諒。"
L["Take this, {name}. Nature provides, and I'm its errand runner today."] = "拿著，{name}。自然供應一切，今天我負責跑腿。"
L["The wild calls you friend now, {name}. Handy, since most of it has teeth."] = "荒野當你是朋友了，{name}。很實用，它大多有牙。"
L["I'd have picked you flowers, {name}, but this keeps better."] = "本想摘花給你，{name}，但這個比較耐放。"
L["Here, {name}. Cenarius would want you to have it. I'm nearly sure."] = "給你，{name}。塞納留斯會希望你收下。應該吧。"
L["Here, {name}. For cold nights, sharp claws and long roads."] = "給你，{name}。為了寒夜、利爪和長路。"
L["Take this, {name}. The wild has been watching you, and it's decided you'll do."] = "拿著，{name}。荒野觀察你很久了，決定你及格了。"
L["There, {name}. Walk lightly, and the forest will walk with you."] = "好了，{name}。腳步放輕，森林會與你同行。"
L["For you, {name}. The Moonglade sends its regards. It sends very few."] = "給你，{name}。月光林地向你問好。它很少問候誰。"
L["Nature is cruel, lovely and damp, {name}. This helps with two of those."] = "大自然殘酷、美麗又潮濕，{name}。這能擋兩樣。"
L["I tie strangers up in roots most days, {name}. This is the nicer part."] = "我平常用根鬚綁路人，{name}。這是和善的那一面。"
L["Ready, {name}? Now, whatever happens, nobody startle the bear."] = "準備好了，{name}？不管發生什麼，別嚇到熊。"
L["There, {name}. I'll be the cat, the bear or, if we must swim, the seal."] = "好了，{name}。我會當貓、當熊，要游泳就當海豹。"
L["I've one rebirth in me, {name}. Please, nobody make me choose."] = "我只有一次復生，{name}。拜託別讓我選。"
L["Close ranks, {name}. The forest is watching, and it's rooting for us."] = "靠緊點，{name}。森林在看，也挺我們，樹最挺了。"
L["I'll heal or I'll maul, {name}. Tell me which before it's urgent."] = "我能治療，也能撕咬，{name}。要哪個，趁還不急先說。"
L["I've one Innervate, {name}. Whoever looks most desperate gets it. No acting."] = "啟動只有一個，{name}。誰最絕望給誰。不准演。"
L["If I start glowing and hooting, {name}, that's moonkin. It's a serious form."] = "我若發光又咕咕叫，{name}，是梟獸。很正經的。"
L["If it gets crowded, {name}, I'll call a Hurricane. Hold on to your hats."] = "要是太擠，{name}，我就放颶風術。抓好你的帽子。"
L["We move like a herd, {name}. A mixed herd. One of us is sometimes a bear."] = "成群前進，{name}。雜牌獸群，偶爾有人變熊。"
L["Kindness, {name}? My favourite virtue. Just ahead of polishing."] = "善意，{name}？我最愛的美德，險勝擦亮盔甲。"
L["For that, {name}, my best blessing. Not the second best. The best."] = "給你最好的祝福，{name}。不是次好，是最好。"
L["Virtue rewarded on the spot, {name}! I do love it when that happens."] = "善有善報，當場兌現，{name}！我最愛這種時候。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My oath says to repay kindness. I'd do it anyway."] = "謝謝，{name}。誓言要我報恩，但沒有誓言我也會。"
L["I'll judge you favourably, {name}. I judge most things harshly. Thank you."] = "我會從寬審判你，{name}。別人我都嚴審。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My aura just brightened. It does that when I'm touched."] = "謝謝，{name}。光環亮了一下，我一感動就這樣。"
L["A kindness, {name}! I'll have it engraved on my shield, beside the dents."] = "真是善舉，{name}！我要刻在盾上，就在凹痕旁。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. My warhorse sends thanks as well. He's more reserved."] = "多謝，{name}。我的戰馬也道謝，牠比較含蓄。"
L["I swore to protect the good, {name}. You've just gone to the top of the list."] = "我發誓守護好人，{name}。你剛登上名單第一名。"
L["By the Light, {name}, of course! I've been hoping somebody would ask."] = "以聖光之名，{name}，當然！我一直在等人開口。"
L["You have my blessing, {name}, in every sense."] = "我祝福你，{name}，各種意義上都是。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Kneel if you like. I won't insist. I'll be delighted."] = "當然，{name}。想跪就跪，不勉強。但我會很開心。"
L["Gladly, {name}. I never run short of blessings. Mana, now and then."] = "樂意，{name}。祝福我從不缺，法力偶爾缺。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Hold still. My aim is righteous; my gauntlets are clumsy."] = "當然，{name}。別動。我瞄得正義，但鐵手套很笨。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Helping is the oath. Shining while I do it is a bonus."] = "樂意，{name}。幫忙是誓言，順便發光是額外福利。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand fast, chin up, and look deserving. There. You do."] = "當然，{name}。站穩抬頭，一臉值得。好，你值得。"
L["Of course, {name}. You'd be amazed how rarely anyone asks the tin can for help."] = "當然，{name}。你不會相信，很少人找鐵罐頭幫忙。"
L["Of course, {name}. A moment while I pick the blessing. I do have favourites."] = "當然，{name}。等我挑個祝福。我是有偏心的。"
L["The Light asks nothing in return, {name}. I, however, accept thanks."] = "聖光不求回報，{name}。但我接受道謝。"
L["Go with the Light, {name}. I'll be right behind you, clanking."] = "與聖光同行，{name}。我在你身後哐啷哐啷。"
L["The blessing's free, {name}. You've been spared the sermon. This time."] = "祝福免費，{name}。講道就免了，這次先放過你。"
L["There, {name}. It won't last forever, so be heroic while it does."] = "好了，{name}。它不會永久，趁它還在當個英雄。"
L["Stand tall, {name}. The Light walks with you, and it has excellent posture."] = "挺起胸膛，{name}。聖光與你同行，它站姿超標準。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd give you my hammer too, but it's very attached to me."] = "拿著，{name}。本想連錘子也給你，但它很黏我。"
L["Blessings are for handing out, {name}. Hoarding them is frowned upon. By me."] = "祝福就是拿來發的，{name}。囤積會被白眼。被我。"
L["Justice for the wicked, blessings for the rest, {name}. You're the rest."] = "惡人得正義，其他人得祝福，{name}。你是其他人。"
L["Take this, {name}. My libram says to share. It says a lot; this bit I like."] = "拿著，{name}。聖契說要分享。它囉嗦，這段我愛。"
L["Chivalry isn't dead, {name}. It's in heavy armour, and it brought you this."] = "騎士精神沒死，{name}。它穿上重甲，帶來了這個。"
L["Wear it with pride, {name}. Pride's a sin, but only in large amounts."] = "帶著驕傲收下，{name}。驕傲是罪，但適量無妨。"
L["You're blessed, {name}. Keep behind my shield and we'll do fine."] = "祝福好了，{name}。待在我盾後，我們會沒事。"
L["Stand fast, {name}. We have the Light, and I have a very large hammer."] = "站穩，{name}。我們有聖光，我還有超大錘子。"
L["One blessing each, {name}. The Light is generous, but it insists on turns."] = "一人一個祝福，{name}。聖光很慷慨，但要排隊。"
L["Splendid, {name}. Now, nobody look directly at me. I'm rather bright today."] = "很好，{name}。現在大家別直視我，我今天特別亮。"
L["Stay inside my aura, {name}. It's warmer than it looks."] = "待在我的光環裡，{name}。比看起來溫暖。"
L["If I stun something, {name}, hit it while it's thinking things over."] = "我要是暈住什麼，{name}，趁它在反省時揍它。"
L["The glowing ground is mine, {name}. Stand in it freely; it only bites them."] = "發光的地板是我的，{name}。放心站，它只咬敵人。"
L["I'll judge them, {name}, and you sentence them. A very efficient court."] = "我來審判，{name}，你來判刑。超有效率的法庭。"
L["If I shout 'for the Light', {name}, it means charge. Or pray. Usually both."] = "「為了聖光」就是衝，{name}。或禱告。通常都是。"
L["Armour polished, hammer blessed, {name}, and my horse is sulking. We're ready."] = "盔甲擦亮、錘子祝福，{name}，馬在賭氣。就緒。"
L["I've called on Righteous Fury, {name}. Let them come to me."] = "我已喚起正義之怒，{name}。讓它們衝著我來。"
L["How kind, {name}. My imp says thank you too. He's lying, but I'm not."] = "真好心，{name}。小鬼也說謝謝。它說謊，我沒有。"
L["Thank you, {name}. It's been ages since anyone gave me something uncursed."] = "謝謝，{name}。好久沒人送我沒被詛咒的東西了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll repay you with something I didn't find in a crypt."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會拿不是墓穴撿來的東西還你。"
L["Most gracious, {name}. I've asked the voidwalker to stop looming at you."] = "承蒙厚意，{name}。我叫虛無行者別再杵著瞪你了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Most folk cross the road when they see me."] = "謝謝，{name}。多數人看到我都繞道走。"
L["No blood, no bargain, no binding, {name}? What a strange way to trade. Thanks."] = "不見血、不立約、不綁魂，{name}？怪交易，謝了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Should anything haunt you, send it my way."] = "謝謝，{name}。若有東西纏上你，丟給我處理。"
L["How thoughtful, {name}. Everything I'm given, I return. Except souls. Here."] = "真貼心，{name}。收到的我都還，靈魂除外。給你。"
L["Of course, {name}. No soul required. This time."] = "當然，{name}。不需要靈魂。這次。"
L["You asked a warlock for help, {name}. Bold. I like you already."] = "你找術士幫忙，{name}？有膽。我已經喜歡你了。"
L["Of course, {name}. The imp offered to help, and I said no, for all our sakes."] = "當然，{name}。小鬼說要幫忙，為大家好我拒絕了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Of all my spells, this is the one I can do at parties."] = "當然，{name}。我唯一能在派對上用的法術。"
L["Gladly, {name}. A good deed on my record; the Shadow Council would be appalled."] = "樂意，{name}。記上一筆善行，暗影議會會嚇壞的。"
L["Of course, {name}. Please don't read the book I'm holding. For your own sake."] = "當然，{name}。別看我手上的書。為你好。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Feel watched? That's only the Eye of Kilrogg. Hold still."] = "當然，{name}。被盯著？只是基爾羅格之眼。別動。"
L["Of course, {name}. I only curse people who don't ask nicely. You're quite safe."] = "當然，{name}。我只詛咒不客氣的人。你很安全。"
L["Yes, {name}, it's the one without screaming. Hold still."] = "對，{name}，是沒有慘叫的那個。別動。"
L["Of course, {name}. Going somewhere wet? I won't ask. Warlocks never ask."] = "當然，{name}。要去玩水？我不問。術士從不過問。"
L["Here, {name}. Don't ask where it came from. Really, don't."] = "給你，{name}。別問從哪來的。真的，別問。"
L["Fall in a lake someday, {name}, and you'll think of me fondly."] = "哪天掉進湖裡，{name}，你會很想念我。"
L["Breathe easy, {name}. I'd hate to lose you to anything as dull as water."] = "放心呼吸，{name}。淹死太無聊了，不配你。"
L["Here, {name}. You'll want a soulstone too, but that's a bigger conversation."] = "給你，{name}。你還會想要靈魂石，但那得另外談。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's the only spell of mine the priests approve of."] = "拿著，{name}。這是我唯一被牧師認可的法術。"
L["Take this, {name}. My mother still thinks I'm a mage. Let's keep it that way."] = "拿著，{name}。我媽還以為我是法師。別說出去。"
L["Here, {name}. It isn't green, it doesn't whisper, and it won't follow you home."] = "給你，{name}。它不綠、不低語，也不會跟你回家。"
L["Here, {name}. Dark magic, used for good. Do tell my old tutor; he'll hate it."] = "黑魔法行善，{name}。去跟我老師講，他會氣死。"
L["Here, {name}. I keep the darker spells for people who've earned them."] = "給你，{name}。更黑暗的法術，留給自找的人。"
L["Here, {name}. I'm not all curses and fear. Mostly, but not all."] = "給你，{name}。詛咒和恐懼不是我的全部。大半是。"
L["My grimoire has a chapter on kindness, {name}. It's short, but I've read it."] = "我的魔典有一章講善良，{name}。很短，但我讀過。"
L["Everyone ready, {name}? Souls intact? Good. Let's keep it that way."] = "都準備好了，{name}？靈魂都在？很好，保持。"
L["Stay close, {name}. The voidwalker takes the hits; I take the credit."] = "跟緊，{name}。虛無行者挨揍，功勞歸我。"
L["Swim all you like, {name}. If anyone drifts off, I'll summon them back."] = "盡情游吧，{name}。誰漂走了，我再召喚回來。"
L["Do pet the felhunter, {name}. Just take your spells off first."] = "摸摸地獄獵犬吧，{name}。先把法術卸下就好。"
L["If I fear something, {name}, don't chase it. It comes back. Angrier."] = "被我恐懼的別追，{name}。它會回來，而且更火大。"
L["I trade blood for mana, {name}. It looks worse than it is."] = "我用血換法力，{name}。看著嚇人，其實還好。"
L["Healthstones after, {name}. For a crisis, mind, not as a snack."] = "治療石待會發，{name}。危急時用，不是零食。"
L["Keep clear when I cast Hellfire, {name}. I burn too. That's the tragic part."] = "地獄烈焰時閃遠點，{name}。我也會燒，悲劇啊。"
L["My imp is on fire, {name}, and he's on our side. Please stop dousing him."] = "小鬼著火是正常的，{name}。它是自己人，別潑水。"
L["If something green falls from the sky, {name}, that's mine. Cheer."] = "天上掉下綠色的東西，{name}，是我的。歡呼吧。"
L["Thank you, {name}! Sorry, was that loud? I only have the one volume."] = "謝謝你，{name}！太大聲了？抱歉，我只有這音量。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. No spells to give back, but I do a very sincere shout."] = "多謝，{name}。沒法術可回，但我能很真誠地吼。"
L["Thanks, {name}. Now I'm twice as angry. In the good way."] = "謝了，{name}。我加倍火大了。好的那種。"
L["Thanks, {name}. You've earned a place right behind me. Safest spot there is."] = "謝了，{name}。你贏得我正後方的位置，最安全。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Kindness makes me soft. Luckily I've plenty of armour."] = "謝謝，{name}。善意讓我心軟。還好我盔甲夠厚。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My armourer thanks you too. I paid for his house."] = "謝謝，{name}。鐵匠也謝你，他的房子是我付的。"
L["Thanks, {name}. I'd bandage something for you, but you look annoyingly fine."] = "謝了，{name}。想幫你包紮，可惜你好得讓人扼腕。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I switched to my grateful stance for that. It's rarely used."] = "謝謝，{name}。我切到感恩姿態了。這姿態很少用。"
L["You've given me magic, {name}. No idea where to keep it. I'll wear it. Thanks."] = "你給我魔法了，{name}。沒處放，就穿著吧。謝了。"
L["Owing folk makes me restless, {name}, and restless makes me charge things."] = "欠人情讓我坐立難安，{name}，一不安我就想衝鋒。"
L["You want a shout, {name}? I was going to shout anyway."] = "要我吼一聲，{name}？反正我本來就要吼。"
L["Of course, {name}. A fighter who asks for courage already has some."] = "當然，{name}。敢開口要勇氣的鬥士，本來就有勇氣。"
L["Right away, {name}. Square your shoulders. There, that's half of it."] = "馬上，{name}。挺起肩膀。好，這就成功一半了。"
L["Happily, {name}! Go hit something for me."] = "樂意，{name}！幫我去揍點東西。"
L["Right, {name}. Deep breath. Not you. Me."] = "好，{name}。深呼吸。不是你，是我。"
L["Happy to, {name}. First request today that didn't involve lifting something."] = "樂意，{name}。今天第一個不用扛東西的請求。"
L["Coming up, {name}. Plant your feet. This one has a kick to it."] = "來了，{name}。站穩，這個很夠勁。"
L["Of course, {name}. Most folk only ask me to stop. This is a nice change."] = "當然，{name}。大家通常只叫我閉嘴。這次真新鮮。"
L["Of course, {name}. Took me years to learn. Years of yelling at trees, mostly."] = "當然，{name}。我練了好幾年，主要是對著樹吼。"
L["Consider yourself shouted at, {name}. Affectionately."] = "你被我吼了，{name}。充滿愛的那種。"
L["No incense, no prayers, {name}. Just me, shouting encouragingly."] = "不燒香，不禱告，{name}。只有我在大吼加油。"
L["Chin up, {name}! If anything bothers you, I'll charge it."] = "打起精神，{name}！誰惹你，我就衝過去。"
L["There, {name}! Anything that doesn't feel braver now wasn't listening."] = "好了，{name}！還不覺得更勇敢的，就是沒在聽。"
L["Here, {name}, some courage. Spend it freely; I've plenty more."] = "給你，{name}，一點勇氣。儘管用，我多得是。"
L["Here, {name}. Something sharper than a whetstone: morale."] = "給你，{name}。比磨刀石更利的東西：士氣。"
L["Take this, {name}. Warriors don't carry spells, so we carry each other."] = "拿著，{name}。戰士不帶法術，所以我們互相扛。"
L["Here, {name}. You look about to walk into something big. Walk in harder."] = "給你，{name}。你看起來要闖大事了。闖猛一點。"
L["Here, {name}. No magic in it. Just a warrior believing in you, very firmly."] = "給你，{name}。沒魔法，只有一個戰士死命相信你。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's loud, it's free, and I mean it."] = "拿著，{name}。夠大聲、免費，而且我是真心的。"
L["Here, {name}. Tell whatever you fight that a warrior vouched for you."] = "給你，{name}。跟你的對手說，有個戰士替你擔保。"
L["That one was for you, {name}. The next one's for whatever's in your way."] = "這一吼是給你的，{name}。下一吼給擋你路的東西。"
L["Listen up, {name}! That's it. That was the whole speech."] = "聽好了，{name}！就這樣。演講結束。"
L["Where's the danger, {name}? Never mind, I'll find it. Face first."] = "危險在哪，{name}？算了，我自己找。用臉找。"
L["Right, {name}! I go first, I shout loudest, and nobody touches the healer."] = "好，{name}！我先上，我最大聲，誰都不准碰補師。"
L["Everybody angrier? Good. Onward, {name}, and mind my backswing."] = "都更火大了？好。前進，{name}，別被我揮到。"
L["I need to be hit before I'm any use, {name}. Nobody panic when it happens."] = "我得先挨揍才有用，{name}。到時大家別慌。"
L["Bandages are in my pack, {name}. I tied the knots, so they're very secure."] = "繃帶在我包裡，{name}。結是我打的，牢到解不開。"
L["Right, {name}: I take the hits, you take the credit, and we split the repairs."] = "好，{name}：我挨打，你領功，修裝費平分。"
L["If I go red and quiet, {name}, that's Berserker Rage. Red and loud, all's well."] = "紅臉不吭聲，{name}，是狂暴之怒。還會吼就沒事。"
L["My shield's seen worse than this, {name}. So has my face. Onward."] = "我的盾見過更慘的，{name}。我的臉也是。前進！"
L["A sharper mind for you, {name}. Mine cost me an eyebrow in Dalaran."] = "腦袋靈光點，{name}。我的在達拉然賠了一邊眉毛。"
L["A clearer head for you, {name}. What you fill it with is your own affair."] = "腦袋清爽了，{name}。要裝什麼進去，隨你。"
L["Thoughts humming, {name}? Normal. If they hum back, come and find me."] = "腦袋嗡嗡響，{name}？正常。它要是回嘴，再找我。"
L["A little arcane for your thoughts, {name}. Keep the change."] = "替你的腦袋儲值一點秘法，{name}。不用找零。"
L["Brilliance, bottled, {name}. The Kirin Tor would charge you for the bottle."] = "光輝，裝瓶，{name}。祈倫托還會收你瓶子錢。"
L["Sharper wits, {name}. Spend them on spells, locks or riddles; I won't judge."] = "腦筋更靈了，{name}。施法開鎖猜謎都行，我不管。"
L["On loan from the Violet Citadel, {name}. Late returns are fined in sheep."] = "達拉然借來的，{name}。逾期不還，罰你變羊。"
L["Clever enough to spot the trap now, {name}. Avoiding it is a separate spell."] = "聰明到看得出陷阱了，{name}。躲開是另一個法術。"
L["There, {name}. Wiser already: look, you're standing further from me."] = "好了，{name}。變聰明了：看，你站離我遠了點。"
L["The one spell of mine that's never set anything alight, {name}. Enjoy."] = "我唯一沒燒過東西的法術，{name}。請慢用。"
L["A gnome's instructions make sense now, {name}. Still don't follow them."] = "地精說明書也看得懂了，{name}。但千萬別照做。"
L["Fortitude, {name}: a priest's polite way of saying 'stand in front'."] = "加耐力，{name}：牧師請你「站前面」的客套話。"
L["Every bit of stamina is one less panicked prayer from me, {name}."] = "每多一點耐力，我就少一次慌張的禱告，{name}。"
L["Tougher already, {name}. Please don't take that as a dare."] = "已經更耐打了，{name}。拜託別當成挑戰。"
L["There are other Power Words, {name}. 'Shield', and in emergencies, 'Run'."] = "真言術還有「盾」，{name}，緊急時還有「跑」。"
L["Sturdier now, {name}. Falls, bears and bad decisions all hurt a bit less."] = "更結實了，{name}。摔跤、熊和餿主意都沒那麼痛。"
L["{buff}, {name}. Three words where 'be tougher' would do."] = "{buff}，{name}。說「耐打點」不就好了。"
L["A little more of you to go round, {name}. Spend it slowly."] = "你加量不加價了，{name}。省著點用。"
L["Harder to knock down now, {name}. The ground will miss you."] = "現在你更難被打倒了，{name}。地面會想你的。"
L["Stubbornness, really, {name}. Dwarves are born with it; the rest of us pray."] = "其實是固執，{name}。矮人天生的，其他人靠禱告。"
L["The only armour that never needs repairing, {name}. The smiths hate it."] = "唯一永不用修的護甲，{name}。鐵匠恨死它了。"
L["Consider your spirits lifted, {name}. Divinely, as it happens."] = "你的精神被提振了，{name}。還是神聖等級的。"
L["Like a good night's sleep, {name}, without all the lying down."] = "像睡了一夜好覺，{name}，只是不用躺下。"
L["A second helping of spirit, {name}. The Light always insists on seconds."] = "精神再來一份，{name}。聖光總堅持要續碗。"
L["Keep your spirit where it is, {name}. Loose ones wander off."] = "靈魂好好留在身上，{name}。鬆了會走丟。"
L["Cheer up, {name}. That's not advice this time; it's a spell."] = "打起精神，{name}。這次不是建議，是法術。"
L["Recover faster, {name}, from long fights and longer walks."] = "恢復更快，{name}：不論長仗，還是更長的路。"
L["A deep breath's worth of calm, {name}, without having to take one."] = "一次深呼吸的平靜，{name}，還不用真的吸。"
L["The Light's own second wind, {name}. Don't waste it on arguments."] = "聖光給你回了口氣，{name}。別拿去生氣。"
L["Proof against shadow, {name}. I know its tricks; I've borrowed a few."] = "防暗影，{name}。它的把戲我熟，我也借用過幾招。"
L["Should the Void call, {name}, you can now pretend you're out."] = "虛無打來的話，{name}，你可以假裝不在家。"
L["For when the dark gets personal, {name}. It usually does."] = "黑暗找你算帳時用的，{name}。它通常會找。"
L["The shadows will have to knock first now, {name}."] = "現在暗影得先敲門了，{name}。"
L["The dark still bites, {name}, but now it has to chew."] = "黑暗還是會咬，{name}，咬得動算它牙好。"
L["A lining against the dark, {name}. Like a cloak, only on the inside."] = "防黑暗的內襯，{name}。像披風，只是穿在裡面。"
L["Curses slide right off you now, {name}. The cultists will take it personally."] = "詛咒現在沾不上你，{name}。邪教徒會覺得被針對。"
L["Priests study the Shadow to guard against it, {name}. Mostly."] = "牧師鑽研暗影是為了防它，{name}。大多是啦。"
L["For crypts, cults and Scholomance, {name}. The dark gets chatty in all three."] = "墓穴、邪教、通靈學院，{name}。三處黑暗都很健談。"
L["It won't keep off gloom, {name}. For that you want company. Here I am."] = "心理陰影它防不了，{name}。那要靠人陪，我在呢。"
L["Marked by the wild, {name}. The deer will tip their antlers as you pass."] = "被荒野標記了，{name}。你經過時鹿都會點角致意。"
L["You may smell faintly of moss, {name}. That's how you know it's working."] = "你可能會有點青苔味，{name}。這代表有效。"
L["Mark of the Wild, {name}. The wolves will still bite, but they'll feel bad."] = "野性印記，{name}。狼還是會咬，但會過意不去。"
L["The wild's own seal of approval, {name}. The squirrels were consulted."] = "荒野官方認證，{name}。有徵詢過松鼠意見。"
L["A little of the wild in you now, {name}. Resist the urge to howl."] = "你身上多了點野性，{name}。忍住別嚎叫。"
L["Hide, claw and a thick coat, {name}. The wild packs light but thorough."] = "硬皮、利爪加厚毛，{name}。荒野行李輕又齊全。"
L["Cenarius signs every one of these, {name}. Well, a tree does, on his behalf."] = "每份都有塞納留斯簽名，{name}。呃，是棵樹代簽的。"
L["The forest's own armour, {name}. It doesn't clank, and it smells of rain."] = "森林牌護甲，{name}。不會哐啷響，還有雨的味道。"
L["A tougher hide in seconds, {name}. The oaks took centuries and are furious."] = "幾秒就長出硬皮，{name}。橡樹花了幾百年，氣炸了。"
L["It's a loan from the wild, {name}. Try not to bring it back chewed."] = "這是跟荒野借的，{name}。歸還時別帶咬痕。"
L["Anything that bites you now gets a mouthful, {name}."] = "現在誰咬你，{name}，就會吃滿嘴刺。"
L["Let the boar charge, {name}. It'll leave with regrets and splinters."] = "讓野豬衝吧，{name}。牠會帶著悔恨和木刺離開。"
L["Like a rose, {name}: lovely to look at, a mistake to grab."] = "像玫瑰一樣，{name}：看著美，抓了後悔。"
L["Thorns, {name}. I grew them myself, so do be polite to them."] = "荊棘，{name}。我親手種的，對它們客氣點。"
L["A hedge you can wear, {name}. Neatly trimmed; I'm not a barbarian."] = "可以穿的樹籬，{name}。修剪整齊，我可不是野蠻人。"
L["Nature never turns the other cheek, {name}. It grows spikes on it."] = "大自然從不以德報怨，{name}。它以刺還牙。"
L["Raptors learn slowly, {name}. This teaches them one bite at a time."] = "迅猛龍學得慢，{name}。這個一口一口教牠。"
L["Prickly on the outside, {name}. What's inside is your own business."] = "外表帶刺了，{name}。內心軟不軟，隨你。"
L["Mind your cloak, {name}. Wool and brambles never did get along."] = "小心你的披風，{name}。羊毛和荊棘向來不合。"
L["Blessing of Kings, {name}. No crown, no throne, no taxes owed."] = "王者祝福，{name}。無冠無座，也免繳稅。"
L["Long may you reign, {name}. For the next while, anyway."] = "吾王萬歲，{name}。呃，一陣子吧。"
L["A little more of everything, {name}. Kings never did settle for less."] = "樣樣都多一點，{name}。王者從不將就。"
L["A king's blessing, {name}. Worn by better heads than mine, and some worse."] = "王者祝福，{name}。戴過的頭有比我好，也有更糟。"
L["Every strength a little higher, {name}. Kings like to hedge their bets."] = "每項能力都高一點，{name}。王者喜歡分散風險。"
L["Crown not included, {name}. Everything else is, a little."] = "不附王冠，{name}。其他的都附一點。"
L["All of you, only more so, {name}. Wear it well."] = "你還是你，只是樣樣更出色，{name}。好好享用。"
L["A blessing fit for royalty, {name}. You'll have to do your own waving."] = "配得上王室的祝福，{name}。揮手致意得自己來。"
L["Stronger, cleverer, hardier, {name}. Kings had advisers for that; you have me."] = "更強更聰明更耐打，{name}。國王有大臣，你有我。"
L["Royal treatment, {name}, minus the courtiers and the poisoned wine."] = "王室待遇，{name}，但不附馬屁精和毒酒。"
L["Might doesn't make right, {name}, but it does help the argument."] = "拳頭大不等於有理，{name}，但講道理時很好用。"
L["A firmer swing for you, {name}. The Light loves a good follow-through."] = "揮得更有力，{name}。聖光最欣賞揮到底的人。"
L["Stronger arms, {name}. Kindly point them at something that deserves it."] = "手臂更有力了，{name}。請對準真正該打的東西。"
L["Blessing of Might, {name}. It'll surprise you. It'll surprise them far more."] = "力量祝福，{name}。你會嚇一跳，他們會嚇更大跳。"
L["Swing away, {name}. The Light will take the credit if it goes well."] = "盡情揮吧，{name}。打得好的話，功勞歸聖光。"
L["Hit harder, {name}. Them, I mean. Not me. Never the paladin."] = "用力打他們，{name}。別打我，聖騎士打不得。"
L["More weight behind every swing, {name}. The Light calls it conviction."] = "每一揮都更有份量，{name}。聖光稱之為信念。"
L["Doors, crates and ogres will all give way easier now, {name}."] = "門、木箱和食人魔，現在都更容易被撞開了，{name}。"
L["Your weapon will feel lighter, {name}. It isn't. You're just holier."] = "武器感覺變輕了，{name}。並沒有，是你變神聖了。"
L["The Light's own elbow grease, {name}. Put it somewhere useful."] = "聖光出的力氣，{name}。用在刀口上。"
L["Wisdom for you, {name}. I kept a little back for myself. Very little."] = "智慧給你，{name}。我自己留了一點。很少一點。"
L["Wisdom for your mana, {name}. The other kind still comes from bad decisions."] = "給法力的智慧，{name}。另一種還得靠做錯事換。"
L["Your mana creeps back on its own now, {name}, like a cat that's forgiven you."] = "法力會自己慢慢回來，{name}，像原諒你的貓。"
L["Fewer sips between fights, {name}. The innkeepers will be heartbroken."] = "戰鬥間少喝幾口，{name}。旅店老闆要心碎了。"
L["Drink less, cast more, {name}. The Light's own budget advice."] = "少喝水，多施法，{name}。聖光的理財建議。"
L["Blessing of Wisdom, {name}: the one blessing that pays for itself."] = "智慧祝福，{name}：唯一能自己回本的祝福。"
L["A steadier well to draw from, {name}. Draw deep."] = "一口更不易乾的井，{name}。盡情汲取。"
L["Wisdom usually comes with age, {name}. This comes with a paladin. Quicker."] = "智慧通常靠年紀，{name}。這個靠聖騎士，快多了。"
L["May you know when to fight and when to sit down, {name}."] = "願你知道何時該戰、何時該坐下，{name}。"
L["A wise blessing for a wise choice, {name}: keeping a paladin around."] = "明智的選擇配明智的祝福，{name}：身邊帶個聖騎士。"
L["A blessing of quiet, {name}. Monsters will forget whose fault it was."] = "安靜的祝福，{name}。怪物會忘記是誰惹的禍。"
L["Blessing of Salvation, {name}. You are now somebody else's problem."] = "拯救祝福，{name}。你現在是別人的問題了。"
L["Saved, {name}. Not your soul, mind. Just your hide."] = "得救了，{name}。不是靈魂，是你這身皮。"
L["Hit hard, {name}. If anything turns round, look innocent. The Light will."] = "用力打，{name}。有東西回頭就裝無辜。聖光也會。"
L["The monsters will find you forgettable now, {name}. Today, that's a compliment."] = "怪物會覺得你路人臉，{name}。今天這是稱讚。"
L["Go on, hit it, {name}. It'll blame whoever's wearing the most plate."] = "儘管打，{name}。黑鍋讓穿最厚鎧甲的背。"
L["The art of being in the fight, {name}, and out of the argument."] = "參戰有份，仇恨沒份，{name}。這是門藝術。"
L["The Light's kindest alibi, {name}. Use it often."] = "聖光最貼心的不在場證明，{name}。多多利用。"
L["The Light will find you easier now, {name}. Try not to squint."] = "聖光現在更容易找到你了，{name}。別瞇眼。"
L["Holy Light lands harder on you now, {name}. Please don't make me prove it."] = "聖光術對你更有效了，{name}。別逼我證明。"
L["You'll heal easier, {name}. The Light appreciates a willing patient."] = "你更好治了，{name}。聖光喜歡配合的病人。"
L["Blessing of Light, {name}. Saving you is simpler now. Not that you'll need it."] = "光明祝福，{name}。救你更簡單了，雖然你用不到。"
L["The Light knows the way to you now, {name}. Let's keep its visits social."] = "聖光認得去你家的路了，{name}。最好只是來串門子。"
L["A blessing that makes my job easier, {name}. Generous and lazy all at once."] = "讓我工作更輕鬆的祝福，{name}。既大方又偷懶。"
L["Holy Light fits you better now, {name}, like a well-cut tabard."] = "聖光術更合身了，{name}，像量身訂做的外袍。"
L["Mending you just got cheaper, {name}. Not that I'd ever send a bill."] = "治你更省錢了，{name}。雖然我從不寄帳單。"
L["Block a blow now, {name}, and the Light hits back for you. It's petty."] = "格擋一下，{name}，聖光就替你回敬。它很記仇。"
L["Every blow lands softer now, {name}. Complaints go to the Light."] = "每一擊都變輕了，{name}。有意見找聖光。"
L["All the shelter of a temple, {name}, and none of the roof repairs."] = "神殿般的庇護，{name}，還不用修屋頂。"
L["Claim sanctuary, {name}. It's easier when you bring your own."] = "尋求庇護吧，{name}。自備的比較方便。"
L["Every blow is a little less rude now, {name}. The Light teaches manners."] = "每一擊都客氣多了，{name}。聖光有在教禮貌。"
L["Nobody can evict you from this sanctuary, {name}. I checked the deeds."] = "沒人能把你趕出這座庇護所，{name}。我查過地契了。"
L["An ogre's club lands like a pillow now, {name}. A heavy, angry pillow."] = "食人魔的棍棒軟如枕頭，{name}。又重又火大的那種。"
L["Instructions, {name}: hit things harder. There is no page two."] = "說明書，{name}：用力打。沒有第二頁。"
L["Your sword arm is sorted, {name}. For the rest of you, see a priest."] = "持劍的手搞定了，{name}。其他部位請找牧師。"
L["Battle Shout, {name}. Not a spell, really. A strongly worded suggestion."] = "戰鬥怒吼，{name}。不算法術，算措辭強烈的建議。"
L["RAAAGH! That one was for you, {name}. Everyone else just overheard."] = "吼啊啊啊！這聲給你的，{name}。其他人只是旁聽。"
L["Priests pray, mages study, {name}. I clear my throat."] = "牧師禱告，法師讀書，{name}。我清清喉嚨。"
L["Words matter, {name}. Mostly the loud ones."] = "言語有力量，{name}。尤其是大聲的。"
L["The shout lasts a few minutes, {name}. The ringing in your ears, rather longer."] = "怒吼持續幾分鐘，{name}。你的耳鳴會更久。"
L["There were words in that shout once, {name}. They slowed it down."] = "這聲吼原本有台詞，{name}。嫌太慢就刪了。"
L["A little breath from the damned, {name}. They weren't using it."] = "向亡者借了口氣，{name}。反正他們用不到。"
L["Unending Breath, {name}. The fish will have so many questions."] = "無盡呼吸，{name}。魚會有一堆問題想問。"
L["Stay down as long as you like, {name}. The air's on me."] = "想潛多久都行，{name}。空氣算我的。"
L["Swim deep, {name}. If a murloc asks, you're only visiting."] = "潛深點，{name}。魚人問起，就說只是來玩。"
L["Air from a place where air isn't strictly air, {name}. Breathe it anyway."] = "這口氣來自空氣不太像空氣的地方，{name}。照吸吧。"
L["The Vile Reef awaits, {name}. Try not to find out how it earned the name."] = "惡名昭彰的礁區在等你，{name}。別親身查證原因。"
L["Dropped something in a lake, {name}? Now's your chance."] = "東西掉湖裡了，{name}？自己下去撈，別等湖中女神。"
L["No gills, {name}. I read the small print; gills were extra."] = "沒附鰓，{name}。契約細則寫了，鰓另計。"
L["Folk will think we're duelling, {name}. Thanks for the {gift}."] = "旁人以為我們在決鬥，{name}。謝謝你的{gift}。"
L["{gift} for {buff}. No auctioneer's cut, {name}."] = "{gift}換{buff}，{name}。拍賣場不抽成。"
L["Beaten to it, {name}! Your {gift} was quicker than my manners."] = "被你搶先了，{name}！你的{gift}比我的禮貌快。"
L["{gift} in, {buff} out. Finest economy in all Azeroth."] = "{gift}進，{buff}出。艾澤拉斯最棒的經濟。"
L["{gift}, for me? All I have is this, {name}, but it's heartfelt."] = "{gift}給我？我只有這個，{name}，但是真心的。"
L["Your {gift} fits perfectly, {name}. Did you measure me?"] = "你的{gift}超合身，{name}。你偷量過我尺寸？"
L["A treaty in spells, {name}: {gift} for {buff}."] = "以法術締約，{name}：{gift}換{buff}。"
L["{gift}! I feel taller already. Have some {buff}."] = "{gift}！我感覺長高了。回你{buff}。"
L["I was about to ask for {gift}, {name}. You read my mind."] = "我正想要{gift}，{name}。你會讀心嗎？"
L["Your {gift} still fizzes, {name}. Here's some fizz back."] = "你的{gift}還滋滋響，{name}。回你一點滋滋。"
L["Such a kind {gift}, {name}. I'll tell the whole inn. Twice."] = "好貼心的{gift}，{name}。我要跟全旅店講兩遍。"
L["You cast {gift} first, {name}? My mother would despair of me."] = "你先放了{gift}，{name}？我媽會對我很失望。"
L["I'll remember your {gift} fondly, {name}. Until it wears off."] = "你的{gift}我會好好記住，{name}。直到它消失。"
L["{gift} for {buff}, free. Somewhere, a goblin weeps."] = "{gift}換{buff}，免費。有個哥布林哭了。"
L["Your {gift}, my {buff}. We'll be unbearable now."] = "你的{gift}，我的{buff}。我們強到欠揍了。"
L["Thanks for the {gift}, {name}. I'll earn it before it fades."] = "謝謝你的{gift}，{name}。消失前我會對得起它。"
L["For {gift} I'd hand you both moons, {name}. This'll have to do."] = "為了{gift}，兩個月亮都給你，{name}。先收這個。"
L["You brought {gift}, I brought {buff}. Now it's a party."] = "你帶{gift}，我帶{buff}。這下成派對了。"
L["{gift} means 'good luck'. {buff} means 'you too'."] = "{gift}代表「祝好運」；{buff}代表「彼此彼此」。"
L["Your {gift} came first; my {buff} tries twice as hard."] = "你的{gift}先到；我的{buff}只好加倍賣力。"
L["If anyone asks, {buff} came before {gift}. Deal?"] = "有人問起，就說{buff}比{gift}先到。一言為定？"
L["{gift} made my day; {buff} should make your hour."] = "{gift}讓我樂一整天；{buff}讓你樂一小時。"
L["Saved my {buff} for someone worthy. Then came {gift}."] = "{buff}本來留給配得上的人。結果{gift}來了。"
L["Your {gift} went to my head; my {buff} goes to yours."] = "你的{gift}讓我飄飄然，我的{buff}換你飄。"
L["{gift} on me, {buff} on you. We wear each other's work."] = "我穿你的{gift}，你穿我的{buff}。活像情侶裝。"
L["{gift} and {buff} fade. Kindness lasts. Well, longer."] = "{gift}和{buff}會消失，善意會留下。呃，留久一點。"
L["You shared {gift}; I share {buff}. Ale's next."] = "你分享{gift}，我分享{buff}。下次換麥酒。"
L["{gift} caught me empty-handed. Not any more: {buff}."] = "{gift}來時我兩手空空。現在不同了：{buff}。"
L["{gift}, best thing all day. {buff}, my bid for second."] = "{gift}，今天最棒的事。{buff}，我來爭第二。"
L["{gift} deserves a statue. I'm no sculptor, so: {buff}."] = "{gift}該立銅像表揚。我不會雕，只好回{buff}。"
L["{gift} for {buff}? Keep this up and we'll draw a queue."] = "{gift}換{buff}？再這樣下去要變排隊名店了。"
L["{gift} was kind. {buff} is kind back, and competitive."] = "{gift}很貼心。{buff}也很貼心，而且不服輸。"
L["{gift} came like good news. {buff}, by return post."] = "{gift}像捷報傳來。{buff}，限時專送回覆。"
L["{gift}, meet {buff}. Do get along, you two."] = "{gift}，這位是{buff}。你們倆好好相處。"
L["Trade you {buff} for {gift}? Ah, you've already paid."] = "用{buff}換你的{gift}？啊，你已經先付了。"
L["{gift} and {buff}. The inn will say we rehearsed."] = "{gift}加{buff}。旅店的人會說我們套好招。"
L["{gift}! I just had three clever thoughts, {name}. This was one."] = "{gift}！我剛有三個聰明念頭，{name}。這是其一。"
L["With {gift}, {name}, I finally understand my own notes. Thanks."] = "有了{gift}，{name}，終於看懂我的筆記了。謝啦。"
L["Cleverer already, {name}. Clever enough to know I owe you one. Here."] = "變聰明了，{name}。聰明到知道欠你一份。拿去。"
L["Your {gift} found me the word for this, {name}: 'thanks'."] = "你的{gift}讓我找到最貼切的詞，{name}：「謝謝」。"
L["{gift}! I understood a goblin contract, {name}. I'm appalled."] = "{gift}！我看懂哥布林合約了，{name}。細思極恐。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My thoughts are lining up politely."] = "謝謝，{name}。我的思緒都乖乖排好隊了。"
L["I'll use your {gift} for more than arguing, {name}. Probably."] = "你的{gift}我不會只拿來抬槓，{name}。大概吧。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My next spell gets three extra syllables, just to show off."] = "謝謝你，{name}。下個法術我要多唸三個字，純炫耀。"
L["{gift}, {name}? I'll stand at the front for once. Briefly."] = "{gift}，{name}？那我難得站前面。一下下。"
L["Knees, elbows and pride, {name}: all fortified. Thank you."] = "膝蓋、手肘和自尊，{name}：全強化了。謝謝。"
L["Hit me now, {name}. Actually, don't. But thank you; I'd survive it."] = "打我試試，{name}。算了別打。但謝了，我撐得住。"
L["Nigh unbreakable now, {name}. Let's never test the 'nigh'. Thank you."] = "幾乎打不壞了，{name}。「幾乎」就別測了。謝謝。"
L["{gift}! My healer owes you a letter, {name}. I owe you this."] = "{gift}！補師該寫感謝函給你，{name}。我先回這個。"
L["Every bruise I don't get today, {name}, I owe to your {gift}."] = "今天少掉的每塊瘀青，{name}，都要感謝你的{gift}。"
L["I could lose an argument with an ogre now and live, {name}. Thank you."] = "現在跟食人魔吵輸了也死不了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I feel like a castle wall. A grateful one."] = "謝謝，{name}。我像座城牆了。心存感激的那種。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The next boar to charge me is in for a long afternoon."] = "謝謝，{name}。下一頭衝我的野豬，有得忙一下午了。"
L["{gift}! I feel ten years younger, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！我覺得年輕了十歲，{name}。謝謝。"
L["I feel twice as calm and half as grumpy, {name}. Thank you."] = "我平靜了一倍，暴躁少了一半，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Your {gift} nearly made me sing, {name}. Take this. It's kinder."] = "你的{gift}害我差點高歌，{name}。回你這個，比較不擾民。"
L["{gift}, {name}? I've forgiven three people already. Thank you."] = "{gift}，{name}？我已經原諒三個人了。謝謝。"
L["I was on fumes, {name}. Your {gift} was a hot meal and a hearth."] = "我快見底了，{name}。你的{gift}像熱飯配暖爐。"
L["I've stopped counting mana between fights, {name}. Thank you."] = "戰鬥間我不用再數法力了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["My spirit's topped up, {name}, and the rest of me is grateful too."] = "精神加滿了，{name}，其他部位也很感激。"
L["Shadow-proof, thanks to you, {name}. The whispers are furious."] = "托你的福不怕暗影了，{name}。低語們氣炸了。"
L["Nothing dark gets in now, {name}. Here's something bright going the other way."] = "黑暗進不來了，{name}。這點光亮往你那邊送。"
L["{gift}! Shadowfang Keep can keep its shadows, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！影牙城堡的影子自己留著吧，{name}。謝謝。"
L["The next shadow bolt's in for a letdown, {name}. Thank you."] = "下一發暗影箭要失望了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["On your {gift} I'll brave Duskwood tonight, {name}. Or tomorrow."] = "靠你的{gift}，我今晚就闖暮色森林，{name}。或明天。"
L["{gift}! A squirrel just nodded at me, {name}. Here's yours."] = "{gift}！有松鼠對我點頭，{name}。這份給你。"
L["Tougher hide, sharper senses, {name}. I may have to fight the urge to forage."] = "皮更厚，感官更敏銳，{name}。我得忍住別去覓食。"
L["I feel all wild and leafy, {name}. Thank you. Sorry if I shed bark."] = "我覺得又野又長葉，{name}。謝謝，掉樹皮請見諒。"
L["Thicker skin from your {gift}, {name}. Arrows and insults both."] = "你的{gift}讓我皮更厚了，{name}。箭和酸話都不怕。"
L["{gift}! A bird tried to nest on me, {name}. Thanks, I think."] = "{gift}！有鳥想在我頭上築巢，{name}。謝謝……吧。"
L["Thanks for the {gift}, {name}. The woods feel like home now."] = "謝謝你的{gift}，{name}。現在森林都像家了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I've an urge to stand in the rain and grow. I'll resist."] = "謝謝，{name}。好想站在雨裡長高。我會忍住。"
L["Every bramble in the Barrens will think twice now, {name}. Thank you."] = "貧瘠之地的荊棘現在都得三思了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Rain, cold and wolves: let them all try."] = "謝謝，{name}。雨、冷、狼群：儘管放馬過來。"
L["{gift}, {name}! Nobody's hugging me today. Have this instead."] = "{gift}，{name}！今天沒人敢抱我。用這個代替。"
L["Prickly now, thanks to you, {name}. More than usual, I mean."] = "多虧你，我渾身帶刺，{name}。比平常更刺。"
L["Your {gift}, {name}! Let the next kobold try for my candle."] = "你的{gift}，{name}！下個狗頭人敢來搶我蠟燭試試。"
L["{gift}! I'm a thicket with opinions now, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！我成了很有意見的荊棘叢，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The next thing that bites me will need a moment to reflect."] = "謝謝，{name}。下個咬我的會被反傷，順便反省。"
L["{gift} from you, {name}? I'll try not to found a dynasty."] = "你給的{gift}，{name}？我盡量不去開創王朝。"
L["A little better at everything, {name}. Is this how kings feel? No wonder."] = "樣樣都強了點，{name}。當國王是這種感覺？難怪。"
L["Your {gift}! My first decree, {name}: thank you."] = "你的{gift}！朕的第一道聖旨，{name}：謝謝。"
L["{gift} on a commoner, {name}? I'll try to look regal."] = "把{gift}給一介平民，{name}？我盡量裝得有王者風範。"
L["With your {gift} I could rule a small kingdom, {name}. Westfall."] = "靠你的{gift}，我能治理小王國了，{name}。西部荒野那種。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Every bit of me is grateful, and they rarely agree."] = "謝謝，{name}。我全身上下都在感謝，它們難得意見一致。"
L["Stronger arms already, {name}. I'll try not to hug anyone. Thank you."] = "手臂更有力了，{name}。我盡量不抱人。謝謝。"
L["With {gift} I could lift a kodo, {name}. I won't, but thank you."] = "有了{gift}，科多獸都舉得起，{name}。謝了。"
L["Your {gift} has my arms very confident, {name}. Thank you."] = "你的{gift}讓我的二頭肌自信爆棚，{name}。謝謝。"
L["{gift}! Opened a jar I've fought since Stranglethorn, {name}."] = "{gift}！從荊棘谷奮戰至今的罐子，終於開了，{name}。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My next swing is dedicated to you. So is the dent."] = "謝謝，{name}。下一擊獻給你，那個凹痕也是。"
L["{gift} from you, {name}, and my first wise act is this."] = "{gift}到手，{name}。第一個明智之舉：這個。"
L["Wiser already, {name}. Wise enough to know a kindness when I see one."] = "更有智慧了，{name}。足以認出什麼是好意。"
L["My mana thanks you for {gift}, {name}. It's the shy one of us."] = "我的法力謝謝你的{gift}，{name}。它是我身上最害羞的。"
L["Your {gift} refills me faster than I spend, {name}. Nearly."] = "你的{gift}回得比我花得快，{name}。差不多啦。"
L["Your {gift}, {name}: mana back, and an urge to give advice."] = "你的{gift}，{name}：法力回來了，還變得好為人師。"
L["{gift}! The monsters forgot me at once, {name}. I won't."] = "{gift}！怪物馬上忘了我，{name}。我可不會。"
L["Nothing wants to fight me now, {name}. It's lovely. Thank you."] = "現在誰都不想跟我打，{name}。真美好。謝謝。"
L["{gift}! Nothing's glared at me in minutes, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！好幾分鐘沒東西瞪我了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["{gift}! A mouse at a dragon's feast, {name}: unseen, well fed."] = "{gift}！像龍宴上的老鼠，{name}：沒人發現，吃得飽飽。"
L["Thanks to {gift} I'm just a rumour in a fight, {name}."] = "多虧{gift}，我在戰場上只是個傳聞，{name}。"
L["The Light finds me easier now, {name}. I'll try to deserve it."] = "聖光更容易找到我了，{name}。我會努力配得上。"
L["Easier to heal now, {name}. Whoever patches me up thanks you too."] = "我更好治了，{name}。幫我包紮的人也謝謝你。"
L["With your {gift}, {name}, mending feels like coming home."] = "有了你的{gift}，{name}，被治療就像回家。"
L["{gift}! The Light and I are on first-name terms now, {name}."] = "{gift}！我跟聖光都稱兄道弟了，{name}。"
L["With {gift} the Light hears me first, {name}. No need to shout."] = "有了{gift}，聖光先聽到我，{name}。不用大喊。"
L["Blows land softer on me now, {name}. My bruises thank you, and so do I."] = "挨打變輕了，{name}。我的瘀青謝謝你，我也是。"
L["Every hit gentler, thanks to you, {name}. I'll make sure they notice."] = "多虧你，每擊都溫柔了，{name}。我會讓他們知道。"
L["Your {gift} softens every blow, {name}. I'm upholstered."] = "你的{gift}讓每一擊都變軟，{name}。我成了沙發。"
L["{gift}! Now the Light takes every hit personally, {name}."] = "{gift}！打我一下，聖光都當私人恩怨，{name}。"
L["With your {gift} I'm half fortress, half chapel, {name}."] = "有了你的{gift}，我半是堡壘，半是禮拜堂，{name}。"
L["You shouted at me, {name}, and I've never felt so encouraged. Here."] = "你對我吼，{name}，我從沒這麼受鼓舞過。拿去。"
L["My ears are ringing, {name}, and my arms feel twice as strong. Thank you!"] = "我耳朵在嗡嗡叫，{name}，手臂卻強了一倍。謝謝！"
L["{gift}, {name}! I felt that in my teeth. In a good way."] = "{gift}，{name}！我的牙都在震。好的那種。"
L["I'll answer your {gift} quietly, {name}. Somebody should."] = "你的{gift}，我小聲回應，{name}。總得有人安靜點。"
L["Your {gift} nearly had me charging a wall, {name}. Here, calmly."] = "你的{gift}害我差點衝鋒撞牆，{name}。來，冷靜地回你。"
L["All Azeroth heard your {gift}, {name}. Thank you for my share."] = "整個艾澤拉斯都聽到你的{gift}，{name}。謝謝分我一份。"
L["That shout put iron in my spine, {name}. Thank you."] = "那一吼讓我腰桿都硬了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["I didn't catch the words, {name}, but my arms did. Thank you!"] = "吼什麼我沒聽清，{name}，但手臂聽懂了。謝謝！"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll hit the next thing twice as hard and blame you."] = "謝謝，{name}。下個敵人我會加倍用力打，再賴給你。"
L["I can breathe underwater, {name}! I may never need to, but thank you."] = "我能在水下呼吸了，{name}！可能用不到，但謝謝。"
L["Lungs like a murloc, thanks to you, {name}. I'll try not to gurgle."] = "多虧你，肺像魚人了，{name}。我盡量不咕嚕。"
L["With {gift} I'll raid every sunken wreck, {name}. Half's yours."] = "有了{gift}，每艘沉船我都要搜刮，{name}。分你一半。"
L["I won't ask where {gift} gets its air, {name}. Just: thanks."] = "{gift}的空氣哪來的我不問，{name}。只說：謝謝。"
L["With {gift} I'll cross Lordamere Lake, {name}. Underneath."] = "有了{gift}，我要橫渡洛丹米爾湖，{name}。從湖底。"
L["We have to stop meeting like this, {name}. Actually, no, we don't."] = "我們不能再這樣見面了，{name}。不對，當然可以。"
L["Again, {name}? Splendid. I've been practising since last time."] = "再來一次，{name}？太好了，上次後我練過了。"
L["You again, {name}? People will start saying we're friends."] = "又是你，{name}？別人會開始說我們是朋友了。"
L["Same face, same spell, {name}. I do love a tradition."] = "同一張臉，同一個法術，{name}。我就愛傳統。"
L["Another round, {name}? I'm keeping score, and we're both winning."] = "再來一輪，{name}？我有在計分，我們都贏。"
L["Ah, {name}! My favourite repeat customer."] = "啊，{name}！我最愛的回頭客。"
L["Our paths keep crossing, {name}. I think the road is dropping hints."] = "我們的路老是交會，{name}。這條路在暗示什麼。"
L["Once more, {name}. Do stop me if you've heard this one."] = "再來一次，{name}。這句聽過就打斷我。"
L["I kept some aside, {name}, in case you came back. Good instinct, mine."] = "我留了一份，{name}，就怕你回來。我直覺真準。"
L["Back already, {name}? The day's improving."] = "又回來啦，{name}？今天越來越好了。"
L["Again, {name}? At this rate I'll have to learn your middle name."] = "又是你，{name}？再這樣我得背你的族譜了。"
L["Once is kindness, twice is a habit, {name}. I've never broken a habit yet."] = "一回生二回熟，{name}。三回就戒不掉了。"
L["An encore, {name}, for my most faithful audience."] = "再來一曲，{name}，獻給我最忠實的觀眾。"
L["One more of these, {name}, and we'll have to draw up a guild charter."] = "再來一次，{name}，我們就得創個公會了。"
L["I'll remember your face now, {name}, and I'm terrible with faces."] = "這下我記住你的臉了，{name}，我可是最不會認臉的。"
L["Us again, {name}. The world must be running out of other people."] = "又是我們，{name}。世界上的其他人大概用完了。"
L["Last time went so well, {name}, I've changed nothing."] = "上次很順，{name}，所以我什麼都沒改。"
L["Good to see someone I know, {name}. They're rarer than you'd think."] = "見到熟人真好，{name}。熟人比你想的少。"
L["Oh, it's you, {name}. Good. I hate giving these to strangers."] = "啊，是你，{name}。很好，我不愛給陌生人這個。"
L["{name}, at this point we should just share a reagent pouch."] = "{name}，都這樣了，乾脆共用材料袋吧。"
L["Same time tomorrow, {name}? I'll bring {buff}. You bring you."] = "明天老時間，{name}？我帶{buff}，你帶你自己。"
L["I've lost count, {name}, and I've decided that's a compliment."] = "數不清幾次了，{name}。我決定當成讚美。"
L["Keep this up, {name}, and the bards will write a very dull song about us."] = "再這樣下去，{name}，吟遊詩人要寫首悶歌了。"
L["I could do this one in my sleep by now, {name}. I may have."] = "我睡著都能做了，{name}。說不定剛才就是。"
L["The usual, {name}? Of course the usual."] = "老樣子，{name}？當然老樣子。"
L["We ought to have a secret handshake by now, {name}. Next time, perhaps."] = "我們該有個祕密握手暗號了，{name}。下次吧。"
L["By now, {name}, I think we've built a small economy between us."] = "到現在，{name}，我們都自成一個小經濟體了。"
L["Old friends by now, {name}. Well, old acquaintances with excellent timing."] = "算老朋友了，{name}。呃，時機很準的老相識。"
L["Let the record show: {name} and I, undefeated at being prepared."] = "記錄在案：{name}與我，有備而來，從未落敗。"
L["My spellbook opens to your page on its own now, {name}."] = "我的法術書現在會自己翻到你那頁了，{name}。"
L["If you stopped turning up, {name}, I'd report you missing to the guards."] = "你要是不出現了，{name}，我會去找衛兵報失蹤。"
L["We keep this up, {name}, and one of us owes the other a drink."] = "再這樣下去，{name}，我們總有一個得請對方喝一杯。"
L["We're a local landmark now, {name}. Travellers give directions by us."] = "我們成了地標了，{name}。旅人都用我們指路。"
L["Regular as the tides, {name}, and twice as welcome."] = "像潮汐一樣準時，{name}，還加倍受歡迎。"
L["I'd trust you with my last potion, {name}. That's saying something."] = "最後一瓶藥水我都敢交給你，{name}。這話很重。"
L["Next time, {name}, we share a fire and you tell me where you're bound."] = "下次，{name}，我們圍著營火，你說說要去哪。"
L["I'd miss this if it stopped, {name}. So let's not stop."] = "要是停了我會想念的，{name}。所以別停。"
L["There's nobody I'd rather keep running into, {name}."] = "要說老是遇見誰，{name}，我最希望是你。"
L["You always turn up at the right moment, {name}."] = "你總是來得正是時候，{name}。"
L["Safe walls, warm beds, and now {buff}. You're spoiled, {name}."] = "高牆暖床，還有{buff}。{name}，你被寵壞了。"
L["The guards have it covered, {name}, but I like to be thorough."] = "衛兵都顧著呢，{name}，但我喜歡周到一點。"
L["Careful, {name}. Look this capable in town and folk will ask you favours."] = "小心，{name}。在城裡這麼能幹，會有人找你幫忙。"
L["Not a monster for miles, {name}. Still, one never knows about the cooking."] = "方圓幾里沒怪物，{name}。不過這裡的菜就難說了。"
L["For the crowds, {name}. In town, they're the real danger."] = "防人潮用的，{name}。城裡最危險的就是人潮。"
L["Rest easy, {name}. I'll count that my good deed and go find a pint."] = "安心休息，{name}。今日一善完成，我去喝一杯。"
L["Even in town, {name}, a dragon has been known to drop in. Better safe."] = "就算在城裡，{name}，也有龍來訪過。小心為上。"
L["Best do it in here, {name}. Out there, nobody stands still long enough."] = "最好在這弄，{name}。到外面，沒人肯站著不動。"
L["Mind the pickpockets, {name}. This is the one thing on you they can't lift."] = "小心扒手，{name}。你身上只有這個他們偷不走。"
L["City rules, {name}: no blades drawn, no spells thrown. This one's allowed."] = "城裡規矩，{name}：不准拔刀，不准施法。這個例外。"
L["Nothing to fight here but stray cats, {name}. Take this anyway."] = "這裡除了野貓沒什麼好打，{name}。還是拿著吧。"
L["For the walk to the bank, {name}. It's always further than it looks."] = "去銀行的路上用，{name}。那段路總比看起來遠。"
L["Enjoy a warm hearth while you can, {name}. The road's never far."] = "趁現在享受溫暖爐火吧，{name}。上路的日子不遠。"
L["The watch has the walls, {name}. I'll see to you."] = "城牆有守衛看著，{name}。你歸我照應。"
L["For the stairs, {name}. Whoever built this place never met a short way up."] = "爬樓梯用的，{name}。蓋這裡的人沒聽過捷徑。"
L["Everything else in town has a price, {name}. This slipped past the merchants."] = "城裡什麼都要錢，{name}。這個是商人漏掉的。"
L["Buy nothing from anyone who calls you 'friend', {name}. Except me."] = "別跟叫你「朋友」的人買東西，{name}。我除外。"
L["Out here everything wants to eat you, {name}. Now it'll need a bigger fork."] = "這裡什麼都想吃你，{name}。現在得換把大叉子了。"
L["No guards for miles, {name}, and the boars know it. Take this."] = "方圓幾里沒衛兵，{name}，野豬都知道。拿著。"
L["Nobody out here but us and the wildlife, {name}. Let's be the tougher half."] = "這裡只有我們和野獸，{name}。我們當兇的那半。"
L["If a bear asks, {name}, you were like this when I found you."] = "熊要是問，{name}，就說我撿到你時就這樣。"
L["The wolves have been eyeing you, {name}. This should give them pause."] = "狼一直在盯著你，{name}。這下牠們得三思了。"
L["Wild country, {name}. Best not to meet it armed with good intentions alone."] = "荒郊野外，{name}。光靠一片好心可應付不來。"
L["Map, canteen, {buff}. Now you can get lost properly, {name}."] = "地圖、水壺、{buff}。{name}，可以好好迷路了。"
L["Camp's a long way off, {name}. Consider this a roof you can carry."] = "營地還很遠，{name}。這就當隨身帶的屋頂。"
L["Out past the last farm, {name}, you're on your own. Nearly."] = "過了最後一座農場，{name}，就只能靠自己了。差不多。"
L["Nearest inn's a day's walk, {name}. The nearest thing with teeth is closer."] = "最近的旅店要走一天，{name}。會咬人的東西近得多。"
L["Two hills and a swamp to the next town, {name}. The swamp has opinions."] = "下個鎮隔兩座山一片沼澤，{name}。沼澤很有意見。"
L["Camp carefully, {name}. Every nice clearing has an owner, and it has claws."] = "小心紮營，{name}。每塊好空地都有主人，還有爪子。"
L["Fresh air, open sky, {name}. Enjoy it while nothing's chasing you."] = "空氣清新、天空遼闊，{name}。趁沒東西追你，好好享受。"
L["Something's following you, {name}. Probably a boar. This is in case it isn't."] = "有東西跟著你，{name}。大概是野豬。這是以防萬一。"
L["Stay on the road, {name}. The road has guards. Some of the time."] = "走大路，{name}。大路有衛兵。偶爾有。"
L["Rain's coming, {name}, and so are the wolves. One of those I can help with."] = "雨和狼都快來了，{name}。狼歸我管，雨歸天管。"
L["Somewhere in here a villain is rehearsing a speech, {name}. Let's interrupt."] = "某處有反派在排練台詞，{name}。去打斷他。"
L["Whatever waits at the end of this place, {name}, let's make it regret it."] = "不管盡頭等著什麼，{name}，都讓它後悔。"
L["They say nobody leaves here alive, {name}. Let's be rude and prove them wrong."] = "聽說沒人能活著離開，{name}。我們去打臉他們。"
L["Our host had years to prepare, {name}. We have {buff}."] = "主人準備了好幾年，{name}。我們有{buff}。"
L["Nobody builds a dungeon with a back door, {name}. Take this instead."] = "沒人蓋地城會留後門，{name}。拿這個代替。"
L["Dark halls, old traps, worse tempers. At least you're ready, {name}."] = "暗廳、舊陷阱、壞脾氣，{name}。好在你準備好了。"
L["Better I hand you this now, {name}, than a eulogy later."] = "現在給你這個，{name}，總比日後念悼詞好。"
L["There's treasure in here, {name}, and something very large sat on it."] = "這裡有寶藏，{name}，上面坐著某個很大的東西。"
L["If a door slams shut behind us, {name}, that's tradition. Take this first."] = "門在身後砰地關上是老規矩，{name}。先拿著。"
L["Mind the patrols, {name}. They walk the same loop forever and resent it."] = "小心巡邏怪，{name}。繞同一圈繞到懷疑人生了。"
L["Whoever built this place, {name}, spent it all on skulls and nothing on lamps."] = "裝潢預算全砸在骷髏頭，{name}，燈一盞都沒買。"
L["The last lot through here were never seen again, {name}. They lacked this."] = "上一隊進來後就失蹤了，{name}。他們少了這個。"
L["Check the ceiling, {name}. In places like this, something always drops in."] = "注意天花板，{name}。這裡的訪客都從天而降。"
L["If we meet a talking skull, {name}, let me do the talking."] = "碰上會說話的骷髏，{name}，打嘴砲交給我。"
L["If the walls start whispering, {name}, don't answer. It only encourages them."] = "牆壁要是開始低語，{name}，已讀不回就好。"
L["Touch nothing that glows, pull nothing that clicks, {name}. Wear this."] = "發光的別摸，會喀一聲的別拉，{name}。拿著。"
L["Stick together in here, {name}. Echoes carry, and so do grudges."] = "跟緊點，{name}。回音傳得遠，仇恨也是。"
L["Flags, towers, graveyards, {name}. Whatever we're fighting over, take this."] = "搶旗、奪塔、占墓地，{name}。管他搶什麼，拿著。"
L["Win or lose, {name}, nobody will say you went in unprepared."] = "不論輸贏，{name}，沒人能說你沒準備。"
L["The graveyard's just over there, {name}. Let's both not visit it."] = "墓地就在那邊，{name}。我們都別去拜訪。"
L["Honour's on the line, {name}. So is the flag. Mostly the flag."] = "榮譽要緊，{name}。旗子也是。主要是旗子。"
L["Stay with the group, {name}. Lone heroes make short songs."] = "跟緊大家，{name}。落單的英雄，歌都很短。"
L["Our banner looks better with you under it, {name}. Stand tall."] = "旗子底下有你才好看，{name}。抬頭挺胸。"
L["Keep your head down and your colours up, {name}."] = "頭壓低，旗舉高，{name}。"
L["Hold the line, {name}. The songs are always about the ones who stood."] = "守住防線，{name}。歌裡傳頌的都是沒退的人。"
L["Come back in one piece, {name}. That's all I ask."] = "完完整整回來，{name}。我只要求這個。"
L["Drums are for courage, {name}. This is for everything else."] = "戰鼓是給勇氣的，{name}。其他的交給這個。"
L["Some fight for glory, {name}. I fight for whoever's beside me."] = "有人為榮耀而戰，{name}。我為身邊的人而戰。"
L["Fight for the banner, {name}, but come back for the singing. Mine's dreadful."] = "為旗而戰，{name}，記得回來慶功。我唱歌很難聽。"
L["Early bird, {name}? Here's something better than a worm."] = "早起的鳥兒，{name}？給你比蟲更好的東西。"
L["Good morning, {name}. Consider this your first cup of something strong."] = "早安，{name}。這就當你今天第一杯提神的。"
L["Early start, {name}. The day hasn't had a chance to go wrong yet."] = "起得真早，{name}。今天還沒機會出錯呢。"
L["Not even lunch yet, {name}, and you're already better prepared than I am."] = "還沒到午餐，{name}，你就比我準備得還周全了。"
L["Morning, {name}. Somewhere, the monsters are still yawning."] = "早，{name}。某處的怪物還在打呵欠。"
L["A fresh day and a fresh {buff}, {name}. Let's not waste either."] = "新的一天，新的{buff}，{name}。兩個都別浪費。"
L["Up with the sun, {name}? Show-off. Here; the sun doesn't get one."] = "跟太陽比早起，{name}？愛現。給你，太陽沒份。"
L["Rise and shine, {name}. The shining can wait till after breakfast."] = "起床囉，{name}。神采奕奕的部分，早餐後再說。"
L["Everything's golden and nobody's shouted yet, {name}. Let's enjoy it."] = "一切金光閃閃，還沒人大吼大叫，{name}。好好享受。"
L["Too early for heroics, {name}? Nonsense. Heroics go best before lunch."] = "太早當英雄，{name}？哪會。英雄就要午餐前當。"
L["The birds are singing, {name}. They haven't seen what's out there yet."] = "鳥在唱歌，{name}。牠們還沒看到外面有什麼。"
L["First good deed of the day, {name}. It's all downhill from here."] = "今天第一件好事，{name}。接下來就走下坡了。"
L["Still yawning, {name}? This works faster than tea."] = "還在打呵欠，{name}？這比茶還提神。"
L["Early, {name}. The dawn patrol looks at us like we've lost our minds."] = "好早，{name}。晨間巡邏兵看我們像看瘋子。"
L["Out this late, {name}? The night is hungrier than the day. Take this."] = "這麼晚還在外面，{name}？夜晚比白天更餓。拿著。"
L["Past bedtime, {name}. The sensible folk are asleep, which leaves us."] = "過了睡覺時間，{name}。正常人都睡了，剩我們。"
L["Can't sleep either, {name}? Then we may as well be useful."] = "你也睡不著，{name}？那不如做點有用的事。"
L["Mind the dark, {name}. Not everything out there is as friendly as I am."] = "小心黑暗，{name}。外頭不是誰都像我這麼友善。"
L["It's late, {name}. This should keep you going till the sun remembers us."] = "很晚了，{name}。這能撐到太陽想起我們。"
L["Only the owls and us awake, {name}, and the owls get no {buff}."] = "只有貓頭鷹和我們醒著，{name}，貓頭鷹沒{buff}。"
L["The inns have locked up, {name}. This is the only thing still being served."] = "旅店都打烊了，{name}。只剩我這攤還有營業。"
L["It's the hour for ghost stories, {name}. Take this, in case one is true."] = "鬼故事時間，{name}。拿著，萬一是真的呢。"
L["Candles low, stars high, {name}. A good hour for small kindnesses."] = "燭火將盡，星光正亮，{name}。適合做點小好事。"
L["Quiet hour, {name}. Every creak sounds like an ambush. Most of them aren't."] = "夜深了，{name}。每聲嘎吱都像埋伏，多半不是。"
L["This late, {name}, even the guards are talking to themselves."] = "這麼晚了，{name}，連衛兵都在自言自語。"
L["This is the hour things climb out of graves, {name}. Take this; walk briskly."] = "這時間墳裡會爬出東西，{name}。拿著，走快點。"
L["Tomorrow you'll wonder why you stayed up, {name}. This is one good reason."] = "明天你會納悶幹嘛熬夜，{name}。這算一個好理由。"
L["Takes one to know one, {name}. Takes one to do it properly, too."] = "同行才懂同行，{name}。也只有同行做得到位。"
L["From one of our trade to another, {name}. No need to check my work."] = "同行對同行，{name}。不用檢查我的手藝。"
L["Professional courtesy, {name}. We don't charge each other."] = "同業禮遇，{name}。自己人不收錢。"
L["Two of a kind, {name}. Between us we could write the manual."] = "同類相聚，{name}。我倆能合寫教學手冊了。"
L["Don't look so surprised, {name}. Same trainer, I expect."] = "別那麼驚訝，{name}。大概同一個訓練師教的。"
L["I'd critique your technique, {name}, but mine looks exactly the same."] = "本想挑你技術的毛病，{name}，但我的一模一樣。"
L["Don't tell the others, {name}, but ours really is the finest calling."] = "別跟別人說，{name}，我們這行真的最棒。"
L["Look at us, {name}. Two experts, making it look easy. It isn't, is it?"] = "看看我們，{name}，兩個專家好輕鬆。其實不然吧？"
L["Between colleagues, {name}: I also have no idea how half of it works."] = "同行說真的，{name}：技能說明我也只看懂一半。"
L["We walked the same road to get here, {name}. Good to meet another on it."] = "我們走同一條路來到這裡，{name}。很高興遇到同路人。"
L["If anyone asks, {name}, we trained each other."] = "有人問，{name}，就說我們互相當師父。"
L["Calling to calling, {name}. We should compare notes some time."] = "同道中人，{name}。哪天該交流一下心得。"
L["Colleague, {name}. We look after our own."] = "同行，{name}。自己人照顧自己人。"
L["Good to see the old craft in steady hands, {name}."] = "老手藝交到穩當的手裡，真好，{name}。"
L["I'd shout some encouragement, {name}, but you do that far better."] = "想吼幾聲鼓勵你，{name}，但你吼得比我好。"
L["Charge in as usual, {name}. I'll simply feel better about it now."] = "照常衝吧，{name}。我現在只是比較放心。"
L["For the one who goes in first, {name}. Somebody has to, and it's never me."] = "給第一個衝的人，{name}。總得有人衝，不會是我。"
L["You take the hits so the rest of us don't, {name}. It's the least I can do."] = "你替我們挨打，{name}。這是我至少能做的。"
L["Go on, {name}, charge. I'll be right behind you."] = "去吧，{name}，衝鋒。我就在你後面。"
L["For the one who fixes every problem by hitting it, {name}. It usually works."] = "君子動口，戰士動手，{name}。通常戰士比較有效。"
L["I'd shake your hand, {name}, but both of yours are holding something sharp."] = "想跟你握手，{name}，可惜你兩手都拿著刀。"
L["A little help for a lot of armour, {name}. I hope it fits under there."] = "一身板甲，{name}，希望這個還塞得進去。"
L["You'll charge something enormous soon, {name}. I'm just helping it lose."] = "你待會要衝鋒某個大傢伙，{name}。我只是幫它輸。"
L["Save your Light for later, {name}. This one's from me."] = "你的聖光先留著，{name}。這個是我給的。"
L["You bless everyone else all day, {name}. Here's one going the other way."] = "你整天祝福別人，{name}。這次換我祝福你。"
L["The Light already favours you, {name}. Here's a little more of it."] = "聖光已經眷顧你，{name}。再給你添一點。"
L["Even the Light's own champion needs a hand now and then, {name}."] = "就算是聖光的勇士，{name}，偶爾也需要幫一把。"
L["I'd ask for a blessing back, {name}, but then we'd be here all day."] = "本想跟你要個祝福，{name}，但這樣會互加到天黑。"
L["For the one who carries a hammer and a conscience, {name}. Heavy load."] = "錘子加良心，{name}，你背得可真重。"
L["Don't thank the Light for this one, {name}. This was me."] = "這個別謝聖光，{name}。是我給的。"
L["No need to kneel, {name}. I know it's a habit."] = "不用跪，{name}。我知道你習慣了。"
L["One for you, {name}, and a pat on the head for your companion."] = "一份給你，{name}，再摸摸你寵物的頭。"
L["You watch everyone's back from range, {name}. I've got yours."] = "你在遠處顧大家的背，{name}。你的背我來顧。"
L["Hunter's Mark for them, {buff} for you, {name}. Much nicer."] = "獵人印記給他們，{buff}給你，{name}。好多了。"
L["Aim true, {name}. And if it charges you anyway, run towards the rest of us."] = "瞄準點，{name}。它若還衝向你，就往我們這跑。"
L["Keen eye, steady hand, {name}. Here's something for the long hunt."] = "眼尖手穩，{name}。給你點東西，留著長途狩獵用。"
L["Nothing for the pet this time, {name}. It's already had three of my sandwiches."] = "寵物這次沒份，{name}。牠吃掉我三個三明治了。"
L["I'd have brought arrows, {name}, but I never know which kind you like."] = "本想帶箭給你，{name}，但我永遠搞不懂你愛哪種。"
L["You can track anything, {name}, but you never saw this one coming."] = "你什麼都追蹤得到，{name}，就是沒料到這個。"
L["Quick hands, quiet feet, {name}. Here's luck to go with them."] = "手快、腳輕，{name}。再配上一點運氣。"
L["Quick, {name}, before you vanish again."] = "快，{name}，趁你還沒消失。"
L["Poison on the blades, {buff} on you. Very thorough, {name}."] = "刀上有毒，身上有{buff}。真周全，{name}。"
L["I'd slip it in your pocket, {name}, but you'd notice. You always notice."] = "想偷塞你口袋，{name}，但你會發現。你總會。"
L["For the one who opens every locked box, {name}. This one comes unlocked."] = "給開過每個上鎖盒子的人，{name}。這個不用撬。"
L["Nobody sees you coming, {name}. Now it's even worse news when they do."] = "沒人看見你靠近，{name}。看見的話，對方更慘。"
L["Take this, {name}. Very discreet. It even walks quietly."] = "拿著，{name}。很低調，走路都躡手躡腳。"
L["I'd have wrapped it, {name}, but you'd only pick the knot."] = "本想包裝一下，{name}，反正你會把結撬開。"
L["Keep this one, {name}. You don't even have to steal it."] = "這個送你收著，{name}。連偷都不用。"
L["For once, {name}, somebody's looking after the priest."] = "難得一次，{name}，換人照顧牧師了。"
L["Save your prayers for the rest of us, {name}. This one's already answered."] = "禱告留給我們其他人吧，{name}。這個已經應驗了。"
L["Light or Shadow, {name}, I don't ask which. This suits both."] = "聖光或暗影，{name}，我不問。這兩邊都適用。"
L["Sit down after this fight, {name}. That's an order, from a grateful patient."] = "打完坐下休息，{name}。這是感激的病人下的命令。"
L["You keep us all standing, {name}. Here's a little of it coming back."] = "你讓大家都站得住，{name}。這點算回饋給你。"
L["You've knelt beside all of us, {name}. Stand tall a minute."] = "你為每個倒地的人跪過，{name}。站直歇會吧。"
L["Something that needed no prayer, {name}. You've said plenty of those today."] = "這個不用禱告，{name}。你今天禱告夠多了。"
L["No voice in your head comes with this one, {name}. Refreshing, isn't it?"] = "這個不附腦中的聲音，{name}。很清爽吧？"
L["The Ebon Blade asks no favours, {name}. I'm giving one anyway."] = "黑鋒騎士團不求人情，{name}。我還是要給。"
L["A little warmth, {name}. I know you don't feel the cold. It's the thought."] = "一點溫暖，{name}。我知道你不怕冷，是心意。"
L["You came back from the dead, {name}. The least I can do is help you stay back."] = "你從死亡中歸來，{name}。我至少能幫你別再回去。"
L["Runes, plague and frost, {name}. Take this too; it completes the set."] = "符文、瘟疫、冰霜，{name}。加這個就湊成套裝了。"
L["A skeletal horse and a sword that talks back, {name}. Here's something normal."] = "骷髏馬、會頂嘴的劍，{name}。來點正常的。"
L["No need to drag me over on a chain, {name}. I was coming anyway."] = "不必用死亡之握，{name}。我自己會過去。"
L["Welcome back to the land of the living, {name}. Well, its general direction."] = "歡迎重返陽間，{name}。至少大方向是對的。"
L["The elements look after you, {name}, but they don't make house calls."] = "元素照顧你，{name}，但它們不出診。"
L["Tell the spirits I said hello, {name}. They never write back."] = "替我向眾靈問好，{name}。它們從不回信。"
L["Plant a totem in my honour, {name}. A small one. I'm modest."] = "為我插根圖騰吧，{name}。小根的，我很謙虛。"
L["Earth, fire, water, air and me, {name}. Admittedly the least of the five."] = "土、火、水、風，還有我，{name}。我承認我最弱。"
L["Totems up already, {name}? Then this goes with them."] = "圖騰都插好了，{name}？那這個也配上。"
L["The wind would have brought you this, {name}, but it's flighty. I'm reliable."] = "風本想送來，{name}，但它太飄忽了。我比較可靠。"
L["You speak for the land, {name}. I hope it speaks kindly of me."] = "你為大地發聲，{name}。希望它說我好話。"
L["The spirits said you'd earned this, {name}. I didn't ask; they volunteered."] = "眾靈說你值得這個，{name}。我沒問，它們自己說的。"
L["A gift for a mage, {name}. Hard to find one you can't conjure."] = "送法師的禮物，{name}。很難找到你變不出來的。"
L["You solve most problems with sheep, {name}. This covers the rest."] = "你多半靠變羊解決問題，{name}。這個管剩下的。"
L["You could teleport out of any trouble, {name}. This is for the trouble first."] = "你能傳送脫身，{name}。這是給脫身前那段麻煩的。"
L["For the clever one, {name}. Please don't thank me by making me a sheep."] = "給聰明人，{name}。道謝時拜託別把我變成羊。"
L["Blink wherever you like, {name}. This comes too."] = "想閃去哪都行，{name}。這個會跟著你。"
L["Stand a little back from the fire you're about to start, {name}. Here."] = "等下放火記得站遠點，{name}。先拿著。"
L["You keep us all fed and watered, {name}. Your turn to be looked after."] = "你包辦大家的吃喝，{name}。換你被照顧了。"
L["Portal fees are steep, {name}. Call this a down payment on my next one."] = "開門費好貴，{name}。這當我下次的訂金。"
L["Entirely demon-free, {name}. I checked."] = "完全無惡魔成分，{name}。我檢查過了。"
L["Your imp may be jealous, {name}. Tell it there's plenty to go round."] = "你的小鬼可能會吃醋，{name}。跟它說人人有份。"
L["No contract, no fine print, {name}. Just a gift."] = "沒有契約，沒有小字，{name}。單純的禮物。"
L["For the one who hands out healthstones, {name}. Nobody ever thanks you."] = "給發治療石的人，{name}。從來沒人謝過你。"
L["Here, {name}. Summon the rest of us later and we'll call it even."] = "給你，{name}。晚點把大家召喚過來就算扯平。"
L["Your voidwalker can stop hovering, {name}. I mean well."] = "叫你的虛無行者別再飄了，{name}。我是好意。"
L["Your felhunter eats magic, {name}. Keep it off this one; it's for you."] = "惡魔獵犬吃魔法，{name}。這份是你的，別餵它。"
L["For the one who reads what nobody else dares, {name}."] = "獻給敢讀別人不敢讀之書的人，{name}。"
L["Carrying a bag of souls all day, {name}? Your shoulders must need this."] = "整天扛一袋靈魂，{name}？肩膀一定很痠，拿著。"
L["Roll wherever you like, {name}. This rolls with you."] = "翻滾去哪都行，{name}。這個陪你一起翻。"
L["Brew first or fight first, {name}? Either way, take this."] = "先釀酒還是先開打，{name}？先拿著這個。"
L["Inner peace for you, {name}, and outer peace too, as long as this lasts."] = "內心平靜給你，{name}，效果期間外在也平靜。"
L["Chi flows better with a little help, {name}. Or so a monk once told me."] = "真氣有人幫才順，{name}。一個武僧跟我說的。"
L["Kick, flip, roll, {name}. I'll just stand here and do this bit."] = "踢、翻、滾，{name}。我就站在這裡負責這部分。"
L["Teach me to flip without spilling my drink, {name}, and we're even."] = "教我翻跟斗不灑酒，{name}，我們就扯平。"
L["Tea, meditation and this, {name}. The three pillars of a good day."] = "茶、冥想和這個，{name}。好日子的三寶。"
L["Tell the bear this is for them too, {name}."] = "跟你的熊說這也有牠一份，{name}。"
L["Hold still, {name}. I've never once managed to catch you as a cheetah."] = "別動，{name}。你變獵豹時我從沒追上過。"
L["Nature looks after you already, {name}. Today she sent me to help."] = "大自然本來就照顧你，{name}。今天她派我來幫忙。"
L["Whatever shape you're in next, {name}, this goes with you."] = "下次變成什麼形態，{name}，這都跟著你。"
L["For the forest's friend, {name}. Give my regards to the trees."] = "給森林的朋友，{name}。替我向樹問好。"
L["Cenarion work is never done, {name}. Here's a little help."] = "塞納里奧的工作永遠做不完，{name}。幫你一點。"
L["I'd give it to the cat, {name}, but the cat would pretend not to care."] = "本想給那隻貓，{name}，但貓會裝作不在乎。"
L["Say hello to your moonkin form for me, {name}. It always looks so startled."] = "替我跟你的梟獸形態問好，{name}。它總是一臉驚嚇。"
L["You were not prepared, {name}. Now you are."] = "你還沒準備好，{name}。現在好了。"
L["Years in a Warden's cell, {name}. You've earned a small kindness."] = "在守望者牢房關了那麼多年，{name}。你值得一點善意。"
L["You gave up so much to fight the Legion, {name}. Here's a little back."] = "你為對抗燃燒軍團犧牲那麼多，{name}。還你一點。"
L["For the one who leaps first, {name}. Do land somewhere friendly."] = "給第一個跳的人，{name}。落地挑個友善的地方。"
L["Fel and fury, {name}, and now a little kindness. It'll balance out."] = "魔化能量加怒火，{name}，再加點善意，剛好平衡。"
L["I'd ask if you saw this coming, {name}, but you see everything."] = "本想給你驚喜，{name}，但你蒙著眼都看得見。"
L["You can see souls, {name}. Mine's the one being generous."] = "你看得見靈魂，{name}。正在大方的那個就是我。"
L["Illidan never let anyone help him, {name}. You're wiser than your teacher."] = "伊利丹從不讓人幫，{name}。你這是青出於藍。"
L["A demon inside and a Legion outside, {name}. Here's one thing on your side."] = "內有惡魔，外有軍團，{name}。至少這個挺你。"
L["For you, {name}. Please don't breathe on it."] = "給你，{name}。拜託別對它吐息。"
L["A little help for a dragon, {name}. I'll be telling my grandchildren."] = "幫了龍一把，{name}。我要講給孫子聽。"
L["The Aspects sent you out into the world, {name}. I'm making it friendlier."] = "守護巨龍派你來闖蕩，{name}。我讓世界友善點。"
L["Take to the skies after this, {name}. I'll wave from down here."] = "拿了就飛上天吧，{name}。我在地上揮手。"
L["A dragon on our side, {name}. I've never felt safer being generous."] = "有龍站我們這邊，{name}。我從沒這麼安心地大方。"
L["A gift for a dragon, {name}. Normally folk bring gold and hope to leave again."] = "送禮給龍，{name}。一般人都帶黃金來求活命。"
L["For the one who could fly me to the next town, {name}. Not asking. Hinting."] = "給能載我飛的人，{name}。不是拜託，是暗示。"
L["I've met a few dragons, {name}. You're the first I didn't run from."] = "我遇過幾隻龍，{name}。你是我唯一沒拔腿就跑的。"
L["For the world's youngest ancient, {name}."] = "給全世界最年輕的老前輩，{name}。"
L["{buff} for a mage, {name}. Like lending a library a book."] = "給法師{buff}，{name}。像借書給圖書館。"
L["Mage to mage, {name}: I won't ask you for water if you won't ask me."] = "法師對法師，{name}：你不跟我討水，我也不討。"
L["Two mages, {name}. Between us we can portal anywhere and still be late."] = "兩個法師，{name}。能開門去任何地方，照樣遲到。"
L["A mage for a mage, {name}. Our old masters would approve."] = "法師送法師，{name}。我們的老導師會點頭的。"
L["A mage enchanting a mage, {name}. We'll both pretend we needed it."] = "法師幫法師是班門弄斧，{name}。一起假裝需要吧。"
L["Neither of us will admit which spells we still read off the page, {name}."] = "哪些咒語還要看小抄，{name}，我倆都不會說。"
L["One mage is a scholar, {name}. Two is an argument. Here's my opening point."] = "一個法師是學者，{name}，兩個是辯論。我先申論。"
L["We both know this spell by heart, {name}. Humour me."] = "這法術我們都倒背如流，{name}。就依我一次。"
L["More mana for you, {name}. Try not to spend it all on one fireball."] = "多給你點法力，{name}。別全砸在一顆火球上。"
L["Priest to priest, {name}: who blesses the blessers? Today, me."] = "牧師對牧師，{name}：誰祝福祝福者？今天我。"
L["Between us, {name}, we'll pretend the warriors listen."] = "我們之間，{name}，就假裝戰士會聽話吧。"
L["A priest looking after a priest, {name}. It feels almost forbidden."] = "牧師照顧牧師，{name}。感覺幾乎是禁忌。"
L["Two priests, {name}. Twice the praying and half the panic."] = "兩個牧師，{name}。禱告加倍，慌張減半。"
L["If it all goes wrong, {name}, we two are the last ones standing."] = "萬一全搞砸，{name}，最後站著的就是我們倆。"
L["Rest your prayers a while, {name}. Mine can keep watch."] = "你的禱告先歇會兒，{name}。我的來守著。"
L["I'd preach to you, {name}, but you've heard it. You've probably given it."] = "想對你講道，{name}，但你聽過了。大概還講過。"
L["Same vows and same sore knees, {name}. Here's something for yours."] = "誓言相同，膝蓋一樣痠，{name}。給你的膝蓋補補。"
L["If I fall, {name}, you know the words. If you fall, so do I. Let's neither."] = "我倒你復活，{name}，你倒我復活。乾脆都別倒。"
L["Two druids, {name}. The Cenarion Circle would call this a quorum."] = "兩個德魯伊，{name}。塞納里奧議會可以開會了。"
L["Druid to druid, {name}: bear or cat, I'd know you by the leaves in your hair."] = "德魯伊之間，{name}：熊豹都認得，看頭上葉子。"
L["From one shapeshifter to another, {name}: this one fits every shape."] = "變形者對變形者，{name}：這個每種形態都合身。"
L["No handshake, {name}. Two druids, and neither of us has the right shape for it."] = "不握手了，{name}。兩個德魯伊都不是握手的形態。"
L["Between us, {name}, we've a shape for every problem. Mostly bears."] = "我倆凡事都有對應形態，{name}。多半是熊。"
L["Fellow druid, {name}? Then you know the trees told me you were coming."] = "同是德魯伊，{name}？那你懂，樹早就通風報信了。"
L["If you see me as a cat later, {name}, pretend you don't know me. Dignity."] = "待會我變貓，{name}，就裝不認識。為了面子。"
L["Paladin to paladin, {name}: heavy hammer, light heart."] = "聖騎士對聖騎士，{name}：錘要重，心要輕。"
L["A blessing for a paladin, {name}. Now we're both insufferably radiant."] = "給聖騎士的祝福，{name}。我們都亮到讓人受不了。"
L["Two paladins, {name}. Somewhere, a priest is quietly relieved."] = "兩個聖騎士，{name}。某個牧師偷偷鬆了口氣。"
L["One of us should be humble about this, {name}. Neither of us will be."] = "我們之中該有人謙虛點，{name}。但兩個都不會。"
L["Same oath, different polish, {name}. Yours is shinier; I noticed."] = "同樣的誓言，{name}，你擦得比較亮。我有發現。"
L["Between us, {name}, we could light a cathedral. Or a small, very holy room."] = "我倆能照亮大教堂，{name}。或超神聖的小房間。"
L["Two suits of plate, {name}. Nobody will hear us sneak up. Nobody ever does."] = "兩身板甲，{name}。想偷襲？叮噹聲早出賣我們了。"
L["Your libram and mine agree on this one, {name}. Rare, that."] = "你我的聖契這次看法一致，{name}。難得。"
L["Warlock to warlock, {name}: keep your imp away from mine. They gossip."] = "術士對術士，{name}：小鬼別湊一起，它們愛八卦。"
L["Fellow warlock, {name}? Then you'll know this one's harmless."] = "同為術士，{name}？那你知道這個無害。"
L["Two warlocks, {name}. Let's not compare soul shards in public."] = "兩個術士，{name}。別在公共場合比靈魂碎片。"
L["Between us, {name}, the demons do all the work. This bit I do myself."] = "私下說，{name}，活都是惡魔幹的。這個我親自來。"
L["Another warlock, {name}. Let's be polite; I've seen what you summon."] = "同為術士，{name}，我會很客氣。我見過你召喚的。"
L["A spell from one warlock to another, {name}. Check it for curses. I would."] = "術士送的，{name}。先驗驗有沒有詛咒，換我也會。"
L["Fellow warlock, {name}. The only one who won't ask where this came from."] = "同為術士，{name}，只有你不會嫌它來路不明。"
L["Two warlocks, one kind deed, {name}. The Burning Legion must be livid."] = "兩個術士，一件善事，{name}。燃燒軍團一定氣炸了。"
L["I'd summon you a drink, {name}, but we both know how summoning goes."] = "本想召喚杯酒給你，{name}，但召喚的下場你懂的。"
L["Two warriors, {name}. Somewhere, a healer just sighed."] = "兩個戰士，{name}。某個補師剛嘆了口氣。"
L["Warrior to warrior, {name}: first into the fight buys the drinks. I'm buying."] = "戰士對戰士，{name}：先衝的請喝酒。我請。"
L["Shout for shout, {name}. We'll deafen the whole place together."] = "吼對吼，{name}。我們一起把全場震聾。"
L["No plan, {name}? Perfect. We'll get along."] = "沒計畫，{name}？完美。我們會很合得來。"
L["Warriors, {name}: the only folk who think shouting is a spell. We're right."] = "只有戰士覺得吼叫算法術，{name}。我們沒錯。"
L["One warrior to another, {name}: keep your shield up and your temper hot."] = "戰士對戰士，{name}：盾要舉高，火氣要旺。"
L["You know this one, {name}. You've probably shouted it at me already."] = "這招你熟，{name}。你大概已經對我吼過了。"
L["Our trainer would be proud, {name}. He'd shout it, but he'd be proud."] = "訓練師會很欣慰，{name}。會吼著說，但很欣慰。"
L["Fellow warrior? Then you know the blacksmith's first name too, {name}."] = "也是戰士？那你也叫得出鐵匠的名字吧，{name}。"
L["No mana to fill, {name}. It'll just stand about being clever, like me."] = "沒法力可補，{name}。它只會站著裝聰明，跟我一樣。"
L["My spell on a warrior, {name}. Call it a small experiment."] = "我的法術用在戰士身上，{name}。就當小實驗。"
L["I only know the one spell for friends, {name}. Rage or mana, you're getting it."] = "朋友我只會這招，{name}。管你怒氣還法力，收下。"
L["Your rage doesn't need this, {name}, but I'd feel rude walking past you."] = "你的怒氣用不到這個，{name}，但路過不給很失禮。"
L["No mana, I know, {name}. A sharp mind never hurt a sharp blade."] = "我知道你沒法力，{name}。腦袋靈光，對利刃也沒壞處。"
L["It's meant for mana, {name}. You'll find a use. Rogues always find a use."] = "這是補法力的，{name}。但盜賊總能物盡其用。"
L["Not your kind of magic, {name}. Call it a very clever lockpick."] = "不是你那種魔法，{name}。就當是很聰明的撬鎖工具。"
L["Aye, {name}, ye only had to ask. Hold still now!"] = "好咧，{name}，你開口就成！別亂動！"
L["Here, {name}, a wee somethin' to keep ye on yer feet."] = "來，{name}，這點小玩意讓你站穩腳！"
L["My thanks, {name}. Allow me to return the kindness."] = "多謝，{name}。容我還你這份人情。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand fast a moment."] = "當然，{name}。站穩片刻。"
L["The road ahead is long, {name}. Take this with you."] = "前路漫漫，{name}，帶上這個吧。"
L["Ishnu-alah, {name}. Your kindness is returned."] = "Ishnu-alah，{name}。回敬你的好意。"
L["Elune-adore, {name}. Walk softly beneath the stars."] = "Elune-adore，{name}。星光下輕步慢行。"
L["The Light rewards kindness, {name}, and so shall I."] = "聖光會回報善意，{name}，我也會。"
L["Of course, {name}. May the Naaru guide your steps."] = "當然，{name}。願那魯指引你的腳步。"
L["The Light is with you, {name}. Go in peace."] = "聖光與你同在，{name}。平安去吧。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. Gilneas never forgets a kindness."] = "感激不盡，{name}。吉爾尼斯從不忘恩。"
L["Lok'tar ogar, {name}! Take this into battle."] = "Lok'tar ogar，{name}！帶它上戰場！"
L["The Earth Mother sees your kindness, {name}. I return it."] = "大地之母看見你的善心，{name}。我回敬你。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand tall and be at peace."] = "當然，{name}。站直了，心平氣和。"
L["Walk with the Earth Mother, {name}."] = "願大地之母與你同行，{name}。"
L["Ya be too kind, {name}! Dis one be from me."] = "你太客氣啦，{name}！這份算咱的。"
L["Sure ting, {name}. Hold still now."] = "當然囉，{name}。站好別動。"
L["Da loa be watchin' over ya, {name}."] = "羅亞在看著你哩，{name}。"
L["Such courtesy does you credit, {name}. Anar'alah belore."] = "如此禮數，實屬難得，{name}。Anar'alah belore。"
L["Anar'alah belore, {name}. May the sun guide you."] = "Anar'alah belore，{name}。願太陽指引你。"
L["Your generosity is noted, {name}. Suramar remembers its friends."] = "慷慨已記下，{name}。蘇拉瑪爾不忘友人。"
L["Thank you, {name}! The caravan always repays a kindness."] = "謝謝你，{name}！商隊向來知恩圖報。"
L["Every traveller needs something for the road, {name}."] = "出門在外，總得帶點盤纏，{name}。"
L["Of course, {name}. Patience, and it is done."] = "當然，{name}。耐心點，這就好了。"
L["Take this, {name}. Even a dragon needs allies."] = "拿著，{name}。龍也需要盟友。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The Alliance looks after its own."] = "謝謝你，{name}。聯盟照顧自己人。"
L["Of course, {name}. Allies help each other."] = "當然，{name}。盟友就該互助。"
L["For the Alliance, {name}! Stay strong out there."] = "為了聯盟，{name}！在外頭挺住！"
L["Strength and honour, {name}. Your kindness is repaid."] = "力量與榮譽，{name}。好意奉還。"
L["Consider it done, {name}. For the Horde."] = "交給我，{name}。為了部落。"
L["For the Horde, {name}! Go with strength."] = "為了部落，{name}！力量與你同在！"
L["Thank you, {name}. Good hearts are found everywhere."] = "謝謝你，{name}。好心人處處都有。"
L["Gladly, {name}, whatever banner you fly."] = "樂意，{name}，不論你舉哪面旗。"
L["Friends can come from any side, {name}."] = "朋友不分陣營，{name}。"
L["Safe travels, {name}. Take some {buff} with you."] = "路上小心，{name}。帶點{buff}走吧。"
L["Bwonsamdi gonna be real disappointed, {name}. Thanks, mon."] = "邦桑迪會超失望的，{name}。謝啦，老兄。"
L["Sure ting, {name}. Hold still; da mojo don't like a movin' target."] = "當然囉，{name}。站好，巫毒不愛打移動靶。"
L["No worries, {name}. Da loa got ya covered."] = "別擔心，{name}。羅亞罩著你。"
L["Stay away from da voodoo, {name}. ...Except dis voodoo. Dis one fine."] = "遠離巫毒，{name}。……這個除外，這個沒事。"
L["Da loa be watchin' over ya, {name}. Dey real nosy like dat."] = "羅亞在看著你哩，{name}。祂們可愛管閒事了。"
L["Stay sharp out dere, {name}. Take dis wit' ya."] = "在外頭機靈點，{name}。這個帶著走。"
L["Take dis, {name}. Walk like ya own da jungle. I do."] = "{name}，走路要像叢林你家開的。咱就是。"
L["Hey, {name}! Always good to see family, mon."] = "嘿，{name}！見到自家人真好，老兄。"
L["Dis crew got style, {name}. Now it got mojo too."] = "這隊很有型，{name}。現在還有巫毒了。"
L["We go in together, {name}, we come out together. Dat be da whole plan, mon."] = "一起進，{name}，一起出。計畫就這樣，老兄。"
L["Night be da best time for mojo, {name}. Nobody see where it come from."] = "晚上最適合巫毒，{name}。沒人看得到從哪來的。"
L["We split the loot even, {name}. I'll do the maths. Trust me."] = "戰利品平分，{name}。我來算。相信我。"
L["Returning a favour:"] = "還人情："
L["Answering a request:"] = "回應請求："
L["In your group:"] = "隊伍中："
L["Offering unasked:"] = "主動提供："
L["Returning a favour of %s:"] = "還人情（%s）："
L["Meeting somebody a third time:"] = "第三次遇到同一個人："
L["(nothing -- speech off, or no usable lines)"] = "（無：說話已關閉，或沒有可用的台詞）"
L["In character"] = "入戲"
L["an in-character line"] = "一句入戲台詞"
L["Favour ledger"] = "人情帳本"
L["Close (Escape works too)"] = "關閉（也可以按 Escape）"
L["No favours recorded today."] = "今天沒有記錄到人情。"
L["Nothing you cast could return today's favours."] = "今天的人情，你施放的法術都還不了。"
L["Returned %d of 1 favour today."] = "今天已還人情：%d/1。"
L["Returned %d of %d favours today."] = "今天已還人情：%d/%d。"
L["1 favour still owed."] = "還欠1份人情。"
L["%d favours still owed."] = "還欠%d份人情。"
L["You gave 1 buff unprompted today."] = "你今天主動給了1個增益。"
L["You gave %d buffs unprompted today."] = "你今天主動給了%d個增益。"
L["All time -- received: %d, returned: %d, given to your group: %d, to strangers: %d"] = "累計：收到%d，已還%d，給隊友%d，給路人%d"
L["All time"] = "累計"
L["received"] = "收到"
L["returned"] = "已還"
L["to your group"] = "給隊友"
L["to strangers"] = "給路人"
L["%d-%d of %d"] = "%d-%d，共%d筆"
L["Everything"] = "全部"
L["Favours"] = "人情"
L["Buffs you gave"] = "你給的增益"
L["Nothing recorded. When somebody buffs you it is listed here, and so is what you give back and who you buff unprompted."] = "尚無記錄。有人為你加增益時會列在這裡，你還的人情和你主動加增益的對象也會列出。"
L["No favours recorded. When somebody buffs you, they are listed here."] = "尚無人情記錄。有人為你加增益時，對方會列在這裡。"
L["No buffs given unprompted. When the prompt buffs somebody who did not buff you first, it is listed here."] = "尚未主動給過增益。提示框為沒有先為你加增益的人加增益時，會列在這裡。"
L["Nothing is recorded while Manners is switched off."] = "Manners 關閉期間不會記錄任何內容。"
L["Nothing is recorded while the prompt has nothing to cast on this character."] = "提示框在這個角色上沒有可施放的法術時，不會記錄任何內容。"
L["Clear"] = "清除"
L["Click again to clear"] = "再點一次以清除"
L["Empties the list, and today's count with it. Favours you still owe stay, and the all-time totals are kept."] = "清空清單，今天的計數也會一併清空。你還欠的人情會保留，累計總數也不受影響。"
L["Still owed"] = "待還"
L["Returned"] = "已還"
L["Let go"] = "作罷"
L["Gave"] = "已給"
L["with %s"] = "用%s"
L["the time to return it ran out"] = "還人情的時限已過"
L["nothing you cast is any use to them"] = "你施放的法術對對方都沒有用"
L["forgotten at a logout or reload"] = "登出或重新載入時被遺忘"
L["you put them on your never-offer list"] = "你將對方加入了永不提供名單"
L["%s, in your group"] = "%s（隊友）"
L["%s, to a stranger"] = "%s（路人）"
L["%s, to %d who needed it"] = "%s（給%d位需要的人）"
L["a buff"] = "某個增益"
L["Buffed you with %s, %s."] = "為你加了%s（%s）。"
L["They buffed you %d times; one buff back repays all of it."] = "對方為你加了%d次增益；加回去一次就全部還清。"
L["Still owed. The prompt offers them until you return it or the time runs out."] = "待還。對方會一直出現在提示框上，直到你還了人情或時限到了為止。"
