L["|cffffd100Snoozed until %s.|r The prompt is unlocked, so it stays up to be dragged, casting nothing, until you lock it."] = "|cffffd100暫停至%s。|r提示框目前已解鎖，所以在你鎖定之前，會留在畫面上供你拖曳，但不會施放任何東西。"
L["|cffffd100Snoozed until %s.|r No prompt until then, though who buffs you is still noticed."] = "|cffffd100暫停至%s。|r在此之前不會顯示提示框，但仍會記下誰為你加了增益。"
L["Hide the prompt for a while without turning Manners off."] = "暫時隱藏提示框，不必關閉 Manners。"
L["Snooze %s"] = "暫停%s"
L["Who buffed you, whether you returned it, and who you buffed first."] = "誰為你加了增益、你是否還了人情，以及你主動為誰加了增益。"
L["Minimap and chat"] = "小地圖與聊天"
L["Show minimap button"] = "顯示小地圖按鈕"
L["Manners stays in the addon compartment under the minimap either way."] = "無論如何，Manners 都會保留在小地圖下方的插件選單中。"
L["Without it, open these settings with %s or Options > AddOns."] = "沒有它時，可用 %s 或「選項 > 插件」開啟這些設定。"
L["A line when somebody buffs you, when a favour is counted as repaid, and when a click fails, is skipped, or leaves somebody owed."] = "有人為你加增益、人情算作已還，以及點擊失敗、被略過或點擊後仍欠著人情時，都會顯示一行訊息。"
L["Only you see these; they show whether a buff was missed or someone could not be reached."] = "只有你看得到這些訊息；從中可看出是否漏了增益，或是有人不在範圍內。"
L["Automatic (whatever they are missing)"] = "自動（缺什麼給什麼）"
L["%s |cff808080(not learned)|r"] = "%s|cff808080（未學會）|r"
L["%s |cff808080(mana users only)|r"] = "%s|cff808080（僅限法力職業）|r"
L["%s |cff808080(your group only)|r"] = "%s|cff808080（僅限隊伍）|r"
L["This character has nothing it can cast on another player."] = "這個角色沒有可以對其他玩家施放的法術。"
L["You have not learned any of these yet, so nobody will be offered anything."] = "你還沒學會其中任何一個法術，所以不會為任何人提供增益。"
L["Automatic never offers %s -- nobody standing in a city wants it -- so nobody will be offered anything."] = "「自動」從不提供%s（站在主城裡的人不會需要它），所以不會為任何人提供增益。"
L["Pick it in Buff to offer if you want it given out anyway."] = "如果還是想提供它，請在「要提供的增益」中選擇它。"
L["Every spell you have learned is switched off, so nothing is offered until you switch one back on or learn one of the others."] = "你已學會的法術全都關閉了，所以在你重新開啟其中一個或學會其他法術之前，不會提供任何增益。"
L["Every spell below is switched off, so the prompt will never appear."] = "下方所有法術都已關閉，所以提示框永遠不會出現。"
L["Your blessings replace one another, so Automatic gives only the first of %s that suits them. |cffffd100Always offer|r does not check what they carry, so it can replace one of yours."] = "你的祝福會互相取代，所以「自動」只會給%s之中第一個適合對方的。|cffffd100一律提供|r不會檢查對方身上帶著什麼，所以可能取代你原有的祝福。"
L["Your blessings replace one another, so Automatic gives only the first of %s that suits them. Where the game hides which blessing somebody carries, it can replace one of yours."] = "你的祝福會互相取代，所以「自動」只會給%s之中第一個適合對方的。遊戲不顯示對方帶著哪個祝福時，可能會取代你原有的祝福。"
L["Your blessings replace one another, so Automatic gives only the first of %s that suits them. Anybody already carrying one of yours is left alone."] = "你的祝福會互相取代，所以「自動」只會給%s之中第一個適合對方的。已帶有你某個祝福的人不會被打擾。"
L["Automatic may offer, in this order: %s. Each person gets the first one they are missing."] = "「自動」可能依此順序提供：%s。每個人會得到第一個缺少的增益。"
L["When the game hides what someone has, it tries the next one each time."] = "遊戲隱藏對方身上的增益時，每次會改試下一個。"
L["Only |cffffffff%s|r is offered, to everybody, whatever else they are missing. The per-spell switches come back with Automatic."] = "只會為所有人提供|cffffffff%s|r，不論對方還缺少什麼。切回「自動」後，各法術的開關就會恢復作用。"
L["You picked %s in Buff to offer, but have not learned it, so nothing is offered."] = "你在「要提供的增益」中選了%s，但尚未學會，所以不會提供任何增益。"
L["Learn it or set Buff to offer back to Automatic."] = "請學會它，或把「要提供的增益」改回「自動」。"
L["Untick to never offer this buff."] = "取消勾選即永不提供這個增益。"
L["Automatic (only while I'm the tank)"] = "自動（只在我擔任坦克時）"
L["Automatic"] = "自動"
L["Automatic (%s, the one you had up last)"] = "自動（%s，你上次用的）"
L["Automatic (%s, in a dungeon or raid)"] = "自動（%s，在地城或團隊副本中）"
L["Automatic (%s, outside dungeons and raids)"] = "自動（%s，在地城和團隊副本以外）"
L["Automatic (%s, the best you can use now)"] = "自動（%s，你現在能用的最好的）"
L["Automatic (%s, until you have put one up)"] = "自動（%s，在你用過任一個之前）"
L["Automatic reminds you only while your group role is tank; Always reminds you whenever it is not up."] = "「自動」只在你的隊伍職責為坦克時提醒你；「總是」則只要沒有生效就會提醒你。"
L["Reminds you when nothing is on the weapon in your main hand and a scroll in your bags fits it. Automatic takes the one you used last, else the best you can use."] = "主手武器上沒有任何附魔、且背包裡有適用的卷軸時提醒你。「自動」會選你上次用的那個，否則選你現在能用的最好的。"
L["Reminds you when no familiar is with you and a scroll for one is in your bags. Automatic takes the one you used last, else the best your level allows."] = "身邊沒有魔寵、且背包裡有魔寵卷軸時提醒你。「自動」會選你上次用的那個，否則選你的等級能用的最好的。"
L["Reminds you when none of these is up. Automatic takes the one you had up last."] = "這些都沒有生效時提醒你。「自動」會選你上次用的那個。"
L["Until you have had one up: %s in a dungeon or raid, %s elsewhere."] = "在你用過任一個之前：地城或團隊副本中用%s，其他地方用%s。"
L["Don't remind me"] = "不要提醒我"
L["Always"] = "總是"
L["Reminds you when it is not up."] = "沒有生效時提醒你。"
L["%s: the game does not say how many you carry."] = "%s：遊戲沒有提供你攜帶的數量。"
L["%s: %d in your bags"] = "%s：背包裡有%d個"
L["%s: none needed -- the game lets you cast without it."] = "%s：不需要——遊戲允許你不帶它也能施放。"
L["You have not learned a group version of your buffs yet."] = "你還沒學會任何增益的群體版本。"
L["What to cast"] = "施放內容"
L["Buff to offer"] = "要提供的增益"
L["You offer %s."] = "你提供%s。"
L["%s is not offered to players without mana, such as warriors and rogues."] = "不會為沒有法力的玩家（例如戰士和盜賊）提供%s。"
L["%s are not offered to players without mana, such as warriors and rogues."] = "不會為沒有法力的玩家（例如戰士和盜賊）提供%s。"
L["Nothing is ticked here, so the prompt will never appear."] = "這裡什麼都沒勾選，所以提示框永遠不會出現。"
L["People who buff me"] = "為我加增益的人"
L["Offer a buff back to anyone who buffs you. Yours reaches only your own party (in a raid, your subgroup), so someone outside it is offered once they join."] = "有人為你加增益時，提示你加回去。你的增益只作用於你自己的隊伍（在團隊中則是你所在的小隊），所以不在其中的人要等加入後才會出現。"
L["Offer a buff back to anyone who buffs you. Yours reaches only your group, so someone outside it is offered once they join."] = "有人為你加增益時，提示你加回去。你的增益只作用於你的隊伍，所以不在隊伍中的人要等加入後才會出現。"
L["Offer a buff back to anyone who buffs you, in your group or not."] = "有人為你加增益時，提示你加回去，不論對方是否在你的隊伍中。"
L["My party and raid"] = "我的隊伍與團隊"
L["Passers-by (players near me, not in my group)"] = "路人（我附近、不在隊伍中的玩家）"
L["Seen through nameplates, your target, focus and mouseover."] = "透過名條、目標、專注目標和滑鼠指向發現。"
L["Everything you can offer is cast on yourself and reaches only your party, so there is nothing for passers-by."] = "你能提供的增益都是對自己施放、只作用於你的隊伍，所以沒有能給路人的。"
L["Passers-by within"] = "路人距離"
L["Only passers-by are measured, and only roughly: the game gives no exact distance."] = "只有路人會測量距離，而且只是大約：遊戲不提供精確距離。"
L["Only in cities and inns"] = "只在主城和旅店"
L["Out in the world, passers-by are left alone; your group and people who buff you are offered anywhere."] = "在野外不會提供給路人；隊友和為你加增益的人在哪裡都會提供。"
L["For a minute, offer your buff to someone who asks for it (\"fort pls\"); off by default because chat is guesswork."] = "有人向你要增益時（「fort pls」），一分鐘內會為對方提供；讀聊天只能靠猜，所以預設關閉。"
L["Offer your own buffs to you when one is not up: the ones below. They are cast on you, your target is handed back, and nothing is said."] = "有自己的增益沒有生效時，提供給你：也就是下方這些。會直接對你施放，然後切回原目標，也不說話。"
L["Offer your own buffs to you too, when one is not up: the ones below, and the buff you give others. They are cast on you, your target is handed back, and nothing is said."] = "有自己的增益沒有生效時，也提供給你：包括下方這些，以及你給別人的增益。會直接對你施放，然後切回原目標，也不說話。"
L["Offer your own buff to you too, when you are missing it or, with top-ups on, it is running low. It is cast on you, your target is handed back, and nothing is said."] = "你缺少自己的增益時，也提供給你；開啟補加時，快到期也會提供。會直接對你施放，然後切回原目標，也不說話。"
L["Off: nothing is offered to you while the game calls you resting, in a city or an inn."] = "關閉：遊戲顯示你處於休息狀態（在主城或旅店中）時，不會為你提供任何增益。"
L["My group and raid"] = "我的隊伍與團隊"
L["Use group buffs"] = "使用群體增益"
L["When this many need it"] = "需要的人數"
L["Raid groups I buff"] = "我加增益的團隊小隊"
L["In a raid, only these groups are offered your buff; people who buff you or ask are offered anyway."] = "在團隊中只為這些小隊提供增益；為你加增益或向你要增益的人照樣會提供。"
L["Who comes first"] = "優先順序"
L["My target first"] = "我的目標優先"
L["Your target goes ahead of everyone when the game can see they lack the buff."] = "遊戲能看出你的目標缺少增益時，對方會排在所有人前面。"
L["Greyed out while |cffffd100Always offer|r is chosen on %s: nothing is read then."] = "在「%s」分頁選擇|cffffd100一律提供|r時會變灰：那時不會讀取任何資訊。"
L["Friends and guildmates first"] = "好友與公會成員優先"
L["Only changes the order; nobody is added or left out."] = "只改變順序，不會增加或排除任何人。"
L["My group first at a ready check"] = "就位確認時我的隊伍優先"
L["From a ready check until the pull, group members missing your buff go first."] = "從就位確認到開怪，缺少你增益的隊友優先。"
L["Group members just revived first"] = "剛復活的隊友優先"
L["For two minutes after someone is brought back, they go first if they lack your buff."] = "有人被復活後2分鐘內，若缺少你的增益就會優先。"
L["Skip players below level"] = "略過低於此等級的玩家"
L["Someone known only by name is offered anyway."] = "只知道名字、看不到等級的人照樣會提供。"
L["Skip players out of range"] = "略過超出範圍的玩家"
L["If the game cannot tell the range they are still offered."] = "遊戲無法判斷距離時，對方仍會出現在提示框上。"
L["Skip players flagged for PvP"] = "略過處於 PvP 狀態的玩家"
L["Buffing somebody flagged for PvP flags you too. Ignored while you are flagged yourself, as in a battleground, but not while your own flag is running out."] = "為處於 PvP 狀態的人加增益，你也會進入 PvP 狀態。你自己處於 PvP 狀態時（例如在戰場中）此選項不會生效，但你自己的 PvP 狀態即將結束時仍會生效。"
L["Skip my own class when they can cast it too"] = "跳過能自己施放的同職業玩家"
L["Somebody of your class can give themselves your buff, so they are left out -- unless they are too low a level for the rank you cast, and then they still get yours. People who buffed you, asked or you targeted are always offered."] = "同職業的玩家能自己替自己施放你的增益，所以會被跳過——除非其等級還學不到你施放的等級，這時仍會得到你的。替你施放過增益、提出請求或被你選為目標的人一定會被提供。"
L["Nobody is on the list. Shift-right-click the prompt to add the person it shows, or type a name below."] = "名單上沒有人。Shift+右鍵點擊提示框可加入目前顯示的人，或在下方輸入名字。"
L["One person is on the list. They are never offered anything as a passer-by or as a member of your group."] = "名單上有1人。不論對方是路人還是隊友，都永遠不會為對方提供任何增益。"
L["%d people are on the list. They are never offered anything as passers-by or as members of your group."] = "名單上有%d人。不論他們是路人還是隊友，都永遠不會為他們提供任何增益。"
L["Somebody on it who buffs you is still offered the favour back. Shift-right-click them on the prompt to let that favour go."] = "名單上的人若為你加了增益，仍會提示你還人情。在提示框上 Shift+右鍵點擊對方，就能讓那份人情作罷。"
L["Add a name"] = "加入名字"
L["Type it as the prompt shows it and press Enter."] = "照提示框上顯示的寫法輸入，再按 Enter。"
L["Pick a name"] = "選擇名字"
L["Remove from list"] = "從名單移除"
L["Clear the list"] = "清空名單"
L["Take everybody off the never-offer list?"] = "要把所有人移出永不提供名單嗎？"
L["Already buffed"] = "已有增益"
L["If they already have it"] = "對方已有增益時"
L["Your own buffs are offered when none is up; with Offer a top-up when it runs low, also when one is running out (never an aura or an aspect)."] = "你自己的增益都沒有生效時會提供；選擇「快到期時提供補加」時，有增益快到期也會提供（光環和守護除外）。"
L["Someone who buffed you is always offered a buff back; Diagnostics shows which buffs Manners can see on others."] = "為你加過增益的人一律會提示你加回去；「診斷」分頁會顯示 Manners 能看到別人身上的哪些增益。"
L["Skip them (default)"] = "略過（預設）"
L["Offer a top-up when it runs low"] = "快到期時提供補加"
L["Always offer (costs a lot of mana)"] = "一律提供（耗費大量法力）"
L["Top up when less than this is left (minutes)"] = "剩餘時間低於此值時補加（分鐘）"
L["Someone whose time left cannot be read is not offered a top-up, unless they buffed you."] = "讀不到剩餘時間的人不會提供補加，除非對方為你加過增益。"
L["Everyone you offer to is offered again and again, even with a fresh buff."] = "你提供增益的每個人都會一再出現，即使增益剛加上也一樣。"
L["%s does nothing in this mode."] = "%s在這個模式下沒有作用。"
L["Hold back"] = "暫緩提供"
L["Casting would dismount you; it is always hidden while dead, on a flight path or in a vehicle."] = "施法會讓你下坐騎；死亡、在飛行路線上或搭乘載具時一律隱藏。"
L["Below this, only your own buff and people who buffed you or asked are offered."] = "低於此值時，只會提供你自己的增益，以及為你加過增益或向你要增益的人。"
L["Below this, only people who buffed you or asked are offered."] = "低於此值時，只會提供給為你加過增益或向你要增益的人。"
L["Off: buffs are offered at any mana."] = "關閉：不論法力多少都會提供增益。"
L["Below %d%% only favours, requests and your own buff are offered; the rest come back at %d%%."] = "法力低於%d%%時只提供人情、請求和你自己的增益；回到%d%%時恢復提供其他人。"
L["Below %d%% only favours and requests are offered; the rest come back at %d%%."] = "法力低於%d%%時只提供人情與請求；回到%d%%時恢復提供其他人。"
L["Azeroth (general)"] = "艾澤拉斯（通用）"
L["loaded the %s lines."] = "已載入「%s」台詞組。"
L["In combat: changes here apply once the fight ends."] = "戰鬥中：這裡的變更會在戰鬥結束後套用。"
L["Thanks and speech"] = "道謝與說話"
L["Everyone near you sees it; never in combat or instances, and at most once per person every five minutes."] = "你附近的人都看得到；戰鬥中和副本中不會使用，同一個人每5分鐘最多一次。"
L["Say a line when I buff someone"] = "加增益時說句話"
L["Where to say it"] = "說話頻道"
L["Whisper them sends it only to the person you buff."] = "「密語對方」只會傳給你加增益的那個人。"
L["Say"] = "說"
L["Whisper them"] = "密語對方"
L["Emote"] = "表情動作"
L["Party"] = "隊伍"
L["Raid"] = "團隊"
L["Yell"] = "大喊"
L["Only when I buff someone back"] = "只在加回增益時"
L["Off, you also speak when you buff someone first."] = "關閉時，你主動為人加增益也會說話。"
L["Tick Say a line to choose what you say."] = "勾選「加增益時說句話」即可選擇要說的話。"
L["Lines"] = "台詞"
L["Line set"] = "台詞組"
L["Replaces the lines below."] = "會取代下方的台詞。"
L["Replace everything in the box below with the %s lines?"] = "要用「%s」台詞組取代下方方框中的所有內容嗎？"
L["One line is picked at random. Placeholders: {name} their name, {buff} the spell."] = "每次隨機挑一句。變數：{name} 對方名字、{buff} 法術。"
L["A line too long for a macro is skipped; Try a few shows what would go out."] = "超過巨集長度的台詞會被略過；「隨機試幾句」可看到實際會送出的內容。"
L["In character picks one of its %d lines when you click, to fit your race, faction, class and the moment. The box below shows only a few examples; editing it turns In character off."] = "「入戲」會在你點擊時從%d句台詞中挑選一句，配合你的種族、陣營、職業和當下情況。下方只列出幾句範例；修改它就會關閉「入戲」。"
L["Your lines (one per line)"] = "你的台詞（每行一句）"
L["Editing these turns In character off and uses only your lines. Continue?"] = "修改這些台詞會關閉「入戲」，只使用你自己的台詞。要繼續嗎？"
L["Go back to In character"] = "改回入戲"
L["Try a few lines"] = "隨機試幾句"
L["Prints sample lines in your chat; only you see them."] = "在聊天框印出幾句範例，只有你看得到。"
L["Somebody"] = "某人"
L["A line goes out only with a buff that can land: in range, ready to cast, and with the mana for it. When Manners cannot tell, the buff goes out without it. Line of sight cannot be checked."] = "只有增益能加上時才會送出台詞：在範圍內、可以施放、法力足夠。Manners無法判斷時，只加增益、不送台詞。視線範圍無法檢查。"
L["In combat: changes here show once the fight ends."] = "戰鬥中：這裡的變更會在戰鬥結束後顯示。"
L["Lock position"] = "鎖定位置"
L["Unlock to drag the prompt; it will not cast until you lock it again."] = "解鎖後可拖曳提示框；重新鎖定前不會施法。"
L["unlocked, but the addon is |cffff8080off|r so there is no prompt to drag -- switch it on first."] = "已解鎖，但插件|cffff8080已關閉|r，沒有提示框可以拖曳——請先開啟插件。"
L["Where it sits"] = "放置位置"
L["Pick Above the action bars to put it back where it started."] = "選擇「快捷列上方」可放回原本的位置。"
L["Dragging the prompt afterwards sets this to Where I dragged it."] = "之後拖曳提示框，這裡會變成「我拖曳到的位置」。"
L["Above the action bars (default)"] = "快捷列上方（預設）"
L["Where I dragged it"] = "我拖曳到的位置"
L["Size"] = "大小"
L["Scale"] = "縮放"
L["Opacity"] = "不透明度"
L["Width"] = "寬度"
L["Height"] = "高度"
L["Style"] = "樣式"
L["Panel style"] = "面板樣式"
L["Panel colour"] = "面板顏色"
L["Colour marker by reason"] = "依原因為標記上色"
