L["Pale blue for your own target, amber for a favour owed, pink for somebody who asked, deeper blue for your group, grey for passers-by -- the order they are offered in."] = "淺藍色是你自己的目標，琥珀色是欠的人情，粉紅色是向你要增益的人，較深的藍色是隊友，灰色是路人——這也是提供增益的先後順序。"
L["A colour that shows why this person is on the prompt."] = "用顏色表示這個人為什麼出現在提示框上。"
L["Reason colours"] = "原因顏色"
L["The colour-blind set keeps the reasons apart for red-green colour blindness, in colours that differ in lightness too."] = "「色盲友善」配色讓紅綠色盲的人也能分辨各種原因，這些顏色的亮度也各不相同。"
L["Standard"] = "標準"
L["Colour-blind friendly"] = "色盲友善"
L["Marker colour"] = "標記顏色"
L["Used when Colour marker by reason is off."] = "「依原因為標記上色」關閉時使用。"
L["Colour marker"] = "顏色標記"
L["Framed panels have no stripe."] = "「邊框」面板沒有色條。"
L["Ring around the icon"] = "圖示外圈"
L["Stripe on the left edge"] = "左側色條"
L["Both"] = "兩者都要"
L["None"] = "無"
L["There is nothing left to colour: the ring is drawn behind the icon, which is switched off, and the framed look has no stripe."] = "已沒有可上色的地方：外圈畫在圖示後方，而圖示已關閉；「邊框」外觀也沒有色條。"
L["There is nothing left to colour: rounding the icon off replaces the ring with a mask, and the framed look has no stripe."] = "已沒有可上色的地方：將圖示裁成圓形會以遮罩取代外圈，而「邊框」外觀沒有色條。"
L["There is nothing left to colour: the ring is drawn behind the icon, which is switched off."] = "已沒有可上色的地方：外圈畫在圖示後方，而圖示已關閉。"
L["There is nothing left to colour: rounding the icon off replaces the ring with a mask."] = "已沒有可上色的地方：將圖示裁成圓形會以遮罩取代外圈。"
L["There is nothing left to colour: the framed look has no stripe."] = "已沒有可上色的地方：「邊框」外觀沒有色條。"
L["Getting my attention"] = "提醒方式"
L["Flash when someone buffs me"] = "有人為我加增益時閃爍"
L["Needs the icon, the stripe or Full animations."] = "需要顯示圖示或色條，或將「動畫」設為「完整」。"
L["Pulse until I buff them back"] = "持續脈動到我加回去為止"
L["Flash once"] = "閃一次"
L["Animations"] = "動畫"
L["Calm drops the light sweep, the shake and the fade-out."] = "「平靜」會去掉光線掃過、晃動和淡出效果。"
L["Calm (less movement)"] = "平靜（較少動態）"
L["It stays on screen in combat because your key binding would still cast; this only stops the flashes that say what a click did, red if it failed."] = "戰鬥中提示框仍會留在畫面上，因為你的按鍵仍會施法；這個選項只會停止顯示點擊結果的閃光（失敗時為紅色）。"
L["When a new person appears on the prompt."] = "有新的人出現在提示框上時。"
L["Sound"] = "音效"
L["%s |cff808080(not loaded)|r"] = "%s|cff808080（未載入）|r"
L["Only for people who buff me"] = "只限為我加增益的人"
L["Off, every new person makes a sound, passers-by included."] = "關閉時，每個新出現的人都會發出音效，包括路人。"
L["%s is silent. Pick a sound above."] = "%s 沒有聲音。請在上方選擇一個音效。"
L["Text"] = "文字"
L["Font"] = "字型"
L["Font size"] = "字型大小"
L["Text colour"] = "文字顏色"
L["Left at white, text turns dark on a light panel by itself. Other colours are used as picked, except for names while this is on:"] = "保持白色時，文字在淺色面板上會自動變深。其他顏色會照你選的使用，但以下選項開啟時，名字除外："
L["Colour names by class"] = "依職業為名字上色"
L["Show a second line"] = "顯示第二行"
L["Needs a prompt at least %d pixels tall."] = "提示框高度至少要%d像素。"
L["Icon and waiting list"] = "圖示與等待名單"
L["Show spell icon"] = "顯示法術圖示"
L["Icon size"] = "圖示大小"
L["Kept inside the prompt -- make it taller or wider first for a bigger icon."] = "圖示會保持在提示框內——想要更大的圖示，請先把提示框調高或調寬。"
L["This look sizes the icon from the prompt's height: %d at %d high. Make the prompt taller for a bigger icon."] = "此外觀依提示框高度決定圖示大小：%d（高度%d）。把提示框調高可讓圖示更大。"
L["The icon is held at %d to fit a prompt %d wide."] = "圖示維持在%d，以配合寬度%d的提示框。"
L["The icon is held at %d to fit a prompt %d high."] = "圖示維持在%d，以配合高度%d的提示框。"
L["Round the icon off"] = "將圖示裁成圓形"
L["Masks the icon into a circle. Reads more like a portrait than a spell, so it is off by default."] = "以遮罩把圖示裁成圓形。看起來比較像頭像而不像法術，所以預設為關閉。"
L["Show the global cooldown on the icon"] = "在圖示上顯示公共冷卻"
L["Sweeps the spell icon while the global cooldown runs, like your action bars, so you can see when the next press will go through."] = "公共冷卻時間內，法術圖示上會顯示冷卻動畫，就像快捷列一樣，讓你知道下一次按下何時會生效。"
L["Not in a fight while this is on:"] = "以下選項開啟時，戰鬥中不顯示："
L["Show how many are waiting"] = "顯示等待人數"
L["List the next few below"] = "在下方列出接下來的幾位"
L["How many to list"] = "列出人數"
L["Advanced"] = "進階"
L["The defaults suit most players; change these only if something bothers you."] = "預設值適合大多數玩家；只有遇到困擾時才需要調整。"
L["In combat: targeting changes apply once the fight ends."] = "戰鬥中：目標相關的變更會在戰鬥結束後套用。"
L["Put these back to default"] = "恢復預設值"
L["Put every setting on this page back to its default? Where the prompt sits, the lines you wrote and the never-offer list are kept."] = "要把這個頁面的所有設定恢復為預設值嗎？提示框的位置、你寫的台詞和永不提供名單都會保持不變。"
L["Ignore shields, heals and trinket procs"] = "忽略護盾、治療和飾品觸發"
L["Only class buffs such as Fortitude count as a favour to return."] = "只有真言術：韌這類職業增益才算要還的人情。"
L["The same goes for /thank people who buff me."] = "「對為我加增益的人使用 /thank」也是如此。"
L["Offer a buff back for (seconds)"] = "還人情時限（秒）"
L["How long someone who buffed you stays on offer."] = "為你加過增益的人在提示框上保留的時間。"
L["Stop sooner if they are probably gone"] = "提早移除可能已離開的人"
L["Someone who buffed you rarely can be range-checked, so they are let go after the time below."] = "為你加增益的人很少能檢查距離，所以會在下方的時間後移除。"
L["Let them go after (seconds)"] = "移除時限（秒）"
L["Counted from their buff, not from when they walked off."] = "從對方加增益時開始計算，而不是從對方走開時。"
L["Turning it off forgets what is already kept."] = "關閉時會忘掉已保留的人情。"
L["Timing"] = "計時"
L["Don't repeat a spell on someone for (seconds)"] = "同一法術對同一人的間隔（秒）"
L["In case the cast failed; right-clicking the prompt skips the person for this long."] = "以防施法失敗；右鍵點擊提示框會在這段時間內略過這個人。"
L["Check for people every (seconds)"] = "掃描間隔（秒）"
L["Lower reacts faster and uses a little more CPU."] = "數值越低反應越快，但會多用一點 CPU。"
L["Targeting"] = "選取目標"
L["Hand my target back afterwards"] = "施放後切回原目標"
L["The prompt has to target someone to buff them; this puts your old target back."] = "提示框必須先選取對方為目標才能加增益；這個選項會在之後切回原目標。"
L["Everything you can offer is cast on yourself and heard by your party, so the prompt never takes your target and has none to hand back."] = "你能提供的增益都是對自己施放、作用於你的隊伍，所以提示框從不改變你的目標，也就沒有目標需要切回。"
L["Exact position"] = "精確位置"
L["Left / right"] = "左右位置"
L["Up / down"] = "上下位置"
L["Prompt wording"] = "提示框文字"
L["Placeholders: {name} their name, {reason} why, {count} how many others are waiting, {class} their class, {buff} the spell, {time} time left on their buff (top-ups only)."] = "變數：{name} 對方名字、{reason} 原因、{count} 其他等待人數、{class} 對方職業、{buff} 法術、{time} 對方增益的剩餘時間（僅限補加）。"
L["The second line always shows the reason."] = "第二行一律顯示原因。"
L["First line"] = "第一行"
L["Reason text: my target"] = "原因文字：我的目標"
L["Shown when your target is first in line."] = "你的目標排在第一位時顯示。"
L["Reason text: buffed me"] = "原因文字：為我加了增益"
L["Reason text: asked in chat"] = "原因文字：在聊天中要增益"
L["Shown for someone who asked in chat."] = "對在聊天中向你要增益的人顯示。"
L["Reason text: my own buff"] = "原因文字：我自己的增益"
L["Shown when the prompt offers you your own buff."] = "提示框提供你自己的增益時顯示。"
L["Reason text: my group"] = "原因文字：我的隊友"
L["Reason text: passer-by"] = "原因文字：路人"
L["Reason text: top-up"] = "原因文字：補加"
L["{time} is how long theirs has left."] = "{time} 是對方增益的剩餘時間。"
L["Reason text: can't tell"] = "原因文字：無法確認"
L["Shown when the game hides whether they already have it."] = "遊戲隱藏了對方是否已有增益時顯示。"
L["Messages in chat"] = "聊天訊息"
L["Log every click (noisy)"] = "記錄每次點擊（訊息很多）"
L["Prints what the prompt held and what the game did, to work out why a cast failed."] = "印出提示框當時的內容和遊戲的處理結果，用來找出施法失敗的原因。"
L["What Manners can see"] = "Manners 能看到什麼"
L["Class: |cffffffff%s|r"] = "職業：|cffffffff%s|r"
L["learned: |cff00ff00yes|r"] = "已學會：|cff00ff00是|r"
L["learned: |cff808080no|r"] = "已學會：|cff808080否|r"
L["can see who has it: |cff00ff00yes|r"] = "能看出誰有：|cff00ff00是|r"
L["can see who has it: |cffff8080no|r"] = "能看出誰有：|cffff8080否|r"
L["this client has never heard of spell %s, so Manners will never offer this one. That is a mistake in Manners -- please report it."] = "此客戶端完全不認得法術 %s，所以 Manners 永遠不會提供這個增益。這是 Manners 的錯誤，請回報。"
L["this client doesn't know spell %s, so somebody already carrying that version may be offered this anyway. That is a mistake in Manners -- please report it."] = "此客戶端不認得法術 %s，所以已經帶有這個版本的人仍可能出現在提示框上。這是 Manners 的錯誤，請回報。"
L["Where Manners cannot see a buff, people are still offered, but some may already have it."] = "Manners 看不到的增益仍會提供，但有些人可能已經有了。"
L["Flagged for PvP"] = "PvP 狀態"
L["Passer-by distance: %s"] = "路人距離：%s"
L["Nothing to report: this character has no buffs it can put on another player."] = "沒有可回報的內容：這個角色沒有能加在其他玩家身上的增益。"
L["Errors this session"] = "本次登入的錯誤"
L["(%d in all this session, %d kept -- |cffffd100%s|r)"] = "（本次登入共%d個錯誤，保留%d個——|cffffd100%s|r）"
L["(%d in all this session -- |cffffd100%s|r)"] = "（本次登入共%d個錯誤——|cffffd100%s|r）"
L["Nothing has gone wrong this session."] = "本次登入沒有發生任何錯誤。"
L["Reporting a bug"] = "回報錯誤"
L["Hide the report"] = "隱藏報告"
L["Copy for a bug report"] = "複製錯誤報告"
L["Opens a box with the build, what this client allows, the settings that matter and anything that has broken, ready to copy."] = "開啟一個文字框，內含版本號、客戶端允許的功能、重要的設定，以及所有發生過的錯誤，可以直接複製。"
L["Every character uses the Default profile unless you pick another here; make one per character for different settings."] = "除非在這裡另選，否則每個角色都使用「預設」設定檔；想要不同設定，就為每個角色各建一個。"
L["Share as text"] = "以文字分享"
L["Copy your settings as text to share, or paste text someone gave you. Pasting keeps your own on/off, lock, position, minimap button and chat options, and never turns on Say a line."] = "把你的設定複製成文字分享，或貼上別人給你的文字。貼上時會保留你自己的開關、鎖定、位置、小地圖按鈕和聊天選項，也絕不會開啟「加增益時說句話」。"
L["Hide the text"] = "隱藏文字"
L["Show my settings as text"] = "以文字顯示我的設定"
L["Shows your settings as text below, ready to copy; %s does the same."] = "在下方以文字顯示你的設定，可直接複製；%s 也有同樣效果。"
L["Click in the box, press Ctrl+A to select it all, then Ctrl+C to copy (Cmd on a Mac)."] = "點擊方框，按 Ctrl+A 全選，再按 Ctrl+C 複製（Mac 請用 Cmd）。"
L["Paste settings here, then press Accept"] = "在此貼上設定，然後按「接受」"
L["Replaces this profile's settings; %s puts yours back."] = "會取代這個設定檔的設定；%s 可恢復你原本的設定。"
